3acfb6097beec39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/commits/46f03e2529c6f1a1525ea2c7b3acfb6097beec39"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50881320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsSauraj","id":50881320,"login":"itsSauraj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwODgxMzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/commits/eb460077f2c3d778c55d4910e6c60022efd3db88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:13:09Z","email":"sauraj.contact@gmail.com","name":"Saurabh Yadav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:13:09Z","email":"sauraj.contact@gmail.com","name":"Saurabh Yadav"},"message":"feat(docs): mark ScrollArea new in the sidebar with the pulse dot\n\nThe Agent skill entry already carries `isNew`, and a component that landed this\nweek deserves the same mark. It could not have it: `NavItem` has the flag, but\n`COMPONENT_GROUPS` carries `names: string[]`, so the components half of the nav\nhad nowhere to put one.\n\nAdded `NEW_COMPONENTS` as a set rather than widening `names` to objects. Five\nother call sites read those entries as plain names (the landing page counts, the\ncomponents index, the sidebar, and the codegen''s grouped/phantom checks), and all\nfive would have had to change to carry one boolean.\n\nSame contract as `isNew`, and stated on the set: entries are meant to be DELETED a\nrelease or two after the component lands. A dot that never leaves stops meaning\n\"new\" and becomes decoration, and it keeps announcing \", new\" to a screen reader\nlong after it is true.\n\nVerified in the built sidebar: two dots, on Agent skill and ScrollArea, and no\nothers. Each is aria-hidden with the visually-hidden \", new\" beside it, so the\nmark is announced once rather than twice or not at all.","tree":{"sha":"e242d3b2e732ff0ef3133d9ed4c86a020047a73f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/git/trees/e242d3b2e732ff0ef3133d9ed4c86a020047a73f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/git/commits/eb460077f2c3d778c55d4910e6c60022efd3db88","verification":{"payload":"tree e242d3b2e732ff0ef3133d9ed4c86a020047a73f\nparent fb97a241bd528e1d3a0277dcdf33bc3ed9547590\nauthor Saurabh Yadav <sauraj.contact@gmail.com> 1787137989 +0530\ncommitter Saurabh Yadav <sauraj.contact@gmail.com> 1787137989 +0530\n\nfeat(docs): mark ScrollArea new in the sidebar with the pulse dot\n\nThe Agent skill entry already carries `isNew`, and a component that landed this\nweek deserves the same mark. It could not have it: `NavItem` has the flag, but\n`COMPONENT_GROUPS` carries `names: string[]`, so the components half of the nav\nhad nowhere to put one.\n\nAdded `NEW_COMPONENTS` as a set rather than widening `names` to objects. Five\nother call sites read those entries as plain names (the landing page counts, the\ncomponents index, the sidebar, and the codegen''s grouped/phantom checks), and all\nfive would have had to change to carry one boolean.\n\nSame contract as `isNew`, and stated on the set: entries are meant to be DELETED a\nrelease or two after the component lands. A dot that never leaves stops meaning\n\"new\" and becomes decoration, and it keeps announcing \", new\" to a screen reader\nlong after it is true.\n\nVerified in the built sidebar: two dots, on Agent skill and ScrollArea, and no\nothers. Each is aria-hidden with the visually-hidden \", new\" beside it, so the\nmark is announced once rather than twice or not at all.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQHPBAABCAA5FiEEmTLsOhbjX1ndSoeT9vAKBAaqrIkFAmqFj8UbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMiwxAAoJEPbwCgQGqqyJ2SUMAM4mOB6XBXCzrAJxcEqi\n774rcLMaxM7PaBuTuwZ+YZHVUCUUgm41D62e+zFgcpwcNJJCJW4XP0z/tMFV6mlF\ns5D1rPyuJf+k/2XJnvhfm3hOHRzALDxu3pnkYQ2D1E72/M5HBxUbyn2WpN0VfwUN\nkOgPKz42GooBZISl4YzAkj8FyTIUAstz6p0KphEcpmZ55f7MoDvtPpGDM/uGee/m\nDwM+sL81BNmHYrmidpbLIqwq9mqXvYnL5P4ne2US2Z73wmlDzT2FYygMwFLu0ZhD\n7ZkqoQDRyKGkKuHIcQL6DkAB17aPGvVCF1UkqsXyjDk1s9RzuOxEEBEzCXdcduJD\nMLAGtqdpVqtPWqNAik50Hn8CX5H1NcijHSxMTybvAdtyqy06y1hA/SqRbegDJlFH\nEE7VnFXdwWdcCNuLvsaPTlDj4eyOz+1/SDBFuQmoWciB5EDXC699hnSAQ0B5n/aK\n4P9x2apJ2wJpgxPDu2AOqnlcNTWRvZA1UN58jC5tRTUwtQ==\n=yOLQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-19T11:13:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50881320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsSauraj","id":50881320,"login":"itsSauraj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwODgxMzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj","user_view_type":