\n- Created design-rules.md to outline the token layer and design principles.\n- Added frameworks.md detailing setup instructions for various frameworks including Next.js, Vite, and Laravel.\n- Introduced npm-packages.md to describe the npm packages under the @velobitsio scope and their dependencies.\n- Documented the @velobits shadcn registry, including installation commands and component structure.\n- Updated vercel.json to include CORS and cache control headers for skills routes.","tree":{"sha":"cb4112efe03c3aa66e5f6f4b5b44be992225e4af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/git/trees/cb4112efe03c3aa66e5f6f4b5b44be992225e4af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/git/commits/59ebb8026fc301e3292971fe0299297d1beb54d1","verification":{"payload":"tree cb4112efe03c3aa66e5f6f4b5b44be992225e4af\nparent c19e0b124677664d17c43bd1328ceff4c293e557\nauthor Saurabh Yadav <sauraj.contact@gmail.com> 1787126797 +0530\ncommitter Saurabh Yadav <sauraj.contact@gmail.com> 1787126797 +0530\n\nAdd design rules, framework setup instructions, npm package details, and shadcn registry documentation\n\n- Created design-rules.md to outline the token layer and design principles.\n- Added frameworks.md detailing setup instructions for various frameworks including Next.js, Vite, and Laravel.\n- Introduced npm-packages.md to describe the npm packages under the @velobitsio scope and their dependencies.\n- Documented the @velobits shadcn registry, including installation commands and component structure.\n- Updated vercel.json to include CORS and cache control headers for skills routes.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQHPBAABCAA5FiEEmTLsOhbjX1ndSoeT9vAKBAaqrIkFAmqFZA0bFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMiwxAAoJEPbwCgQGqqyJH90MAJii0rGITcG+5tfUy23F\ntMStHrI7uspeFRzsGUkQCS5VyhseVHokIBgWFH1V1KpVG7a1dLvdtW0bMbbABXZz\nKHQiXoRJy9RIgsE84j/HE7Eoi4NQyPDG42nwCfbf1AjHUtILw0ciGqSezRLrRsUu\nMFTN35z+M6IjeZcSloGzxqDObnqCceM+t4pwoyHJIMiy39rbOnN