tps://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/commits/6db4c5f30d908f275eec0f107983e2b884bcb4c0"}],"sha":"30b77fe0fed65370548e69cac6e9868df67daf3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/commits/30b77fe0fed65370548e69cac6e9868df67daf3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50881320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsSauraj","id":50881320,"login":"itsSauraj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwODgxMzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/commits/69db0b63b4dd4b91559173b6ab47a888164d4a90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T13:22:46Z","email":"sauraj.contact@gmail.com","name":"Saurabh Yadav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T13:22:46Z","email":"sauraj.contact@gmail.com","name":"Saurabh Yadav"},"message":"feat(icons): add 113 glyphs, fix the count, and make the docs render it\n\n## The heading was rendering a thrown Error\n\n`icon-grid.tsx` carries ''use client'' and exported ICON_COUNT; `page.tsx` is a\nserver component that imported it. Every export of a client module becomes a\nclient REFERENCE when a server component imports it, plain values included, and\nReact hands back a proxy that throws when called. So `${ICON_COUNT}` in the\nheading stringified the proxy''s own source and the page read:\n\n  The set , function(){throw Error(\"Attempted to call ICON_COUNT() from the\n  server but ICON_COUNT is on the client...\")} icons\n\nThe number was never wrong. On the server it was never a number. The list now\nlives in ./icons-data, which carries no directive, so both graphs import the\nvalue itself and nothing is proxied.\n\n## 88 -> 201 icons\n\nFrom the two FixMyText sources never folded in: 104 editor tool glyphs, which\nexisted only inside a lookup map keyed by tool id, and 9 from the pricing pages.\nAll 104 are distinct and none collided with an existing name, so nothing was\nrenamed. The design-system set there needed nothing; its 55 were already present\nin full, confirmed by diff rather than assumed.\n\nLeft out, because they cannot honour the contract: NumIcon is parameterised on a\ncaller-supplied number, so it is not a glyph; TwoIcon hardcodes #007ACC and draws\nwith <text>, so it inherits neither colour nor font.\n\nThe count is asserted by a test, and every place that stated it is updated\ntogether: the test, both READMEs, the package description, both module\ndocblocks, the docs landing table and the grid''s own comments. The 0.1.0\nCHANGELOG entry keeps 88, because that is what 0.1.0 shipped.\n\nWhole-set size budget 6 kB -> 9 kB for a 2.3x larger set; it measures 7.31 kB, so\nthe ceiling keeps headroom rather than being fitted to today''s number. The\ntree-shaking gate is untouched and still passes at 234 B of 400 B.\n\n## Previews size to their content\n\nThe frame was min-h-[22rem], so every demo got the same tall box whatever it\nheld: two Inputs marooned in the middle, a DataTable overflowing. Height now\ncomes from the demo, with a 6rem floor so a lone Badge does not collapse the\nframe into a strip too thin to read as a boundary.\n\n## MDX prose\n\nA repo-wide em-dash strip had replaced every \"—\" with \",\", which left 67 floating\ncommas in rendered docs prose, three sentences opening with a comma, one line\nbreak starting with one, and a page title reading \"Icons , VeloBits UI\". Fixed by\npunctuation that suits each sentence rather than by reinstating the dash, and the\ntitle separator is now a middle dot. Code blocks and inline code were excluded\nfrom the pass, so no sample changed.\n\nVerified: format, lint, typecheck 7/7, build 4/4, size 6/6, package:check 10/10,\ntests 1014 icons + 500 ui + 453 tokens. Confirmed against the built HTML: zero\noccurrences of \"Attempted to call\", heading reads \"The set: 201 icons\", intro\nreads \"All 201 of them\", preview frame emits min-h-[6rem].","tree":{"sha":"c597fa184797beac7660710a02a5a0588ead1778","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/git/trees/c597fa184797beac7660710a02a5a0588ead1778"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/git/commits/69db0b63b4dd4b91559173b6ab47a888164d4a90","verification":{"payload":"tree c597fa184797beac7660710a02a5a0588ead1778\nparent 76bc52c1191925b3a6b49062d39c2cb0e436e407\nauthor Saurabh Yadav <sauraj.contact@gmail.com> 1787059366 +0530\ncommitter Saurabh Yadav <sauraj.contact@gmail.com> 1787059366 +0530\n\nfeat(icons): add 113 glyphs, fix the count, and make the docs render it\n\n## The heading was rendering a thrown Error\n\n`icon-grid.tsx` carries ''use client'' and exported ICON_COUNT; `page.tsx` is a\nserver component that imported it. Every export of a client module becomes a\nclient REFERENCE when a server component imports it, plain values included, and\nReact hands back a proxy that throws when called. So `${ICON_COUNT}` in the\nheading stringified the proxy''s own source and the page read:\n\n  The set , function(){throw Error(\"Attempted to call ICON_COUNT() from the\n  server but ICON_COUNT is on the client...\")} icons\n\nThe number was never wrong. On the server it was never a number. The list now\nlives in ./icons-data, which carries no directive, so both graphs import the\nvalue itself and nothing is proxied.\n\n## 88 -> 201 icons\n\nFrom the two FixMyText sources never folded in: 104 editor tool glyphs, which\nexisted only inside a lookup map keyed by tool id, and 9 from the pricing pages.\nAll 104 are distinct and none collided with an existing name, so nothing was\nrenamed. The design-system set there needed nothing; its 55 were already present\nin full, confirmed by diff rather than assumed.\n\nLeft out, because they cannot honour the contract: NumIcon is parameterised on a\ncaller-supplied number, so it is not a glyph; TwoIcon hardcodes #007ACC and draws\nwith <text>, so it inherits neither colour nor font.\n\nThe count is asserted by a test, and every place that stated it is updated\ntogether: the test, both READMEs, the package description, both module\ndocblocks, the docs landing table and the grid''s own comments. The 0.1.0\nCHANGELOG entry keeps 88, because that is what 0.1.0 shipped.\n\nWhole-set size budget 6 kB -> 9 kB for a 2.3x larger set; it measures 7.31 kB, so\nthe ceiling keeps headroom rather than being fitted to today''s number. The\ntree-shaking gate is untouched and still passes at 234 B of 400 B.\n\n## Previews size to their content\n\nThe frame was min-h-[22rem], so every demo got the same tall box whatever it\nheld: two Inputs marooned in the middle, a DataTable overflowing. Height now\ncomes from the demo, with a 6rem floor so a lone Badge does not collapse the\nframe into a strip too thin to read as a boundary.\n\n## MDX prose\n\nA repo-wide em-dash strip had replaced every \"—\" with \",\", which left 67 floating\ncommas in rendered docs prose, three sentences opening with a comma, one line\nbreak starting with one, and a page title reading \"Icons , VeloBits UI\". Fixed by\npunctuation that suits each sentence rather than by reinstating the dash, and the\ntitle separator is now a middle dot. Code blocks and inline code were excluded\nfrom the pass, so no sample changed.\n\nVerified: format, lint, typecheck 7/7, build 4/4, size 6/6, package:check 10/10,\ntests 1014 icons + 500 ui + 453 tokens. Confirmed against the built HTML: zero\noccurrences of \"Attempted to call\", heading reads \"The set: 201 icons\", intro\nreads \"All 201 of them\", preview frame emits min-h-[6rem].\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQHPBAABCAA5FiEEmTLsOhbjX1ndSoeT9vAKBAaqrIkFAmqEXKYbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMiwxAAoJEPbwCgQGqqyJ/jEMAIcl0vSXIBpvIMyJi+KC\n7coMWeGDRLe5lLtLfrK7UTxMEAUbXXxd+u3WyoBK4R6Hn3bXTRcV25oKfE62vKGv\ntLQNkmX/3nuBk7EiMsSKCeHew3QJTDtqS+zSWmx50J8zgO/9lLFqTGB3OqtadpKk\nzG54+IRisDugaK+KBd9eCHwp4ilA+iMcGRStddo92GOgAv3DCcj+KkByUDOzSMR8\n1VuXW6lg0jdJNSEwn/9Qe2gcFrui1s/AtghYdjTJp9ANMLXIMEUTUOdfyUflKyYo\n964r+ePpKDBAlXnXjUZCsbODCxZ3FjiB6nOIUDiwnUskEq7JSrfJDnzHdfpWFCLT\ndMdsSAkKIJvRyDzc7DInhzkm1Nhba+nNhWiG/UlCP5Yk3f7/ZkVO6A4tJ4BLoERU\nXpY3k94+ktxTRqLRHLYKwvmISag+sqwZkOf5NAlHvvFAjULmx9xS157k+921qKVC\nMc2OOCtLqHwwEZkJBJfiYSeG9B+Vs++ZsqZjEXsniYPFVg==\n=vbtP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T13:23:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50881320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itsSauraj","id":50881320,"login":"itsSauraj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwODgxMzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itsSauraj","user_vie