thor":{"date":"2026-08-10T10:43:27Z","email":"snency16@gmail.com","name":"Sojitra Nency"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T10:43:27Z","email":"snency16@gmail.com","name":"Sojitra Nency"},"message":"feat: add motion component and update barrel exclusions\n\n- Introduced a new `motion` component for page transitions and list staggers, which is a subpath-only export to avoid unnecessary bundle size increases.\n- Updated `BARREL_EXCLUDED` to include `motion` alongside `form` to prevent unwanted imports in the barrel.\n- Enhanced various UI components (e.g., button, checkbox, input) with new styles and behaviors, including control states and transitions.\n- Added new color variants (e.g., `rose`, `on-danger`) to the registry for better theming options.\n- Improved accessibility and performance by refining animation handling and reducing unnecessary re-renders in the motion components.","tree":{"sha":"7ede60fc32a6b549d605c57daa1e7b6cee09bca3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/git/trees/7ede60fc32a6b549d605c57daa1e7b6cee09bca3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VeloBits/velobits-UI/git/commits/b3a583af166d3d8a80c6c36ea6a68fb08b871ae8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78294964?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojitra-nency/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojitra-nency/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojitra-nency/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojitra-nency/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sojitra-nency","id":78294964,"login":"sojitra-nency","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4Mjk0OTY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojitra-nency/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sojitra-nency/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.co