mail":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feature: Rsbuild + share style (#1)\n\n* fix(mfe): resolve runtime, routing, and compilation errors for Rsbuild migration\n\n- Fix app-shell webpack config to handle Rspack plugin from Nx.\n- Update mfe-auth entry point to remoteEntry.js and global name to mfe_auth.\n- Fix mfe-dashboard projects template syntax error.\n- Intercept USER_LOGGED_IN event in app-shell to handle routing independently.\n- Add tds-ui package overrides to ensure identical @angular/cdk versions.\n\n* feat: initialize backend routes and project dependencies\n\n* refactor: restructure core library with modularized services, guards, and standardized NGRX store utilities.\n\n* refactor: restructure core library modules and migrate auth features to mfe-auth application\n\n* feat: implement dynamic remote style loading system and add pagination to reporting module\n\n* feat: update module federation remote endpoints, refactor logout logic via AuthService, and add style debugging logs\n\n* feat: implement dynamic Module Federation remote registration via centralized configuration and backend API manifest","tree":{"sha":"b59c5b8ced07ed493523445622262ee68cbfc87f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobao0303/AngularMFE_DEMO/git/trees/b59c5b8ced07ed493523445622262ee68cbfc87f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/baobao0303/AngularMFE_DEMO/git/commits/1385a06c8c7f08dd51deeb81a709fb58c773ffd2","verification":{"payload":"tree b59c5b8ced07ed493523445622262ee68cbfc87f\nparent b06631a2eef771783f7f28e990766f8e26fc21bd\nauthor Lê Tấn Bảo Bảo <110554959+baobao0303@users.noreply.github.com> 1786324028 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786324028 +0700\n\nFeature: Rsbuild + share style (#1)\n\n* fix(mfe): resolve runtime, routing, and compilation errors for Rsbuild migration\n\n- Fix app-shell webpack config to handle Rspack plugin from Nx.\n- Update mfe-auth entry point to remoteEntry.js and global name to mfe_auth.\n- Fix mfe-dashboard projects