ment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T15:47:52Z","email":"74209735+omerfarukkanli@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ömer Faruk Kanlı"},"message":"docs: add full README and remove all source comments\n\nEvery decision is now documented in README.md as what/why, including the\nseven cross-app data channels, the three isolation layers, the CSS load\norder pitfall and the eight bugs hit while building the project. Source\ncomments are removed as the reasoning now lives in one place.\n\nAlso aligns the shell''s catalog placeholder with the catalog''s own layout,\nso the handover between the two loading states no longer shifts the page.\n\nfeat: add Module Federation 2.0 micro-frontend example with Docker\n\nShell (host) + auth/products/cart remotes + shared package.\nRspack/Rsbuild, runtime remote registration, cross-MFE store and\nevent bus, per-remote isolation, standalone-capable remotes,\ndev and prod Docker setups.\n\nfeat: rebuild UI as a real storefront with Tailwind + shadcn-style components\n\n- Replace inline-style design layer with Tailwind v4 and a shared theme\n- Add shadcn-style primitives (Button, Card, Badge, Input, Select, ...)\n- Vector product illustrations instead of emoji\n- Storefront layout: promo bar, header with cart, filters, footer\n- Richer catalog (12 products, brands, discounts, specs, related items)\n- Cart with quantity steppers, free-shipping progress and coupons\n- Six documented cross-app data-transfer patterns with a live demo page\n- Register capability providers at boot so cart actions work immediately\n- injectStyles + per-entry stylesheet import so remote CSS reaches the host\n\nfix(products): restructure catalog page layout\n\nAdd page heading with result count, keep the category strip above the\ntwo-column area, align the filter sidebar with the toolbar, equalise card\nheights (clamped titles, fixed price block) and replace the icon-only add\nbutton with a full-width \"Sepete ekle\" action.\n\nfix: make styling deterministic and add skeleton loading states\n\nEach app emitted its own Tailwind bundle with a different subset of\nutilities. Stylesheet insertion order across federated apps is not\nguaranteed, so a conflicting pair such as `hidden` and `lg:block` resolved\ndifferently between reloads and the catalog page rendered correctly only\nsome of the time. Every app now scans all sources, producing byte-identical\nCSS where load order no longer matters.\n\nAlso replaces the bare spinner with layout-shaped skeletons so a refresh no\nlonger shows an empty content area while a remote is downloading.\n\nfix(shell): match loading placeholder to the route being loaded\n\nThe cart route rendered a product-grid skeleton before the cart appeared.\nEach registry entry now declares its own skeleton shape.\n\nfix(shared): honour an explicit null loading placeholder\n\nMfeBoundary resolved its placeholder with `pending ?? <PageSkeleton />`, so\npassing `pending={null}` to mean \"render nothing\" still fell through to the\ndefault. The cart badge sits inside a small icon link in the header, so a\nfull-page skeleton was painted there and spilled over the header.\n\nResolves the placeholder with an explicit undefined check instead, matching\nhow the error `fallback` prop already behaved.","tree":{"sha":"aeefd651c328b31fa4756b0d93585b464aed8ad5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omerfarukkanli/micro_frontend_example/git/trees/aeefd651c328b31fa4756b0d93585b464aed8ad5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omerfarukkanli/micro_frontend_example/git/commits/96931e85decaf2ca4dabe368f1e1248903e85d4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74209735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omerfarukkanli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omerfarukkanli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omerfarukkanli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omerfarukkanli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omerfarukkanli","id":74209735,"login":"omerfarukkanli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjA5NzM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omerfarukkanli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omerfarukkanli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omerfarukkanli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omerfarukkanli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omerfarukkanli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omerfarukkanli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/omerfarukkanli/micro_frontend_example/commit/96931e85decaf2ca4dabe368f1e1248903e85d4f","node_id":"C_kwDOTu3RXNoAKDk2OTMxZTg1ZGVjYWYyY2E0ZGFiZTM2OGYxZTEyNDg5MDNlODVkNGY","parents":[],"sha":"96931e85decaf2ca4dabe368f1e1248903e85d4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omerfarukkanli/micro_frontend_example/commits/96931e85decaf2ca4dabe368f1e1248903e85d4f"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/omerfarukkanli/micro_frontend_example/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=96931e85decaf2ca4dabe368f1e1248903e85d4f&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A01%3A35.132Z"}');
