9+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c6d9e4156fb22e774806951b98f32e6cfe9c6c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dancypher/PayPulse/git/trees/3c6d9e4156fb22e774806951b98f32e6cfe9c6c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dancypher/PayPulse/git/commits/32ba36d767b932ff04c668c3fff16e5e65fae531","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/313455552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dancypher","id":313455552,"login":"dancypher","node_id":"U_kgDOEq7zwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dancypher/PayPulse/commit/32ba36d767b932ff04c668c3fff16e5e65fae531","node_id":"C_kwDOTu7AzNoAKDMyYmEzNmQ3NjdiOTMyZmYwNGM2NjhjM2ZmZjE2ZTVlNjVmYWU1MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dancypher/PayPulse/commit/1fb07ce667936c1901fb77fb1423c556cf7cdff4","sha":"1fb07ce667936c1901fb77fb1423c556cf7cdff4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dancypher/PayPulse/commits/1fb07ce667936c1901fb77fb1423c556cf7cdff4"}],"sha":"32ba36d767b932ff04c668c3fff16e5e65fae531","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dancypher/PayPulse/commits/32ba36d767b932ff04c668c3fff16e5e65fae531"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/313455552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dancypher","id":313455552,"login":"dancypher","node_id":"U_kgDOEq7zwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dancypher/PayPulse/commits/1fb07ce667936c1901fb77fb1423c556cf7cdff4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T16:46:48Z","email":"d4ncypher@gmail.com","name":"dancypher"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T16:46:48Z","email":"d4ncypher@gmail.com","name":"dancypher"},"message":"Fix cross-pod real-time notification delivery via Redis pub/sub relay\n\nBug: notification-service''s STOMP simple broker keeps connected-user sessions\nin-memory per-pod. With 2 replicas, a Kafka-consumed event could be processed\nby a different pod than the one holding the target user''s live WebSocket\nsession, silently dropping the real-time push (notification was still\npersisted, just not delivered live).\n\nFix: every pod now publishes outgoing notifications to a shared Redis\nPub/Sub channel (paypulse:notifications) instead of pushing to STOMP\ndirectly. All pods subscribe to the same channel; each independently\nattempts local delivery, so whichever pod actually holds the session\ndelivers it. WebSocket/STOMP transport to the browser is unchanged - this\nis purely a backend-to-backend relay.\n\n- notification-service: add RedisConfig, NotificationBroadcastEvent,\n  NotificationRedisPublisher/Subscriber; NotificationService now publishes\n  via Redis instead of calling SimpMessagingTemplate directly\n- pom.xml: add spring-boot-starter-data-redis\n- application.yml: add spring.data.redis.* config (matches wallet-service)\n- k8s: add REDIS_HOST/PORT/PASSWORD env vars to notification-service,\n  reusing the existing shared redis cluster service\n- update NotificationServiceTest to mock NotificationRedisPublisher\n- docs: add NOTIFICATION_REDIS_RELAY_FIX.md explaining the bug, why Redis\n  pub/sub (not a WebSocket replacement), and how to verify\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2400a49070946ff306b786a03afb993f113bc57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dancypher/PayPulse/git/trees/c2400a49070946ff306b786a03afb993f113bc57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dancypher/PayPulse/git/commits/1fb07ce667936c1901fb77fb1423c556cf7cdff4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/313455552?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dancypher","id":313455552,"login":"dancypher","node_id":"U_kgDOEq7zwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dancypher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_ur