ylahurd-lt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaylahurd-lt/operational-excellence/commits/16c62c7e3998eb4534999fcdaca4a0d909caeb11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:06:37Z","email":"kayla.hurd@locumtenens.com","name":"Kayla Hurd"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:06:37Z","email":"kayla.hurd@locumtenens.com","name":"Kayla Hurd"},"message":"Replace demo persona switcher with real login (accounts + sessions)\n\nAdds real username/password authentication: password_hash on demo_users\n(node:crypto scrypt, no native deps), a sessions table backing an httpOnly\ncookie, and /auth/login, /auth/logout, /auth/me routes. requireUser()\nresolves the caller from the session cookie instead of an x-demo-user-id\nheader. Frontend gets a real login screen in place of the \"Viewing as\"\ndropdown, with a logout button and session-expiry handling.\n\nThis is real login, not real SSO - manifest.yaml still declares\nauth.needs_sso as a dev seam for the hardening team to wire an actual SSO\nprovider onto later. Every seeded account shares one prototype-only\npassword (printed by npm run seed).","tree":{"sha":"5e7d065d8112b79536ecd2394ae791aa268e9ae6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaylahurd-lt/operational-excellence/git/trees/5e7d065d8112b79536ecd2394ae791aa268e9ae6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaylahurd-lt/operational-excellence/git/commits/16c62c7e3998eb4534999fcdaca4a0d909caeb11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307720176?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaylahurd-lt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaylahurd-lt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaylahurd-lt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaylahurd-lt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://git