.com/users/kaylahurd-lt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaylahurd-lt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaylahurd-lt/operational-excellence/commits/0a293b01adc6f943291038afc7d005d61b7943b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T13:02:05Z","email":"kayla.hurd@locumtenens.com","name":"Kayla Hurd"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T13:02:05Z","email":"kayla.hurd@locumtenens.com","name":"Kayla Hurd"},"message":"Scaffold OpEx points-tracking prototype as a micro-app-starter package\n\nFastify + node:sqlite API behind a data-access seam, role-based\npermissions (Admin/EA/Manager), a calculation engine that keeps\nconfirmed formulas separate from TBD ones, audit logging, year\nlifecycle + rollover, and a vanilla-JS frontend covering the\nDashboard/Group Scoring/Rules/Access/Audit screens from the OpEx\nprototype spec. 50 passing tests, fake seed data only.","tree":{"sha":"a9d784a5ab13cd73ce77aa32e9c84d9f03833a48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaylahurd-lt/operational-excellence/git/trees/a9d784a5ab13cd73ce77aa32e9c84d9f03833a48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kaylahurd-lt/operational-excellence/git/commits/0a293b01adc6f943291038afc7d005d61b7943b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307720176?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaylahurd-lt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaylahurd-lt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaylahurd-lt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaylahurd-lt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kaylahurd-lt","id":307720176,"login":"kaylahurd-lt","node_id":"U_kgDOEldv8A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaylahurd-lt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users