15212cac9c851f11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:18:31Z","email":"me@francisdesjardins.ca","name":"Francis Desjardins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:18:31Z","email":"me@francisdesjardins.ca","name":"Francis Desjardins"},"message":"chore(tooling): swap prettier for oxfmt, and clear out what no longer answers\n\nMeasured before it was decided: 649 files, 6 divergent, and all six the same\nshape — a union Prettier 3.9 wrapped onto one line, split one member per line.\nEvery markdown file matched byte for byte, so `API.md` and its matrix test came\nthrough untouched. `yarn format:check` goes from 8.7s to 1.6s.\n\nFour call sites format through the Node API. It returns the original text with\ndiagnostics beside it rather than throwing, so `scripts/oxfmt.mjs` raises — a\ncaller written against the old shape reads an unparsable `@example` as clean —\nand it is the one place that knows where the config is, oxfmt shipping no\n`resolveConfig`. `sortPackageJson` is on, and deduplicated a keyword on its\nfirst run.\n\nCI: `.github/actions/setup` absorbs the block six jobs repeated, every job\ninstalls on a cache miss, `yarn lint` gains `--deny-warnings` to match the local\ngate, `component-focus` becomes a leg, and `list` joins the reporter there.\n\nRemoved: `scripts/vite-plugin-react-compiler.mjs` (no importer), the build\nconfig''s `server:` block, the `preview` and `test:shard` scripts, `rimraf`,\n`cross-env`, `npm-check-updates`, a phantom `tests` exclude, and three\nagent-instruction files that all still called this a React library.\n`manualChunks` becomes `output.codeSplitting` — same four vendor chunks.","tree":{"sha":"7d8e85b6b53b5d0ef1efba67e317cf1a9686d75e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/git/trees/7d8e85b6b53b5d0ef1efba67e317cf1a9686d75e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/git/commits/8f8c8151b6bf0f975c581f8615212cac9c851f11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2743830?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francisdesjardins","id":2743830,"login":"francisdesjardins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDM4MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/francisdesjardins/umbra/commit/8f8c8151b6bf0f975c581f8615212cac9c851f11","node_id":"C_kwDOTvVQm9oAKDhmOGM4MTUxYjZiZjBmOTc1YzU4MWY4NjE1MjEyY2FjOWM4NTFmMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/francisdesjardins/umbra/commit/9fa7ba350e1296d5f6765346fef22b90c785d91b","sha":"9fa7ba350e1296d5f6765346fef22b90c785d91b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/commits/9fa7ba350e1296d5f6765346fef22b90c785d91b"}],"sha":"8f8c8151b6bf0f975c581f8615212cac9c851f11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/commits/8f8c8151b6bf0f975c581f8615212cac9c851f11"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2743830?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francisdesjardins","id":2743830,"login":"francisdesjardins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDM4MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/commits/9fa7ba350e1296d5f6765346fef22b90c785d91b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T05:23:06Z","email":"me@francisdesjardins.ca","name":"Francis Desjardins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T05:23:06Z","email":"me@francisdesjardins.ca","name":"Francis Desjardins"},"message":"test: the component suite fails on an exception nobody caught\n\nA test asserts what it looks at, so an exception thrown after the work it\nmeasures leaves every assertion green — which is how a Solid harness threw on\nevery disposal for as long as it did. The CT `test` carries a second automatic\nfixture beside coverage: it listens on `pageerror` for the life of the test and\nfails it on anything that arrives, stack included, so a red in CI names the file\nrather than only the sentence. `pageerror` carries an unhandled rejection too,\nmeasured on all three engines rather than assumed.\n\nNo opt-out, because nothing needs one: 460 tests over Chromium, Gecko and\nWebKit, both touch projects and the focus-serialised one are green with the\nguard on. Proof it is not inert: with the bare callback restored in the Solid\nharness, two of the three disposal tests go red — the third never reads the\nprop.\n\nThe wiring gate that holds every file to that import scanned `src` alone, so the\nplayground''s five component tests complied with nothing keeping them there. It\nreads both roots now, and its vacuity check is per root rather than a total the\nlibrary''s own files would carry alone.\n\nTwo changes ride with it. The Solid harness spells its disposer prop\n`get dispose()` rather than carrying the callback on a wrapper object: `h`\nrewrites a component prop whose descriptor holds a zero-argument function\n`value` into an accessor, and a getter descriptor has none to rewrite. And\n`ct-coverage.ts` held one fixture and named it, so it is `ct-test.ts` now, with\nits gate `ct-test-wiring.test.ts`; the plugin, the reset and the report keep\ntheir names, since coverage is all any of them does.","tree":{"sha":"7f84078f44644bf3e38210f49e3ee37b16bd8cb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/git/trees/7f84078f44644bf3e38210f49e3ee37b16bd8cb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/git/commits/9fa7ba350e1296d5f6765346fef22b90c785d91b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2743830?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francisdesjardins","id":2743830,"login":"francisdesjardins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDM4MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/francisdesjardins/umbra/commit/9fa7ba350e1296d5f6765346fef22b90c785d91b","node_id":"C_kwDOTvVQm9oAKDlmYTdiYTM1MGUxMjk2ZDVmNjc2NTM0NmZlZjIyYjkwYzc4NWQ5MWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/francisdesjardins/umbra/commit/7a4475097ee095f2e5166ae649c0aafb08b8bbb8","sha":"7a4475097ee095f2e5166ae649c0aafb08b8bbb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/commits/7a4475097ee095f2e5166ae649c0aafb08b8bbb8"}],"sha":"9fa7ba350e1296d5f6765346fef22b90c785d91b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/commits/9fa7ba350e1296d5f6765346fef22b90c785d91b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2743830?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francisdesjardins","id":2743830,"login":"francisdesjardins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDM4MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_ur