ntheir comments kept sending a reader to it — \"see the MUI Title\", \"the way the\nMUI flavour spends overflowSx\", \"MUI''s twin never showed it\". Each keeps its\nreason and loses the pointer; three also narrated what the code used to do,\nwhich the changelog is for.\n\nWhat still names MUI is provenance rather than a cross-reference: a measured\ngeometry, a palette value. Those stay true whether or not a twin sits beside\nthem.","tree":{"sha":"ad76aa02efa4b141e0a728692278ef9ccbc5d6a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/git/trees/ad76aa02efa4b141e0a728692278ef9ccbc5d6a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/git/commits/11d7460eb2e45aa011d1d089f800939fcb466d2c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2743830?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francisdesjardins","id":2743830,"login":"francisdesjardins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDM4MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/francisdesjardins/umbra/commit/11d7460eb2e45aa011d1d089f800939fcb466d2c","node_id":"C_kwDO