nThe audit two days ago covered the mechanical half and five prose claims;\nthis pass read the chapters against the source.\n\nThe largest is a reference set that moved: five places in API.md and one in\nREADME.md still sent readers to dialog-template/ui/mui/, which the playground\nno longer has, and two described components by props the surviving vanilla twin\ndoes not take.\n\nSix more, each checkable: onError''s table row was soldered onto the end of the\nrow above and never rendered; data-action-reason was missing from the\nreturned-props list and from the callout naming the props a wrapper must\nforward; three tables typed a query as DialogInfo where the source returns\nRegisteredDialogInfo, with prose below reading a field the union has not got;\nDialogOpenEventDetail was documented with three fields of four, the missing one\nbeing the answer for a dialog in a shadow root; the Solid peer was quoted as\n^1.9.14, which is neither the peer range nor the dev pin; and the shared\ntemplate options list had gone seven behind.\n\nonOpenRequest gets a row, and OPTIONS_TABLE_EXEMPT loses it: the exemption\nrested on the Dialog Manager chapter carrying its example, which is the\nreasoning that gate exists to reject.","tree":{"sha":"fbb6eb5cca162504536fa12c527a6c28250b89b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/git/trees/fbb6eb5cca162504536fa12c527a6c28250b89b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/git/commits/1c2811772f4271d7dc4b5d049f8ff67af0a990e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2743830?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjard