her_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francisdesjardins","id":2743830,"login":"francisdesjardins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDM4MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/commits/3d4e172221d844214c1e295665c669b8f77ea026/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T06:10:31Z","email":"me@francisdesjardins.ca","name":"Francis Desjardins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T06:10:31Z","email":"me@francisdesjardins.ca","name":"Francis Desjardins"},"message":"docs(playground): the examples teach in a sentence\n\nThe playground half. `corner-toast.tsx` carried 464 words of JSDoc — the\nlongest block in the repository, and one a reader meets before the code it\nintroduces; it is 121 now, with the live-region reasoning left where it\nbelongs, on `useAnnouncer`.\n\nThese comments are rendered in the code viewer, so this is content visitors\nread rather than only house style.\n\nAlso the \"what, not why\" handful: a namespace re-import explained by \"for\nconvenient access\", an empty `catch` labelled \"fire-and-forget safety net\",\na `// info` on the fallback branch of a severity switch.","tree":{"sha":"78d51824460d3d8d0bd4fdb0daa6983334cc508e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/git/trees/78d51824460d3d8d0bd4fdb0daa6983334cc508e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/git/commits/3d