://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francisdesjardins","id":2743830,"login":"francisdesjardins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDM4MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francisdesjardins","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francisdesjardins/umbra/commits/08f1d531a5fc8d1a72171cc084876cc2f0a9bb71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T06:10:20Z","email":"me@francisdesjardins.ca","name":"Francis Desjardins"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T06:10:20Z","email":"me@francisdesjardins.ca","name":"Francis Desjardins"},"message":"docs(tests): the harness says what it asks, not what it replaced\n\nSame pass over the suites. A test comment is a genre of its own — it says\nwhat the assertion proves — but the four rules still apply to it, and the\nnarration was the worst of it here: several blocks opened by describing the\nbehaviour they replaced before reaching the one they pin.\n\nTwo `used to`s were instrumental rather than historical (\"used to drive\nicon and color selection\") and are reworded, so the gate that follows can\nbe strict with an empty exemption list.\n\nThree story headers read \"Tests X\", which restates the export name; they\nnow say why the arrangement is the discriminating one.","tree":{"sha":"82ff87bb435b70216c7d8d665fea20f38009276e","url":"https://