about the\nbehaviour moved.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97ae3a43935d42abf8d6987eeca6cffb59717a6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/trees/97ae3a43935d42abf8d6987eeca6cffb59717a6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/commits/61f938f1af5d6b5f93abce7e7753a99da0ad0e93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/61f938f1af5d6b5f93abce7e7753a99da0ad0e93","node_id":"C_kwDOTvWbJ9oAKDYxZjkzOGYxYWY1ZDZiNWY5M2FiY2U3ZTc3NTNhOTlkYTBhZDBlOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/c6705132ae3fb15e0242e2827c33d26a1204dd3c","sha":"c6705132ae3fb15e0242e2827c33d26a1204dd3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/c6705132ae3fb15e0242e2827c33d26a1204dd3c"}],"sha":"61f938f1af5d6b5f93abce7e7753a99da0ad0e93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/61f938f1af5d6b5f93abce7e7753a99da0ad0e93"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/c6705132ae3fb15e0242e2827c33d26a1204dd3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T06:38:20Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T06:38:20Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"message":"feat: add an icons lens that answers \"has this shipped yet\"\n\nSearch 1,200+ icons by name, glyph or codepoint, and compare dev, uat and\nprod side by side so the deploy question is answered without opening three\ntabs. Cards name each icon; a dense grid view drops to glyphs only for when\nyou are looking for a shape rather than a name.\n\nThree things the data forced:\n\nIdentity is the class name, never the codepoint. Inserting one glyph shifts\nevery later slot, so a single addition on uat made 1,128 of 1,204 icons\ncompare as different from dev — all false. A test locks this down.\n\nThe stylesheet is served `immutable` for a year, so a default fetch never\ncontacts the server. For a lens whose whole job is \"has this shipped\", that\nguarantees a stale answer; the first build showed a dev count that no longer\nexisted. Fetches now revalidate, and Sync bypasses the cache entirely.\n\nNew-since is diffed against what the user last acknowledged, not against the\nprevious fetch. Diffing consecutive fetches would clear the flag whether or\nnot anyone read it, leaving an addition visible only to whoever happened to\nsync inside that window.\n\nAlso: the search box now keeps a query per lens — a hex means nothing to the\nicon set, so sharing it landed on \"No result\" on every switch.\n\nStill no permissions of any kind; the asset CDN sends\n`access-control-allow-origin: *`, which is the only reason that holds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b429651ad9db0b86c9a6b3c66a31e9afd239324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/trees/9b429651ad9db0b86c9a6b3c66a31e9afd239324"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/commits/c6705132ae3fb15e0242e2827c33d26a1204dd3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/c6705132ae3fb15e0242e2827c33d26a1204dd3c","node_id":"C_kwDOTvWbJ9oAKGM2NzA1MTMyYWUzZmIxNWUwMjQyZTI4MjdjMzNkMjZhMTIwNGRkM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/8d3b30e03894c8e98ec7a455c0a4f7862e12308d","sha":"8d3b30e03894c8e98ec7a455c0a4f7862e12308d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/8d3b30e03894c8e98ec7a455c0a4f7862e12308d"}],"sha":"c6705132ae3fb15e0242e2827c33d26a1204dd3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/c6705132ae3fb15e0242e2827c33d26a1204dd3c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/8d3b30e03894c8e98ec7a455c0a4f7862e12308d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T07:56:38Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T07:56:38Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"message":"feat: replace the chaos lens with a design-system colour lookup\n\nThe chaos lens was on hold with an unverified UI and a plumbing history of\nthree rewrites. Rather than keep repairing it, this replaces it with the\nproblem developers actually hit daily: holding a hex from a design file and\nhaving no fast way to find which go5- class it belongs to.\n\nPaste a hex, a box-shadow or a token name and get back the usage string, both\nlight and dark values, and whether a utility class exists or only a CSS\nvariable. Only 27 of the 126 tokens ship a class, so answering with a class\nname that does not exist would be worse than answering nothing. Matching is\nranked by distance rather than equality, because colours lifted from a design\nfile are routinely a digit or two off; exact-only matching fails on the\ncommon case.\n\nThe token table is generated from the design system''s own theme sources and\nstamped with the DS commit it came from. Nothing is hand-copied: a stale\ntable answers confidently and wrongly, and without the stamp there is no way\nto tell a DS change from a bad extraction.\n\nbox-shadow needs parsing rather than string comparison — Chrome serialises it\nwith the colour first and units added, so the same shadow never compares\nequal to its authored form.\n\nDropping the lens also drops every permission. No permissions, no host\npermissions, no content script, no background worker: the popup only reads\ndata bundled into itself, which sidesteps the messaging and scripting\nfailures that plagued the previous version.\n\nThe chaos lens remains reachable at the tip of develop.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a2977afd27c2a324053ca8dc342f44faaca95c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/trees/3a2977afd27c2a324053ca8dc342f44faaca95c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/commits/8d3b30e03894c8e98ec7a455c0a4f7862e12308d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/8d3b30e03894c8e98ec7a455c0a4f7862e12308d","node_id":"C_kwDOTvWbJ9oAKDhkM2IzMGUwMzg5NGM4ZTk4ZWM3YTQ1NWMwYTRmNzg2MmUxMjMwOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/70aaaeb21531e1058536f7f6d6a224de71e5fbd1","sha":"70aaaeb21531e1058536f7f6d6a224de71e5fbd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/70aaaeb21531e1058536f7f6d6a224de71e5fbd1"}],"sha":"8d3b30e03894c8e98ec7a455c0a4f7862e12308d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/8d3b30e03894c8e98ec7a455c0a4f7862e12308d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/70aaaeb21531e1058536f7f6d6a224de71e5fbd1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T09:10:16Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T09:10:16Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"message":"feat: flip the lens around — inspect first, act from what you point at\n\nFeedback after trying it: still hard to use, and the part worth keeping was\nhovering to find out what something is. The reason is that the tool asked the\ndeveloper to translate what they can see into an endpoint name before they could\ndo anything, then handed them a list of every request on the page — permissions,\nconfig and notifications included — to pick from. That translation is the tool''s\njob, not theirs.\n\nSo it is an inspector that can also break things, rather than a breaker with a\nfinder attached. Turn on inspect mode once and keep working; hovering anything\noutlines it and shows where its data came from, how many rows and how long it\ntook, with the row-count actions right there in the same badge. Endpoint names\nappear as information, never as something to choose from. Whole-page scope is\ngone, which is what made the menu turn into 100 items.\n\nThe inspector is useful before any action is taken, which the previous shape\nnever was. Clicks still reach the app — only the badge is interactive — so\ninspect mode does not take the page hostage the way the old modal pick did.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0725de832b20abdc9246c5b2caf0cc92570992c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/trees/b0725de832b20abdc9246c5b2caf0cc92570992c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/commits/70aaaeb21531e1058536f7f6d6a224de71e5fbd1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/70aaaeb21531e1058536f7f6d6a224de71e5fbd1","node_id":"C_kwDOTvWbJ9oAKDcwYWFhZWIyMTUzMWUxMDU4NTM2ZjdmNmQ2YTIyNGRlNzFlNWZiZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/a015138a4c348493e46f1a9fbd708cce8d1e8015","sha":"a015138a4c348493e46f1a9fbd708cce8d1e8015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/a015138a4c348493e46f1a9fbd708cce8d1e8015"}],"sha":"70aaaeb21531e1058536f7f6d6a224de71e5fbd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/70aaaeb21531e1058536f7f6d6a224de71e5fbd1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/a015138a4c348493e46f1a9fbd708cce8d1e8015/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:45:36Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:45:36Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"message":"refactor: storage and one-way messages only, no scripting permission\n\nchrome.scripting came back undefined: adding an API permission to an already\nloaded unpacked extension does not take effect on reload. That was the third\ndistinct plumbing failure, after the closed message port and the failed\ninjection, so the remaining fragile mechanisms are gone rather than repaired.\n\nWhat is left is chrome.storage.local plus one-way window.postMessage. The popup\nwrites rules and a pick request to storage; the bridge watches storage and\nforwards into the page; the page posts its request log back out and the bridge\nflushes it to storage, debounced. Nothing waits for a reply, so there is no port\nto close and no injection to fail. The manifest asks for \"storage\" and nothing\nelse.\n\nstorage.local rather than storage.session because session storage needs the\nbackground to raise its access level before a content script may touch it —\nanother dependency that fails silently. Clearing our keys on startup and install\nkeeps the same \"does not survive the browser\" behaviour without it.\n\nThe popup now repaints the request list when it arrives instead of showing an\nempty list, since the log is flushed 400ms behind the requests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"66bdd02e75a68a1db42f5a261f958648cbeb641b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/trees/66bdd02e75a68a1db42f5a261f958648cbeb641b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/commits/a015138a4c348493e46f1a9fbd708cce8d1e8015","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/a015138a4c348493e46f1a9fbd708cce8d1e8015","node_id":"C_kwDOTvWbJ9oAKGEwMTUxMzhhNGMzNDg0OTNlNDZmMWE5ZmJkNzA4Y2NlOGQxZTgwMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/fc12fd62ae04b8118d956a42fa1b96e27f6adec1","sha":"fc12fd62ae04b8118d956a42fa1b96e27f6adec1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/fc12fd62ae04b8118d956a42fa1b96e27f6adec1"}],"sha":"a015138a4c348493e46f1a9fbd708cce8d1e8015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/a015138a4c348493e46f1a9fbd708cce8d1e8015"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/fc12fd62ae04b8118d956a42fa1b96e27f6adec1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:29:33Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:29:33Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"message":"refactor: drop request/response messaging between popup and page\n\n\"The message port closed before a response was received\" was the third\nmessaging failure in a row, so the channel itself was the problem rather than\nany single call. Nothing asks the page a question and waits any more.\n\nThe MAIN-world script now owns the state and exposes state() and pick() on\nwindow. The popup calls them through chrome.scripting.executeScript with\nworld: MAIN, which returns the value directly — no ports, no listeners, no\nlifetime to get wrong. It reports the thrown error verbatim when that fails.\n\nRules travel the other way through chrome.storage.session, which content\nscripts can read once the background raises the access level. The bridge is\ndown to reading storage, forwarding it into the page, and writing back the\nscope chosen in pick mode. Its onMessage listener is gone entirely, and so is\nthe background''s, apart from reopening the popup after a pick.\n\nPick mode moved next to the script that uses it; it only ever touched the DOM,\nso it runs in the MAIN world unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d32aaeb5263e13e356c92bcfa18d1517f132ab22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/trees/d32aaeb5263e13e356c92bcfa18d1517f132ab22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/commits/fc12fd62ae04b8118d956a42fa1b96e27f6adec1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/fc12fd62ae04b8118d956a42fa1b96e27f6adec1","node_id":"C_kwDOTvWbJ9oAKGZjMTJmZDYyYWUwNGI4MTE4ZDk1NmE0MmZhMWI5NmUyN2Y2YWRlYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/f1267125a8b2bc3d7fa636b572dd44fa1c7975cf","sha":"f1267125a8b2bc3d7fa636b572dd44fa1c7975cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/f1267125a8b2bc3d7fa636b572dd44fa1c7975cf"}],"sha":"fc12fd62ae04b8118d956a42fa1b96e27f6adec1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/fc12fd62ae04b8118d956a42fa1b96e27f6adec1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/f1267125a8b2bc3d7fa636b572dd44fa1c7975cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:17:48Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:17:48Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"message":"fix: recover without a page reload, and show the real failure\n\nTelling the user to reload the page was the wrong answer twice over: it did not\nhelp when the declared content script had not run at all, and it made a\nrecoverable state look like a dead end. The popup now injects the bridge itself\nvia chrome.scripting when the page does not answer, and only falls back to the\nreload notice if that injection also fails — printing Chrome''s own error text so\nthe cause is visible instead of guessed at.\n\nDoing that meant the request log could no longer live in the bridge, since a\nbridge injected after page load would have missed everything. The MAIN-world\nscript keeps the log now and hands over a full dump whenever a bridge starts, so\na late bridge is as good as an early one. The bridge guards against being\ninjected twice.\n\nThe bridge also no longer touches chrome.storage.session directly — session\nstorage is not exposed to content scripts by default, so persisting a scope\npicked from the page went through the background instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae01b1829130a8824205265f528a454bdce6ab0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/trees/ae01b1829130a8824205265f528a454bdce6ab0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/commits/f1267125a8b2bc3d7fa636b572dd44fa1c7975cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/f1267125a8b2bc3d7fa636b572dd44fa1c7975cf","node_id":"C_kwDOTvWbJ9oAKGYxMjY3MTI1YThiMmJjM2Q3ZmE2MzZiNTcyZGQ0NGZhMWM3OTc1Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/ab31047f0c57c02a76dcc61800ab855a74241b52","sha":"ab31047f0c57c02a76dcc61800ab855a74241b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/ab31047f0c57c02a76dcc61800ab855a74241b52"}],"sha":"f1267125a8b2bc3d7fa636b572dd44fa1c7975cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/f1267125a8b2bc3d7fa636b572dd44fa1c7975cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/ab31047f0c57c02a76dcc61800ab855a74241b52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:09:01Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:09:01Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"message":"fix: say when the popup cannot reach the page, and harden pick mode\n\nReloading the extension orphans the content script in any tab that was already\nopen, so every message from the popup failed. It failed silently: the request\nlist stayed empty and pick mode never started, which reads as a dead button.\nThe popup now probes the page first and, when there is no answer, says so and\noffers the reload that fixes it.\n\nPick mode also had two problems waiting behind that one. It measured text on\nevery mousemove while walking up the ancestor chain, which is enough traversal\nto make a large page feel stuck — now throttled to one frame and capped at 12\nhops. And it only stopped propagation, so a listener bound to the same node\ncould still fire; it now uses stopImmediatePropagation and swallows\nmousedown/pointerdown too, so clicking to pick cannot also press the app.\n\nEmpty results are reported instead of looking like a no-op: no text under the\ncursor and no matching response now give different messages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"823d3cf9fec6f36aca3ecd22fef770acdd2efac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/trees/823d3cf9fec6f36aca3ecd22fef770acdd2efac6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/commits/ab31047f0c57c02a76dcc61800ab855a74241b52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/ab31047f0c57c02a76dcc61800ab855a74241b52","node_id":"C_kwDOTvWbJ9oAKGFiMzEwNDdmMGM1N2MwMmE3NmRjYzYxODAwYWI4NTVhNzQyNDFiNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/948af3fdbb755dae250b65310f4d01579ac1ac78","sha":"948af3fdbb755dae250b65310f4d01579ac1ac78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/948af3fdbb755dae250b65310f4d01579ac1ac78"}],"sha":"ab31047f0c57c02a76dcc61800ab855a74241b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/ab31047f0c57c02a76dcc61800ab855a74241b52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/948af3fdbb755dae250b65310f4d01579ac1ac78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T07:53:50Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T07:53:50Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"message":"feat: pick the target by clicking it on the page\n\nChoosing a scope meant reading a list of endpoint paths, which only means\nsomething to whoever wrote them. Anyone else — QA, someone new to the team —\nhad to guess which of praises/list, Component/MenuList or v1/notifications was\nthe table in front of them.\n\nNow the popup offers a pick mode: hover outlines what is under the cursor,\nclicking it reads the text in that subtree and matches it against the strings\nseen in each recorded response. The table on screen contains \"Crazong Crazy\",\nso the request that also contains it is the one that fed it. ESC cancels.\n\nEach response now carries a short sample of its own strings, so the endpoint\nlist is readable on its own terms too — recognise the data, not the route.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ed32de36724278c502922907c135fa6b801c2af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/trees/2ed32de36724278c502922907c135fa6b801c2af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/commits/948af3fdbb755dae250b65310f4d01579ac1ac78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/948af3fdbb755dae250b65310f4d01579ac1ac78","node_id":"C_kwDOTvWbJ9oAKDk0OGFmM2ZkYmI3NTVkYWUyNTBiNjUzMTBmNGQwMTU3OWFjMWFjNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/8d10b805286bbb7147336c4dc7ce3d6f110a80ef","sha":"8d10b805286bbb7147336c4dc7ce3d6f110a80ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/8d10b805286bbb7147336c4dc7ce3d6f110a80ef"}],"sha":"948af3fdbb755dae250b65310f4d01579ac1ac78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/948af3fdbb755dae250b65310f4d01579ac1ac78"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/8d10b805286bbb7147336c4dc7ce3d6f110a80ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T06:56:55Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T06:56:55Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"message":"fix: reload on change, and scope the rule to one request\n\nClicking a row count did nothing until the page happened to refetch, which\nreads as a broken tool. Applying now reloads the tab and closes the popup, so\none click is one visible result.\n\nThe request list was read-only, which hid a worse problem: a page fires several\nAPI calls, so \"whole page\" at 100 rows also inflates the left menu and the\nnotification feed until the table under test is unreadable. Rows are now\nselectable and scope the rule to a single request; the row counts already shown\nnext to them are what makes the right one obvious.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be77779caffa81996ec43c1ff26ad01db05a70d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/trees/be77779caffa81996ec43c1ff26ad01db05a70d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/commits/8d10b805286bbb7147336c4dc7ce3d6f110a80ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/8d10b805286bbb7147336c4dc7ce3d6f110a80ef","node_id":"C_kwDOTvWbJ9oAKDhkMTBiODA1Mjg2YmJiNzE0NzMzNmM0ZGM3Y2UzZDZmMTEwYTgwZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/eee9ae8a87ab5324e6852a42b642fff498254241","sha":"eee9ae8a87ab5324e6852a42b642fff498254241","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/eee9ae8a87ab5324e6852a42b642fff498254241"}],"sha":"8d10b805286bbb7147336c4dc7ce3d6f110a80ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/8d10b805286bbb7147336c4dc7ce3d6f110a80ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/eee9ae8a87ab5324e6852a42b642fff498254241/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T06:46:22Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T06:46:22Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"message":"feat: row-count prototype for the Chaos lens\n\nResizes the list a page renders by transforming the real API response on the\nway back in — 0 to reach the empty state, 20/100/1000 to see what happens when\nthere is a lot of data. Nothing is fabricated: rows are the real ones, repeated,\nwith id/no/guid/key/code offset so identities stay unique.\n\nPatched at XMLHttpRequest and fetch in the MAIN world rather than as an Angular\ninterceptor, so no rebuild is needed and ma-* micro-apps carrying their own\nHttpClient are covered by the same code. The XHR listener is registered inside\nthe patched open(), before the caller attaches its own handlers, which is what\nlets the rewrite land ahead of Angular reading the body.\n\nTotals follow the array only when they matched its real length; a paginated\n5,842 next to 20 rows is left alone, except at zero where reaching the empty\nstate is the point.\n\nRuns on an allowlist (localhost, portal.dev, portal.uat) checked three times\nover — manifest, popup, and the injected script itself. A blocklist would leak\nbecause empeo lets tenants configure their own production domain.\n\ndist/ is committed so teammates load unpacked straight from the clone and\nupdate with git pull alone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0eb960b32f3464cbc1d258d9fec615ef4400580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/trees/c0eb960b32f3464cbc1d258d9fec615ef4400580"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/commits/eee9ae8a87ab5324e6852a42b642fff498254241","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/eee9ae8a87ab5324e6852a42b642fff498254241","node_id":"C_kwDOTvWbJ9oAKGVlZTlhZThhODdhYjUzMjRlNjg1MmE0MmI2NDJmZmY0OTgyNTQyNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/acbaea74400d88499ff7169af706c5888abf4f58","sha":"acbaea74400d88499ff7169af706c5888abf4f58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/acbaea74400d88499ff7169af706c5888abf4f58"}],"sha":"eee9ae8a87ab5324e6852a42b642fff498254241","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/eee9ae8a87ab5324e6852a42b642fff498254241"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/acbaea74400d88499ff7169af706c5888abf4f58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T04:27:56Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T04:27:56Z","email":"sarawut.p@gofive.co.th","name":"Sarawut Poycheeva"},"message":"docs: add Chaos lens design spec\n\nFirst lens of empeo Inspector. Transforms real API responses in flight\n(row count / delay / error / long text) so empty states, loading behaviour\nand error paths become reachable from a toolbar switch instead of a code edit.\n\nPatches XHR+fetch in the MAIN world rather than adding an Angular\ninterceptor: no rebuild is needed, so it works against deployed UAT, and it\ncovers ma-* micro-apps that carry their own HttpClient. Sitting below\nTokenInterceptor also keeps the loading counter and block screen intact —\nthose are the behaviours under test.\n\nRuns only on an allowlist (localhost, portal.dev, portal.uat). A blocklist\nwould leak: empeo lets tenants configure their own production domain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80fe55948a39ee9b2942152c3e0feaccfa6b8da2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/trees/80fe55948a39ee9b2942152c3e0feaccfa6b8da2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/git/commits/acbaea74400d88499ff7169af706c5888abf4f58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135773369?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva","id":135773369,"login":"sarawut-poycheeva","node_id":"U_kgDOCBe8uQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarawut-poycheeva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/acbaea74400d88499ff7169af706c5888abf4f58","node_id":"C_kwDOTvWbJ9oAKGFjYmFlYTc0NDAwZDg4NDk5ZmY3MTY5YWY3MDZjNTg4OGFiZjRmNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commit/60be9a6c59cca1247bbc1e30c6114da0a1b35942","sha":"60be9a6c59cca1247bbc1e30c6114da0a1b35942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/60be9a6c59cca1247bbc1e30c6114da0a1b35942"}],"sha":"acbaea74400d88499ff7169af706c5888abf4f58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sarawut-poycheeva/empeo-inspector/commits/acbaea74400d88499ff716