705c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T04:51:34Z","email":"blueinno@Blueinnos-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Blueinno MacBook 7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T04:52:34Z","email":"blueinno@Blueinnos-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Blueinno MacBook 7"},"message":"fix: preserve manual itinerary edits across re-renders + prevent drag on remove button\n\n- Fix remove button (✕) doing nothing: renderItineraryScreen was re-scheduling\n  the entire itinerary from scratch for non-AI modes, undoing removals.\n  Now preserves existing itinerary regardless of mode.\n- Clear itinerary on ''Build Itinerary'' click to trigger fresh schedule.\n- Fix drag prevention on remove button: dragstart guard using\n  e.target.closest(''.btn-remove-activity'') couldn''t work because the\n  button is a descendant of the draggable element, not an ancestor.\n  Replaced with mousedown stopPropagation to prevent drag initiation.","tree":{"sha":"eea7e916d7733f932fbda8bfcb8959b0fa580fcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamuelGit1/Family-trip-planner/git/trees/eea7e916d7733f932fbda8bfcb8959b0fa580fcf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamuelGit1/Family-trip-planner/git/commits/e03b4f78c6dacbba3b6f8cc75eb8182df654705c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SamuelGit1/Family-trip-planner/commit/e03b4f78c6dacbba3b6f8cc75eb8182df654705c","node_id":"C_kwDOTvYAPdoAKGUwM2I0Zjc4YzZkYWNiYmEzYjZmOGNjNzVlYjgxODJkZjY1NDcwNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SamuelGit1/Family-trip-planner/commit/144f192d72a223460cdb064f0118c4be59fcdfb6","sha":"144f192d72a223460cdb064f0118c4be59fcdfb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamuelGit1/Family-trip-planner/commits/144f192d72a223460cdb064f0118c4be59fcdfb6"}],"sha":"e03b4f78c6dacbba3b6f8cc75eb8182df654705c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamuelGit1/Family-trip-planner/commits/e03b4f78c6dacbba3b6f8cc75eb8182d