d215f66317dfc01133f21738cba524c575dcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T06:30:40Z","email":"hytkim0715@gmail.com","name":"immamakeit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T06:30:40Z","email":"hytkim0715@gmail.com","name":"immamakeit"},"message":"feat(mf2): 재시도·타입 안전성 증거 캡처 13·14\n\n13: cart-app을 내린 채 /cart 진입 → 최초 1회 + 재시도 3회(?retryCount=N),\n    소진 후 ErrorBoundary 폴백 정상 동작\n\n14: consumer가 provider 시그니처에 없는 값(size=\"huge\")을 넘기면\n    TS2322로 빌드가 막힌다. provider 쪽을 고치는 방식은 쓸 수 없었다 —\n    Button의 공개 타입을 어떻게 바꾸든 provider 자신의 기본값이나 쇼케이스가\n    먼저 깨져 @mf-types.zip이 생성되지 않고 consumer는 낡은 타입을 들고 있게 된다.\n\nbuild-with-types.sh에 @mf-types와 .federation 캐시 선정리 추가 —\n없으면 provider를 고쳐도 consumer 타입이 낡은 채로 남는다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ef6ca1120a2d44d663dd582de0af04fd957b0bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Immamakeit/mfe-sample/git/trees/0ef6ca1120a2d44d663dd582de0af04fd957b0bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Immamakeit/mfe-sample/git/commits/d91d215f66317dfc01133f21738cba524c575dcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123873401?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Immamakeit","id":123873401,"login":"Immamakeit","node_id":"U_kgDOB2IoeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https