15Z","email":"hytkim0715@gmail.com","name":"immamakeit"},"message":"feat(mf2): retry-plugin 도입, remote 참조는 remoteEntry 유지\n\nretry: 초기 1회 + 3회 재시도(300ms), addQuery로 캐시된 실패 우회.\n재시도 소진 후에도 ErrorBoundary 폴백이 정상 동작함을 캡처 06으로 확인.\n\nmf-manifest.json 참조는 시도했다가 되돌렸다 — manifest fetch 실패 시\n#RUNTIME-003이 React 렌더 밖에서 던져져 ErrorBoundary를 우회하고\n앱 전체가 빈 화면이 됐다. 타입 소비는 remoteEntry로도 동작하므로\nmanifest를 포기해도 잃는 것이 없다. 판단 근거는 설정 주석에 기록.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c9a7cb6dacd62aea7020fe9c5f0ce7c7d6ac07f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Immamakeit/mfe-sample/git/trees/9c9a7cb6dacd62aea7020fe9c5f0ce7c7d6ac07f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Immamakeit/mfe-sample/git/commits/71611ab0c1b281300f06a57e89ee1fdb02861604","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123873401?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Immamakeit","id":123873401,"login":"Immamakeit","node_id":"U_kgDOB2IoeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Immamakeit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Immamakeit/mfe-sample/commit/71611ab0c1b281300f06a57e89ee1fdb02861604","node_id":"C_kwDOTvY-gNoAKDcxNjExYWIwYzFiMjgxMzAwZjA2YTU3ZTg5ZWUxZ