12f458260b102349447027abe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/9969f755b737d1fb5e72512e7e44ce16eb9737e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T10:27:22Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T10:27:22Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"message":"fix: the SDK dropped the span it was continuing from\n\nSwitching the demo onto the published packages found a real bug in the one they\nhad just shipped.\n\nThe ASGI middleware parses the incoming `obsly-trace` header and stores the\ncaller''s span id on the transaction. `Transaction.to_payload()` then built\n`contexts.trace` without it. So a browser page load and the backend request it\nmade shared a trace id and lost the link between them — which looks correct in\na trace holding one request, and says nothing in a page that made four, because\nnothing says which fetch caused which.\n\nIt survived because the ingest side was verified with hand-built payloads that\nincluded the field. The SDK was never asked whether it sent one.\n\n    before   trace continued : True\n             parent recorded : ''''\n    after    parent recorded : ''6ffb4453d8fb4f4c''   <- matches what was sent\n\nPublished as obsly 0.1.1 and verified against the live index, not the local\nbuild.\n\nThe demo now installs both SDKs from the registries instead of the repository\nbeside it. Installing from a path proves the monorepo builds; installing the\npublished package proves what somebody following the README actually receives —\nand this is the bug that difference exposed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0b69115f8aec3a29a04d94cf454e56cad67bbf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/trees/c0b69115f8aec3a29a04d94cf454e56cad67bbf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/commits/9969f755b737d1fb5e72512e7e44ce16eb9737e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/9969f755b