tarred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/8288481a7bedb33c4ff9805888a6e5870299feb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T07:18:29Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T07:18:29Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"message":"chore: claim `obsly` on PyPI rather than `obsly-sdk`\n\nInstall and import now agree — `pip install obsly` then `import obsly`. Both\nnames were free; the one that is not taken is the one somebody else can take.\n\nRebuilt and re-verified: twine check passes on both artefacts, the wheel\ninstalls into a clean venv and imports, and Requires-Dist is still empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"69506e54e2494f48729b7a0231ce6f5df1b53eeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/trees/69506e54e2494f48729b7a0231ce6f5df1b53eeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/commits/8288481a7bedb33c4ff9805888a6e5870299feb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/8288481a7bedb33c4ff9805888a6e5870299feb2","node_id":"C_kwDOTveDc9oAKDgyODg0ODFhN2JlZGIzM2M0ZmY5ODA1ODg4YTZlNTg3MDI5OWZlYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/15d8612db95fa561ff091a1b33e9103b134726d0","sha":"15d8612db95fa561ff091a1b33e9103b134726d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/15d8612db95fa561ff091a1b33e9103b134726d0"}],"sha":"8288481a7bedb33c4ff9805888a6e5870299feb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/8288481a7bedb33c4ff9805888a6e5870299feb2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/15d8612db95fa561ff091a1b33e9103b134726d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T07:01:42Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T07:01:42Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"message":"chore: make both SDKs publishable\n\nNeither package could have been released as it stood. Preparing them turned up\nthree real defects rather than just missing metadata.\n\n**The Python package shipped no py.typed.** It passes mypy --strict, and PEP\n561 tells every consuming type checker to ignore a package without that marker\n— so all of that typing reached nobody who installed it. The marker is in the\nwheel now, which is what makes the Typing :: Typed classifier true rather than\na claim.\n\n**Neither package carried a licence.** The repository is MIT and the\ndistributions said nothing, which for anyone with a compliance process means\nunusable.\n\n**The npm package would have published an empty tarball from a clean\ncheckout.** `files` lists `dist`, and `dist` is gitignored — so a release cut\nanywhere other than a machine that happened to have built already would ship a\npackage with no code in it. `prepublishOnly` now lints, type-checks, tests and\nbuilds on the way out.\n\nMetadata both registries surface and neither package had: description, author,\nrepository (with `directory`, since a monorepo package has to say where it\nlives or every \"view source\" link is wrong), homepage, issues, keywords,\nclassifiers, Python version support.\n\nVerified as artefacts rather than as configuration:\n\n    obsly-sdk 0.1.0    twine check PASSED, both sdist and wheel\n                       installs into a clean venv, imports, middleware resolves\n                       Requires-Dist: (none)   <- the zero-dependency promise\n                       obsly/py.typed present in the wheel\n\n    @obsly/browser     15 files, 10.1 kB packed, LICENSE and README included\n        0.1.0          installs from the tarball and imports natively\n\nNothing is published. Names on both registries are confirmed free.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f03c8e7f2fa985d6fd936e197a01db3088cbfb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/trees/1f03c8e7f2fa985d6fd936e197a01db3088cbfb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/commits/15d8612db95fa561ff091a1b33e9103b134726d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/15d8612db95fa561ff091a1b33e9103b134726d0","node_id":"C_kwDOTveDc9oAKDE1ZDg2MTJkYjk1ZmE1NjFmZjA5MWExYjMzZTkxMDNiMTM0NzI2ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/55844e7796653f7ea340418fdd91e3beed3c73e0","sha":"55844e7796653f7ea340418fdd91e3beed3c73e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/55844e7796653f7ea340418fdd91e3beed3c73e0"}],"sha":"15d8612db95fa561ff091a1b33e9103b134726d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/15d8612db95fa561ff091a1b33e9103b134726d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.g