1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/13268882bdd5101e6dad99af6b3e65dd9fcb2161"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/338d02a7fdbec2622ae354c3dfbce9a119b50879/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T20:37:21Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T20:37:21Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"message":"refactor: fold the axis helpers back into one call each\n\nponytail-review of the branch: `at()` had exactly one caller, and every site\ncalled `stamp()` twice — building a Date each time — to decide whether to show\nthe absolute form.\n\nnet: -11 lines, same rendering.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2165e6270d480fa67c4fbce7e5deb0fec3f1ebca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/trees/2165e6270d480fa67c4fbce7e5deb0fec3f1ebca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/commits/338d02a7fdbec2622ae354c3dfbce9a119b50879","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/338d02a7fdbec2622ae354c3dfbce9a119b50879","node_id":"C_kwDOTveDc9oAKDMzOGQwMmE3ZmRiZWMyNjIyYWUzNTRjM2RmYmNlOWExMTliNTA4Nzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/fe9e7093a43884865fde022002e0c4bf709bd311","sha":"fe9e7093a43884865fde022002e0c4bf709bd311","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/fe9e7093a43884865fde022002e0c4bf709bd311"}],"sha":"338d02a7fdbec2622ae354c3dfbce9a119b50879","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/338d02a7fdbec2622ae354c3dfbce9a119b50879"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/fe9e7093a43884865fde022002e0c4bf709bd311/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T20:36:03Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T20:36:03Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"message":"feat: charts read in clock time, and say what they measure\n\nEvery axis was relative — \"24h ago\", \"12h ago\", \"now\". That reads fine in\nisolation and is useless the moment you need it: you cannot line \"3h ago\" up\nagainst a deploy, an alert, a log line, or somebody else''s screenshot, and it\nmeans something different every time the page refreshes.\n\nThe window already computed its bucket timestamps server-side; they just never\nreached the client. Sending the first bucket''s timestamp alongside the bucket\nwidth is enough for the client to name every point — one field rather than one\ntimestamp per point saying the same thing.\n\nAbsolute time leads and the age follows it, because the timestamp is the half\nyou compare against something else. The precision follows the bucket: seconds\non a 30-day chart are a lie about resolution, and a date repeated on every tick\nof a 5-minute chart is noise.\n\nCharts that lacked a start time keep their relative axis rather than losing one.\n\nAlso gives the charts captions. A heading names a chart; it does not say what\nthe bars mean, and a chart whose meaning has to be inferred is one people read\nwrong — which is exactly what happened with the marks that got deleted last\nweek.\n\nThe period list moves out of PeriodPicker into its own module: a caption naming\nthe window needs the same words as the control above it, and exporting\nconstants from a component file breaks fast refresh.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a43622abf7b48d4ff9c847beb07bbf6b46c3a13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/trees/9a43622abf7b48d4ff9c847beb07bbf6b46c3a13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/commits/fe9e7093a43884865fde022002e0c4bf709bd311","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/fe9e7093a43884865fde022002e0c4bf709bd311","node_id":"C_kwDOTveDc9oAKGZlOWU3MDkzYTQzODg0ODY1ZmRlMDIyMDAyZTBjNGJmNzA5YmQzMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/2fd53e597a5fb587abfa7f11a80c4b7532088fc9","sha":"2fd53e597a5fb