cd63cdc1ba01ec7052bab13df9","sha":"c9a0e1eeaa0514cd63cdc1ba01ec7052bab13df9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/c9a0e1eeaa0514cd63cdc1ba01ec7052bab13df9"}],"sha":"a51f1b2dddd6fb6204181f20f4f4a2c9b5b14554","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/a51f1b2dddd6fb6204181f20f4f4a2c9b5b14554"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/c9a0e1eeaa0514cd63cdc1ba01ec7052bab13df9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T16:50:08Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T16:50:08Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"message":"fix: the project tabs never rendered, and / landed on an arbitrary project\n\nTwo navigation bugs, one of which made three pages unreachable.\n\nThe tab bar was rendered beside <Routes> rather than inside a route.\nuseParams only resolves against a matched route — outside one it returns an\nempty object, so projectId was always undefined and the component returned\nnull on every page. Overview, Spans, Traces and Logs existed, were tested, and\ncould not be reached by clicking anything.\n\nFixed with a layout route. /projects/:projectId renders the tab bar and an\nOutlet, so every project page sits under it and inherits the tabs, and the bar\ncan read the id it is navigating with. The layout also names the project,\nbecause a tab bar with no subject does not say what it is scoping.\n\nThe root path rendered the issue stream with no project, and the stream fell\nback to the first project by name — which is why localhost:8081 opened\nBilling. Landing on whichever project sorts first is arbitrary, and it reads\nas a bug the moment there is more than one. / now redirects to the project\nlist, and /projects/:id with no page redirects to that project''s overview.\n\nThat fallback is gone from the issue stream entirely: it always has a\nprojectId now, so the code that guessed one is deleted rather than left\nunreachable. The project switcher went with it — switching projects is what\nthe project list is for, and two ways to do it that disagree is worse than one.\n\nProject rows now open the overview rather than the issue stream. The overview\nis the page that summarises everything; issues is one tab of it.\n\n47 frontend tests, four of them new and specifically about navigation, since\nthe failure mode here was a component that rendered nothing while every test\naround it passed.\n\nVerified through nginx — all ten routes serve:\n  /  /projects  /projects/4  and the seven project tabs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81fc979403ac60d10ddb4165a6ffcf5b849b176d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/trees/81fc979403ac60d10ddb4165a6ffcf5b849b176d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/commits/c9a0e1eeaa0514cd63cdc1ba01ec7052bab13df9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avata