ttps://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/a18ad11ec7aff99822b05234354886c50c7cd10c","node_id":"C_kwDOTveDc9oAKGExOGFkMTFlYzdhZmY5OTgyMmIwNTIzNDM1NDg4NmM1MGM3Y2QxMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/8ae9ad3d4d2a11c6add6610005c2fd5e99066990","sha":"8ae9ad3d4d2a11c6add6610005c2fd5e99066990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/8ae9ad3d4d2a11c6add6610005c2fd5e99066990"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/41526b81bff53aa146b39a9f832bd05b6ec0cf09","sha":"41526b81bff53aa146b39a9f832bd05b6ec0cf09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/41526b81bff53aa146b39a9f832bd05b6ec0cf09"}],"sha":"a18ad11ec7aff99822b05234354886c50c7cd10c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/a18ad11ec7aff99822b05234354886c50c7cd10c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/41526b81bff53aa146b39a9f832bd05b6ec0cf09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T15:31:30Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T15:31:30Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"message":"fix: chart was unreadable, and traces had nowhere to live\n\nThree problems reported from a screenshot, all real.\n\nThe chart. Its tooltip was absolutely positioned above the plot and got\nclipped by the card containing it — visible in the screenshot as a half-cut\nwhite pill. Worse, the tooltip was the only way to read any value: no axis, no\nmaximum, no labels. That is an anti-pattern with a name — a tooltip that gates\nthe data is unreachable by keyboard and gone the moment you look away.\n\nRebuilt:\n- A readout row above the plot, reserved rather than overlaid, so nothing can\n  clip it. It shows total and peak at rest and the hovered bucket on hover.\n- A y-axis maximum and x-axis labels (24h ago / 12h ago / now), so the window\n  and the scale are legible without touching anything.\n- A \"show values as a table\" toggle, so every number is reachable without a\n  mouse.\n- Positioned elements instead of a scaled SVG viewBox. preserveAspectRatio\n  \"none\" stretches geometry horizontally, so the 2px corner radius was\n  rendering as a squashed ellipse at full width.\n- Zero buckets still draw a baseline tick, because \"no events this hour\" and\n  \"this chart failed to render\" must not look identical.\n\nNavigation. Performance existed and was reachable only from a link buried in a\nsubtitle; traces had no page at all. Both now sit in project-scoped tabs —\nIssues / Performance / Traces / Settings — because a feature nobody can\nnavigate to has not really shipped. The active tab is marked by weight and a\nrule as well as colour.\n\nTraces. New list and waterfall:\n- Sorted slowest-first by default. Sorted by time, a trace list shows what\n  happened last; sorted by duration it shows what to look at, which is almost\n  always why somebody opened the page.\n- Filters for failed-only and by endpoint.\n- The waterfall places each bar by real start offset and width, so a gap\n  between two bars is genuine dead time rather than a layout artefact. A\n  sub-millisecond span is floored to a visible mark instead of nothing.\n- A trace with no spans says so explicitly, and says why: the request is timed\n  but nothing inside it is instrumented, so it shows how long it took and not\n  where the time went.\n\nAlso: formatMs moved into its own module. Exporting a helper from a page file\nbreaks fast refresh, which eslint flagged.\n\n173 backend tests, 33 frontend tests.\n\nVerified through nginx:\n  /api/0/projects/2/traces/  -> slowest first, /login/access-token 106.2ms\n  /api/0/traces/{id}/        -> status internal_error, release, spans\n  SPA routes /, /projects, /projects/2/performance, /projects/2/traces -> 200\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0699161646fd734435199e3fcf527d7f17a35fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/trees/e0699161646fd734435199e3fcf527d7f17a35fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/commits/41526b81bff53aa146b39a9f832bd05b6ec0cf09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/41526b81bff53aa146b39a9f832bd05b6ec0cf09","node_id":"C_kwDOTveDc9oAKDQxNTI2YjgxYmZmNTNhYTE0NmIzOWE5ZjgzMmJkMDViNmVjMGNmMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/8ae9ad3d4d2a11c6add6610005c2fd5e99066990","sha":"8ae9ad3d4d2a11c6add6610005c2fd5e99066990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/8ae9ad3d4d2a11c6add6610005c2fd5e99066990"}],"sha":"41526b81bff53aa146b39a9f832bd05b6ec0cf09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/41526b81bff53aa146b39a9f832bd05b6ec0cf09"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/8ae9ad3d4d2a11c6add6610005c2fd5e99066990/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T15:17:26Z","email":"33451925+aafaq01@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"dat