"node_id":"C_kwDOTveDc9oAKDBkYWVhMTdkOWRiMTQ3YTIyN2MzZjIzNTFiYjI0MzliYWM3MDI4Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/db34aa39875c8fb4227834373f7f3a64766a06e4","sha":"db34aa39875c8fb4227834373f7f3a64766a06e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/db34aa39875c8fb4227834373f7f3a64766a06e4"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/ee96083b8335970d2208cdcd813817d87050f573","sha":"ee96083b8335970d2208cdcd813817d87050f573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/ee96083b8335970d2208cdcd813817d87050f573"}],"sha":"0daea17d9db147a227c3f2351bb2439bac7028cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/0daea17d9db147a227c3f2351bb2439bac7028cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/ee96083b8335970d2208cdcd813817d87050f573/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T14:19:02Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T14:19:02Z","email":"m.aafaq.rana@gmail.com","name":"Aafaq Rana"},"message":"feat: resolve, ignore and reopen issues from the UI\n\nThe stream was read-only, so triage meant looking at a list you could not act\non. Issues now move through their workflow from the detail page.\n\nOnly `status` is writable. Everything else on an Issue is derived from events,\nand a hand-edited title or count would make the row disagree with the data\nbehind it.\n\nOnly the transitions valid from the current state are offered — \"Resolve\"\nnever appears on something already resolved. A disabled or no-op button trains\npeople to distrust the whole row. On failure the UI keeps the old status and\nsays why; showing the new state before the server agreed is a lie that the\nnext page load silently corrects.\n\n/api/0/me/ now sets a CSRF cookie via ensure_csrf_cookie. Without it the\nbrowser only receives a csrftoken after visiting a Django form page, so a user\nlanding straight on the UI could read everything and write nothing, with a 403\nthey had no way to act on.\n\nTwo input-handling details that would otherwise be 500s:\n- A JSON array body parses to a list, and .get() on a list is an\n  AttributeError. A malformed body is the client''s mistake and reads as 400.\n- Serialising an Issue outside the list view raised AttributeError on the\n  missing `hourly` histogram, which is every mutation response. It is now a\n  method field defaulting to empty.\n\nFound by the build rather than the tests: `npm run build` type-checks the test\nfiles too, and the fetch mock declared only a url parameter, so reading\ninit[1] failed compilation while `vitest` and `tsc --noEmit` on src both\npassed. The image build is what caught it.\n\nVerified live through nginx:\n  PATCH resolved              -> status resolved, stream drops to 0 rows\n  PATCH \"deleted\"             -> 400\n  PATCH without a CSRF token  -> 403\n  PATCH unresolved            -> reopened\n  resolved, then a real error from the FastAPI app -> reopened\n                                 automatically, times_seen 7 -> 8\n\n125 backend tests, 17 frontend tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9004876c665f28c1eae96ba56a777654403ba1ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/trees/9004876c665f28c1eae96ba56a777654403ba1ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/git/commits/ee96083b8335970d2208cdcd813817d87050f573","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33451925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01","id":33451925,"login":"aafaq01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDUxOTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aafaq01","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/ee96083b8335970d2208cdcd813817d87050f573","node_id":"C_kwDOTveDc9oAKGVlOTYwODNiODMzNTk3MGQyMjA4Y2RjZDgxMzgxN2Q4NzA1MGY1NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aafaq01/obsly/commit/db34aa39875c8fb4227834373f7f3a64766a06e4","sha":"db34aa39875c8fb4227834373f7f3a64766a06e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/db34aa39875c8fb4227834373f7f3a64766a06e4"}],"sha":"ee96083b8335970d2208cdcd813817d87050f573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aafaq01/obsly/commits/ee96083b8335970d2208cdcd