port file responses and cleanup.\n- Added tests for MySQL adapter to ensure proper handling of invalid configurations and failures.\n- Created tests for on-demand exports, ensuring files are generated and cleaned up correctly.\n- Removed Marketaux news provider and updated related configurations and tests.\n- Documented the decision to remove Redis and worker dependencies for synchronous jobs.\n- Established direct read-only access to DA-Report MySQL for production environments.\n- Updated ADRs to reflect changes in report generation, download processes, and MySQL integration.","tree":{"sha":"25bb01318180d2fe696c01e385ca3bfb2cd45e7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/trees/25bb01318180d2fe696c01e385ca3bfb2cd45e7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/commits/755f1fd37c0a35c6da8b85c67bd3a5df948ad5d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531/report_automation/commit/755f1fd37c0a35c6da8b85c67bd3a5df948ad5d9","node_id":"C_kwDOTvuaoNoAKDc1NWYxZmQzN2MwYTM1YzZkYThiODVjNjdiZDNhNWRmOTQ4YWQ1ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531/report_automation/commit/ee83edd987de4ee0296bab92732d423ddc6ee607","sha":"ee83edd987de4ee0296bab92732d423ddc6ee607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/ee83edd987de4ee0296bab92732d423ddc6ee607"}],"sha":"755f1fd37c0a35c6da8b85c67bd3a5df948ad5d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/755f1fd37c0a35c6da8b85c67bd3a5df948ad5d9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/ee83edd987de4ee0296bab92732d423ddc6ee607/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:54:24Z","email":"john.wang@csopasset.com","name":"John Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T06:54:24Z","email":"john.wang@csopasset.com","name":"John Wang"},"message":"feat: implement RemoteApp component with testing and configuration\n\n- Add RemoteApp component to handle remote rendering with Shadow DOM.\n- Create tests for RemoteApp to ensure proper functionality and state management.\n- Introduce remote configuration for API and artifact URLs.\n- Set up Webpack Module Federation for remote component integration.\n- Establish host application entry point and routing for remote components.\n- Create validation and runbook documentation for deployment and maintenance.\n- Implement scripts for secret management and host app registration.\n- Ensure compatibility with existing backend services and frontend architecture.","tree":{"sha":"44cbe88106245d990c31665bea41bfdeee041a3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/trees/44cbe88106245d990c31665bea41bfdeee041a3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/commits/ee83edd987de4ee0296bab92732d423ddc6ee607","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531/report_automation/commit/ee83edd987de4ee0296bab92732d423ddc6ee607","node_id":"C_kwDOTvuaoNoAKGVlODNlZGQ5ODdkZTRlZTAyOTZiYWI5MjczMmQ0MjNkZGM2ZWU2MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531/report_automation/commit/93c3023d504b056b707c078a3bf00ba1cacac35b","sha":"93c3023d504b056b707c078a3bf00ba1cacac35b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/93c3023d504b056b707c078a3bf00ba1cacac35b"}],"sha":"ee83edd987de4ee0296bab92732d423ddc6ee607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/ee83edd987de4ee0296bab92732d423ddc6ee607"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199019817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/followers","following_url":"https://api.githu