://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/c829a9cda215a69a4d5ee7aef7a9ff180058be8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:58:29Z","email":"3065884525@qq.com","name":"NIKI678531"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:58:29Z","email":"3065884525@qq.com","name":"NIKI678531"},"message":"修复 downgrade 里冗余的 drop_index，以及只在 Windows 成立的字体断言\n\nMySQL 报 1553 的根因不是\"先删索引还是先删外键\"，而是 autogenerate 在每个\ndrop_table 前都先写一行 drop_index。DROP TABLE 本来就会带走自己的索引，\n那些行全是冗余；列上带外键时，InnoDB 还要靠那个索引执行约束，于是直接拒绝。\nSQLite 是整表重建，两种写法都收，所以只有 CI 的真机 MySQL 看得见。\n8 个迁移共 25 处一次清干净，规则同步写进 CLAUDE.md 与 AGENTS.md。\n\n字体断言原来要求 data:font/ttf——那是 Windows 上的可变字体 .ttf。\nDebian 和 CI 装的是 .ttc 集合，编码成 data:font/collection。\n断言容器格式等于断言开发机；要证明的属性是\"字体随文档一起走\"，\n所以只断言 src:url(\"data:font/。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7de81df6fdad19676bb67e671475af97a9cbc77e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/trees/7de81df6fdad19676bb67e671475af97a9cbc77e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/commits/c829a9cda215a69a4d5ee7aef7a9ff180058be8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199019817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531","id":199019817,"login":"NIKI678531","node_id":"U_kgDOC9zNKQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531/report_automation/commit/c829a9cda215a69a4d5ee7aef7a9ff180058be8b","node_id":"C_kwDOTvuaoNoAKGM4MjlhOWNkYTIxNWE2OWE0ZDVlZTdhZWY3YTlmZjE4MDA1OGJlOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531/report_automation/commit/6b2e9d7f55c9acce9789737aa41814a693ea60ca","sha":"6b2e9d7f55c9acce9789737aa41814a693ea60ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/6b2e9d7f55c9acce9789737aa41814a693ea60ca"}],"sha":"c829a9cda215a69a4d5ee7aef7a9ff180058be8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/c829a9cda215a69a4d5ee7aef7a9ff180058be8b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199019817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531","id":199019817,"login":"NIKI678531","node_id":"U_kgDOC9zNKQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/6b2e9d7f55c9acce9789737aa41814a693ea60ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:46:48Z","email":"3065884525@qq.com","name":"NIKI678531"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:46:48Z","email":"3065884525@qq.com","name":"NIKI678531"},"message":"fix: CI 满覆盖后暴露的三处真实缺陷（MySQL downgrade 顺序、渲染字体、失败信息）\n\n基准数据发布后 CI 第一次跑满，三类此前从未执行过的检查同时报错。都不是新引入的问题，\n是原本没有跑到。\n\n1. 迁移 downgrade 在真机 MySQL 上必失败（error 1553）。`drop_index` 排在\n   `drop_constraint(fk)` 前面，而 InnoDB 要靠那个索引执行外键。SQLite 是整表重建、两种\n   顺序都收，所以只有 test_migrations_apply_to_a_real_mysql_database 才看得见。同一个错\n   在三个迁移里共四处，全部改成先删外键再删索引。\n\n2. 生产镜像与 CI 都缺报告要用的字体。模板字体栈是 Calibri, Carlito, Arial, sans-serif，\n   3033 基准也是按 Calibri 度量测的；Dockerfile 只装了 fonts-noto-cjk，runner 两个都没有，\n   Chromium 退到 Arial/Liberation，字宽变了、整页重排。这不只是测试环境的事——生产渲染出\n   来的 PDF 同样不是 Calibri 度量。两边统一装 fonts-crosextra-carlito（度量兼容、OFL 可再\n   分发）加 fonts-noto-cjk 与 fonts-noto-cjk-extra。中文变体的 @font-face 断言失败是同一根\n   因：没有 Noto CJK，_embedded_cjk_font_css() 直接返回空串。该函数同时改成只有 regular 没\n   有 bold 时也嵌入 regular（Debian 把粗体拆在 -extra 里），而不是一个都不嵌。\n\n3. 像素比对失败时只报第一页，改成一次列出四页实测值与基线。这组数字只在同一套字体栈内可比。\n\n本机 287 passed / 2 skipped；真机 MySQL 那条本机无 Docker，由 CI 验证。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5bf9584c84b344b2adfc186ee2c46e011cae61f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/trees/a5bf9584c84b344b2adfc186ee2c46e011cae61f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/commits/6b2e9d7f55c9acce9789737aa41814a693ea60ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199019817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531","id":199019817,"login":"NIKI678531","node_id":"U_kgDOC9zNKQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531/report_automation/commit/6b2e9d7f55c9acce9789737aa41814a693ea60ca","node_id":"C_kwDOTvuaoNoAKDZiMmU5ZDdmNTVjOWFjY2U5Nzg5NzM3YWE0MTgxNGE2OTNlYTYwY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531/report_automation/commit/03a2f0ed1b68f9dca902aa8ade28af89b9103fc0","sha":"03a2f0ed1b68f9dca902aa8ade28af89b9103fc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/03a2f0ed1b68f9dca902aa8ade28af89b9103fc0"}],"sha":"6b2e9d7f55c9acce9789737aa41814a693ea60ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/6b2e9d7f55c9acce9789737aa41814a693ea60ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199019817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531","id":199019817,"login":"NIKI678531","node_id":"U_kgDOC9zNKQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/03a2f0ed1b68f9dca902aa8ade28af89b9103fc0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:25:54Z","email":"3065884525@qq.com","name":"NIKI678531"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:25:54Z","email":"3065884525@qq.com","name":"NIKI678531"},"message":"test: 把批准的基准数据一并发布，CI 恢复满覆盖\n\n上一条提交让缺数据降级成跳过，代价是本仓库的 CI 只跑 226 项、跳 52 项——金标准断言、\n视觉 QA、整条 TESTING 通道流水线都不在覆盖里。既然这份数据可以进本仓库，就一并发出来，\n让 CI 真正守住它该守的东西。\n\n新增 backend/tests/fixtures/（约 375 KB）：3033_202606 的金标准快照、期望值、编辑稿与\n参考 PDF，以及 ingestion 的三份供应商样本。发布前按\"机密不外泄\"逐份查过，没有凭据类\n字符串（唯一命中的 \"token\" 是新闻正文里的 \"1-million-token context window\"）。\n\n跳过守卫保留：检出仍可能缺这份数据（精简导出、稀疏克隆），而那种情况应当是跳过，\n不该是收集阶段崩溃。conftest 的提示语与 CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md 随之改正——\n\"不便随源码发布\"这句已经不成立。\n\n在本快照树上实跑：287 passed / 2 skipped，退出码 0（跳过的两项是未配置 HSTECH 验收\n夹具与未设 TEST_MYSQL_URL，与基准数据无关）。前端未受影响。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ec84ca874fc846153d7cf55ac0829bb0227fc6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/trees/2ec84ca874fc846153d7cf55ac0829bb0227fc6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/commits/03a2f0ed1b68f9dca902aa8ade28af89b9103fc0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199019817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531","id":199019817,"login":"NIKI678531","node_id":"U_kgDOC9zNKQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531/report_automation/commit/03a2f0ed1b68f9dca902aa8ade28af89b9103fc0","node_id":"C_kwDOTvuaoNoAKDAzYTJmMGVkMWI2OGY5ZGNhOTAyYWE4YWRlMjhhZjg5YjkxMDNmYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531/report_automation/commit/abb04d3c7d316c49d8af0e599da2039bcb0c9dcd","sha":"abb04d3c7d316c49d8af0e599da2039bcb0c9dcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/abb04d3c7d316c49d8af0e599da2039bcb0c9dcd"}],"sha":"03a2f0ed1b68f9dca902aa8ade28af89b9103fc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/03a2f0ed1b68f9dca902aa8ade28af89b9103fc0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199019817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NIKI678531","id":199019817,"login":"NIKI678531","node_id":"U_kgDOC9zNKQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/abb04d3c7d316c49d8af0e599da2039bcb0c9dcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:17:49Z","email":"3065884525@qq.com","name":"NIKI678531"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:17:49Z","email":"3065884525@qq.com","name":"NIKI678531"},"message":"fix(tests): 缺少本地专有基准数据时跳过而不是在收集阶段崩溃\n\nCI 报的是 `FileNotFoundError: backend/tests/fixtures/3033_202606/expected.json`，\n`Interrupted: 1 error during collection`，退出码 2，`npm ci` 那一步压根没跑到。\n\n原因不是代码坏了，是数据不在这份检出里。`backend/tests/fixtures/` 装的是照批准报告\n转录的金标准和供应商 EOD 样本，按既定口径不随源码发布；而 test_golden_expectations\n在**导入期**就 `json.loads` 那个文件，于是\"数据缺失\"变成了收集错误，整轮测试还没开始\n就死了，日志读起来像套件坏了。\n\n- `conftest.require_fixtures()`：缺失即跳过并写清原因。导入期读文件的模块\n  （golden_expectations、visual_qa）用 `module_level=True`，否则守卫写在下面已经晚了\n- conftest 的测试客户端把应用返回的 503 `FIXTURE_MISSING` 转成同一个跳过。走 TESTING\n  通道的用例从不自己碰文件，是应用去读的；在这里认这一个错误码，好过让三十多处各自加\n  守卫——那种守卫下一个新用例就会忘\n- `addopts = \"-rs\"`：每条跳过原因进日志。覆盖变少的那一轮自己会说，而不是看着像满绿\n\n有基准数据（本机）：287 passed / 2 skipped。\n本快照树（无基准数据）：226 passed / 52 skipped，退出码 0；npm ci / npm test /\nnpm run build 亦全绿。应用代码与前端未改动。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d4f1bd34bf543ebe15bcb6deb47026e624959cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/trees/3d4f1bd34bf543ebe15bcb6deb47026e624959cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/commits/abb04d3c7d316c49d8af0e599da2039bcb0c9dcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avata