login":"NIKI678531","node_id":"U_kgDOC9zNKQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/commits/ee693f64653686d4438b9142c4e05b291a492605/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T06:45:36Z","email":"3065884525@qq.com","name":"NIKI678531"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T06:45:36Z","email":"3065884525@qq.com","name":"NIKI678531"},"message":"chore: publish sanitized source snapshot (上线加固)\n\n安全边界：ENTRA 令牌校验（JWKS 缓存/算法白名单/aud-iss-exp）、纯 ASGI 授权中间件、\n产品范围过滤行返回 404、上传流式限额、下载 HMAC+TTL+绑定 subject、启动配置守卫。\n\n对象存储：storage 拆为端口 + LOCAL/S3 两个后端（TOS/MinIO/AWS 通用），未实现的后端\n直接拒绝启动而非退回本地磁盘；下载改流式，对象丢失返回 404 ARTIFACT_CONTENT_MISSING。\n\nMySQL 适配：连接池 pre_ping/recycle、utf8mb4、索引键长度约束、CI 用真实 MySQL 8.4\n跑完整迁移链。另有 scripts/check_deployment.py 上线自检（支持 --env-file）。\n\n与 main 上一份快照一致，仍不包含 docs/、测试基准数据与本地产物。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9062534592389b697534886a11b02cde81847a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/trees/d9062534592389b697534886a11b02cde81847a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIKI678531/report_automation/git/commits/ee693f64653686d4438b9142c4e05b291a492605","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199019817?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIKI678531/followers","followin