"phcaradanai@gmail.com","name":"phcaradanai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T10:53:14Z","email":"phcaradanai@gmail.com","name":"phcaradanai"},"message":"feat(platform): identity closure - real GitHub OAuth e2e + provisioning path (Phase 3.1)\n\n- scripts/provision-identities.mjs: validated provisioning path for\n  catalog Users and Platform Admin membership (lowercase-login entity\n  names, known groups only, --check CI guard)\n- examples/org.provisioned.yaml: committed groups-only production org\n  file; app-config.production.yaml imports it (guest fixture never\n  enters the production catalog) and catalog location targets fixed\n  for the real boot context\n- live-verified real GitHub OAuth sign-in against the production-style\n  config: catalog gate rejects unprovisioned accounts and accepts\n  provisioned ones; Developer vs Platform Admin authorize matrices\n  proven; guest provider 404 in production; unauthenticated 401\n- hermetic guards: signInResolver.test.ts (sign-in gate),\n  productionConfig.test.ts (real config-loader merge: guest:null\n  deletes the provider), identityProvisioning.test.ts (script + strict\n  parser regression)\n- docs: identity-and-access, github-integration (manifest flow),\n  catalog-model, getting-started (better-sqlite3 ABI note), ADR 0003,\n  phase 3.1 closure report","tree":{"sha":"d434d1e4f75a97798fbcc1be2e5839bc99db9f84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/git/trees/d434d1e4f75a97798fbcc1be2e5839bc99db9f84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/git/commits/0ba1fef441703e96124887f4f74a2cb4f7a650c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60093492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/followers","following_url":"http