https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commits/973581dbe2095df8d055fc02687ee6c9352325a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T07:56:47Z","email":"phcaradanai@gmail.com","name":"phcaradanai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T07:56:47Z","email":"phcaradanai@gmail.com","name":"phcaradanai"},"message":"feat(platform): real Backstage identity and access foundation (Phase 3.1)\n\nReplaces guest-only auth and permission-backend-module-allow-all-policy\nwith a real Platform Admin / Developer model:\n\n- PlatformAccessPolicy (packages/backend/src/permissions/policy.ts):\n  group:default/platform-admins gets everything, any other signed-in\n  user gets an explicit Catalog + Scaffolder allow-list covering the App\n  Factory''s create flow, everything else denies by default.\n- GitHub OAuth (already-registered-but-inert module from Phase 1) is now\n  the real production sign-in path: app-config.production.yaml deletes\n  the guest provider (`null`, verified via config:print/config:check to\n  actually drop from the merged config) and requires\n  usernameMatchingUserEntityName without the dangerous\n  sign-in-without-catalog-user bypass, so sign-in itself is the access\n  gate. Guest stays on for local development only.\n- examples/org.yaml gains an empty-by-default platform-admins group.\n\nVerified via: 5 policy unit tests; 16 live /api/permission/authorize\nchecks against a running backend (guest/Developer token) matching the\npolicy exactly; a live fetch:template -> publish:github ->\ncatalog:register scaffolder task creating a real GitHub repo, proving\nthe create flow still works end to end under the new deny-by-default\npolicy; and backstage-cli config:check confirming the production config\nstill validates with guest deleted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6233ff5685d5b68ba96a77cabf224c1620072e83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/git/trees/6233ff5685d5b68ba96a77cabf224c1620072e83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/git/commits/973581dbe2095df8d055fc02687ee6c9352325a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60093492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phcaradanai","id":60093492,"login":"phcaradanai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDkzNDky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commit/973581dbe2095df8d055fc02687ee6c9352325a5","node_id":"C_kwDOTvycvNoAKDk3MzU4MWRiZTIwOTVkZjhkMDU1ZmMwMjY4N2VlNmM5MzUyMzI1YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commit/5275e72ad24c15e2f82355b97048d9007d5d81a3","sha":"5275e72ad24c15e2f82355b97048d9007d5d81a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commits/5275e72ad24c15e2f82355b97048d9007d5d81a3"}],"sha":"973581dbe2095df8d055fc02687ee6c9352325a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commits/973581dbe2095df8d055fc02687ee6c9352325a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60093492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phcaradanai","id":60093492,"login":"phcaradanai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDkzNDky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commits/5275e72ad24c15e2f82355b97048d9007d5d81a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T06:18:59Z","email":"phcaradanai@gmail.com","name":"phcaradanai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T06:18:59Z","email":"phcaradanai@gmail.com","name":"phcaradanai"},"message":"feat(platform): @platform/sdk - stable platform contracts for generated apps\n\nIntroduces the first stable @platform/sdk contract (identity, runtime info,\nnavigation, auth, permissions, tenant) that generated apps consume without\ndepending on Backstage or future Super App internals, vendored into the\nskeleton the same way @platform/ui already is. Auth/permissions/tenant fail\nclosed and report \"unavailable\" until a real provider exists to back them;\nnavigation is router-agnostic with a working standalone default. Generalizes\nthe Phase 2.1 vendor-staleness guard (fingerprint + lockfile-integrity check)\nto cover both vendored packages instead of just @platform/ui.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e786283ad0540b002bf2c5bff42a92e302d4c9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/git/trees/8e786283ad0540b002bf2c5bff42a92e302d4c9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/git/commits/5275e72ad24c15e2f82355b97048d9007d5d81a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60093492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phcaradanai","id":60093492,"login":"phcaradanai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDkzNDky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commit/5275e72ad24c15e2f82355b97048d9007d5d81a3","node_id":"C_kwDOTvycvNoAKDUyNzVlNzJhZDI0YzE1ZTJmODIzNTViOTcwNDhkOTAwN2Q1ZDgxYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commit/690c3bbf5068f46fda36a8b03d6827f33a8308da","sha":"690c3bbf5068f46fda36a8b03d6827f33a8308da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commits/690c3bbf5068f46fda36a8b03d6827f33a8308da"}],"sha":"5275e72ad24c15e2f82355b97048d9007d5d81a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commits/5275e72ad24c15e2f82355b97048d9007d5d81a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60093492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phcaradanai","id":60093492,"login":"phcaradanai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDkzNDky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commits/690c3bbf5068f46fda36a8b03d6827f33a8308da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T05:00:47Z","email":"phcaradanai@gmail.com","name":"phcaradanai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T05:00:47Z","email":"phcaradanai@gmail.com","name":"phcaradanai"},"message":"fix(platform): Spinner a11y + CI guard against stale @platform/ui vendor tarball\n\nSpinner was unconditionally aria-hidden with no way to expose it to\nassistive tech, so a standalone spinner (e.g. the components.tsx demo\nroute) is invisible to screen reader users. It now accepts an optional\naria-label and only stays decorative (aria-hidden) when none is given.\n\nThe vendored tarball/lockfile had already drifted from source: the\npackage.json contract only declared `className`, so the demo route''s\n`<Spinner aria-label=\"Loading\" />` didn''t typecheck against the\nvendored package - the exact class of gap the Phase 2.1 report flagged\n(hermetic template-validation tests reimplement logic rather than\nexercising the real artifact, so this went undetected). Rebuilt\n@platform/ui, re-packed and re-vendored the tarball, and regenerated\nthe skeleton lockfile from scratch (npm install doesn''t re-hash an\nexisting file: dependency - the same root cause behind the Phase 2.1\nEINTEGRITY incident).\n\nAdded two regression tests plus a checked-in source fingerprint\n(templates/platform-mfe-app/vendor-manifest.json, kept outside\nskeleton/ since vendor/** ships verbatim into generated apps) so CI\nnow fails if @platform/ui''s source changes without the tarball being\nrebuilt, or if the tarball changes without the lockfile being\nregenerated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e616ad197c97eb72e04fe40102c5f0f73c5342a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/git/trees/e616ad197c97eb72e04fe40102c5f0f73c5342a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/git/commits/690c3bbf5068f46fda36a8b03d6827f33a8308da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60093492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phcaradanai","id":60093492,"login":"phcaradanai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDkzNDky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commit/690c3bbf5068f46fda36a8b03d6827f33a8308da","node_id":"C_kwDOTvycvNoAKDY5MGMzYmJmNTA2OGY0NmZkYTM2YThiMDNkNjgyN2YzM2E4MzA4ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commit/79706628f16d1a759c0e19d244b683dcbac95108","sha":"79706628f16d1a759c0e19d244b683dcbac95108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commits/79706628f16d1a759c0e19d244b683dcbac95108"}],"sha":"690c3bbf5068f46fda36a8b03d6827f33a8308da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commits/690c3bbf5068f46fda36a8b03d6827f33a8308da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60093492?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phcaradanai","id":60093492,"login":"phcaradanai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDkzNDky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phcaradanai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/commits/79706628f16d1a759c0e19d244b683dcbac95108/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:47:09Z","email":"60093492+phcaradanai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"phcaradanai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:47:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(platform): shared Platform UI + design tokens via @platform/ui package (#5)\n\nEstablishes the shared visual language for generated applications:\n\n- New packages/platform-ui workspace (@platform/ui, v0.1.0): semantic\n  design tokens (theme.css, light/dark/system), UnoCSS preset\n  (theme/shortcuts/preflights), cn util, ThemeProvider/Toggle, feedback\n  states + QueryBoundary, and the 13 Radix primitives consolidated from\n  the Phase 2 boilerplate. NotFoundState made router-agnostic (action\n  prop). Builds ESM via tsc (NodeNext, .js extensions), ships dist +\n  theme.css, lints via the Backstage factory config.\n- Generated apps consume @platform/ui as a vendored tarball\n  (file:./vendor/platform-ui-0.1.0.tgz, ~20KB) committed in the skeleton\n  with the lockfile recording its integrity hash - versioned, offline,\n  reproducible, no registry needed. renderers + template.yaml copy\n  vendor/** byte-exact (binary-safe, copyWithoutTemplating).\n- Skeleton refactored to import from @platform/ui (deleted moved\n  components/cn/theme.css); uno.config consumes the shared preset and\n  scans node_modules/@platform/ui/dist so package utilities are\n  generated; main.tsx imports @platform/ui/theme.css.\n- New /components catalog route in the skeleton: visual verification of\n  every primitive, linked from the header.\n- Template validation: 6 new assertions (61 total) - vendor tarball\n  present + gzip, vendor/** in copyWithoutTemplating, file: dep pin in\n  package.json + lockfile, moved files absent from skeleton, catalog\n  route + routeTree, uno preset + token import.\n- Fixed a latent e2e flake (strict-mode getByText matched the toast too;\n  exact:true) and the vendored-lockfile EINTEGRITY trap (npm install\n  never re-hashes an existing file: dep - regenerate the lockfile from\n  scratch when the tarball changes).\n\nVerified: control plane tsc/lint/test:all (8 suites, 66 tests)/build\ngreen; hermetic render npm ci + typecheck/lint/6 suites/24 tests/build/\n5 e2e green, no stray ${{; real scaffolder E2E repo\nplatform-p21-shared-ui2 CI green 1m24s (npm ci -> lint -> typecheck ->\ntest -> build -> playwright -> e2e), tarball byte-identical, lockfile\nhash matches. Failed first E2E (EINTEGRITY, stale lockfile hash) kept as\nevidence.","tree":{"sha":"0fd483ad70defb28c2c691120e7932fd43d54d62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/git/trees/0fd483ad70defb28c2c691120e7932fd43d54d62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phcaradanai/platform-control-plane/git/commits/79706628f16d1a759c0e19d244b683dcbac95108","verification":{"payload":"tree 0fd483ad70defb28c2c691120e7932fd43d54d62\nparent 62523d97217fac694a4874057be47c20d9de9133\nauthor phcaradanai <60093492+phcaradanai@users.noreply.github.com> 1786247229 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786247229 +0700\n\nfeat(platform): shared Platform UI + design tokens via @platform/ui package (#5)\n\nEstablishes the shared visual language for generated applications:\n\n- New packages/platform-ui workspace (@platform/ui, v0.1.0): semantic\n  design tokens (theme.css, light/dark/system), UnoCSS preset\n  (theme/shortcuts/preflights), cn util, ThemeProvider/Toggle, feedback\n  states + QueryBoundary, and the 13 Radix primitives consolidated from\n  the Phase 2 boilerplate. NotFoundState made router-agnostic (action\n  prop). Builds ESM via tsc (NodeNext, .js extensions), ships dist +\n  theme.css, lints via the Backstage factory config.\n- Generated apps consume @platform/ui as a vendored tarball\n  (file:./vendor/platform-ui-0.1.0.tgz, ~20KB) committed in the skeleton\n  with the lockfile recording its integrity hash - versioned, offline,\n  reproducible, no registry needed. renderers + template.yaml copy\n  vendor/** byte-exact (binary-safe, copyWithoutTemplating).\n- Skeleton refactored to import from @platform/ui (deleted moved\n  components/cn/theme.css); uno.config consumes the shared preset and\n  scans node_modules/@platform/ui/dist so package utilities are\n  generated; main.tsx imports @platform/ui/theme.css.\n- New /components catalog route in the skeleton: visual verification of\n  every primitive, linked from the header.\n- Template validation: 6 new assertions (61 total) - vendor tarball\n  present + gzip, vendor/** in copyWithoutTemplating, file: dep pin in\n  package.json + lockfile, moved files absent from skeleton, catalog\n  route + routeTree, uno preset + token import.\n- Fixed a latent e2e flake (strict-mode getByText matched the toast too;\n  exact:true) and the vendored-lockfile EINTEGRITY trap (npm install\n  never re-hashes an existing file: dep - regenerate the lockfile from\n  scratch when the tarball changes).\n\nVerified: control plane tsc/lint/test:all (8 suites, 66 tests)/build\ngreen; hermetic render npm ci + typecheck/lint/6 suites/24 tests/build/\n5 e2e green, no stray ${{; real scaffolder E2E repo\nplatform-p21-shared-ui2 CI green 1m24s (npm ci -> lint -> typecheck ->\ntest -> build -> playwright -> e2e), tarball byte-identical, lockfile\nhash matches. Failed first E2E (EINTEGRITY, stale lockfile hash) kept as\nevidence.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqd/g9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3UkQACcI/sfUwRw9NlAl6XZmSsrV\nNpwhSmZWhKz8jLiO7Et+0eQ3KNzQ1LOxhmMw43HHNOl66nQUEXWcltNZ8m1j8N33\ndR