kyll present and the branch content correct. The artifact\nroute is what the sibling Cart repo uses without trouble.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63026b00b03c6da46ad4a5ddb52f72a5c80b7c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-shell/git/trees/63026b00b03c6da46ad4a5ddb52f72a5c80b7c95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-shell/git/commits/f9e509a3ed6231ff2c48c6bba6103ed032d17b8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180862618?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sara-Qadi","id":180862618,"login":"Sara-Qadi","node_id":"U_kgDOCse-mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-shell/commit/f9e509a3ed6231ff2c48c6bba6103ed032d17b8b","node_id":"C_kwDOTv0gKtoAKGY5ZTUwOWEzZWQ2MjMxZmYyYzQ4YzZiYmE2MTAzZWQwMzJkMTdiOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-shell/commit/03bd62cd1270f96d5ca3a223514a210e2a8bf9e9","sha":"03bd62cd1270f96d5ca3a223514a210e2a8bf9e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-shell/commits/03bd62cd1270f96d5ca3a223514a210e2a8bf9e9"}],"sha":"f9e509a3ed6231ff2c48c6bba6103ed032d17b8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-shell/commits/f9e509a3ed6231ff2c48c6bba6103ed032d17b8b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180862618?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sara-Qadi","id":180862618,"login":"Sara-Qadi","node_id":"U_kgDOCse-mg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sara-Qadi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sara-Qadi/fashion-elan-shell/commits/03bd62cd1270f96d5ca3a223514a210e2a8bf9e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T13:07:08Z","email":"sara.2002.qado@gmail.com","name":"Sara-Qadi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T13:07:08Z","email":"sara.2002.qado@gmail.com","name":"Sara-Qadi"},"message":"Publish via a gh-pages branch instead of the Pages deployment API\n\nactions/deploy-pages succeeded once here and then failed twice with ''Timeout\nreached, aborting!'' and no error detail, while GitHub reported Pages as fully\noperational. Pushing the build to a branch is a plain git operation with nothing\nin between to time out, and it leaves the published output inspectable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8328ad07d8d6d9013df06783ae7d073d1f