1T17:51:23Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:51:23Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"docs: V°B° del jefe directo aplicado en produccion (funciones-y-permisos 169)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a072414a8e4742df952923a5162875b73bb589c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/9a072414a8e4742df952923a5162875b73bb589c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/44097c580b061b84f0ebe7a2c3380172d8daacf0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/44097c580b061b84f0ebe7a2c3380172d8daacf0","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDQ0MDk3YzU4MGIwNjFiODRmMGViZTdhMmMzMzgwMTcyZDhkYWFjZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/09a7bf0156aa91a79ab737c6488806a530e55fbe","sha":"09a7bf0156aa91a79ab737c6488806a530e55fbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/09a7bf0156aa91a79ab737c6488806a530e55fbe"}],"sha":"44097c580b061b84f0ebe7a2c3380172d8daacf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/44097c580b061b84f0ebe7a2c3380172d8daacf0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/09a7bf0156aa91a79ab737c6488806a530e55fbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:45:41Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:45:41Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"solicitudes: el jefe directo da su visto bueno desde su buzon\n\nEl jefe inmediato se elige de la lista de usuarios del BackOffice por su codigo\n(jefes_disponibles; el documento ya no se acepta del cliente y nadie se elige a\nsi mismo). resolver_solicitud deja dar el paso jefe al jefe designado sin\nexigirle el modulo; lo ve en Mi solicitud (solicitudes_por_mi_visto_bueno) con\ndar visto bueno / observar / rechazar, y el globito del boton lo cuenta. Recibe\nsu propio correo con enlace al buzon (api_admin_correo_por_dni, solo servicio).\nLa jefatura (nivel de aprobacion) y el supervisor de sede conservan su via.\nMigracion y reversion generadas por scripts/jefe-generar.mjs; ensayar-jefe\n15/15; invariante 26 en ensayar-canon; el cliente tolera la base sin migrar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9547a7934162b61f14340b28e9f7f92721c4a95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/c9547a7934162b61f14340b28e9f7f92721c4a95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/09a7bf0156aa91a79ab737c6488806a530e55fbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/09a7bf0156aa91a79ab737c6488806a530e55fbe","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDA5YTdiZjAxNTZhYTkxYTc5YWI3MzdjNjQ4ODgwNmE1MzBlNTVmYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/cf29be7c4baa522991bdebbf397aa56661d7d29a","sha":"cf29be7c4baa522991bdebbf397aa56661d7d29a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/cf29be7c4baa522991bdebbf397aa56661d7d29a"}],"sha":"09a7bf0156aa91a79ab737c6488806a530e55fbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/09a7bf0156aa91a79ab737c6488806a530e55fbe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/cf29be7c4baa522991bdebbf397aa56661d7d29a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:26:36Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:26:36Z",