e las cuentas del portal (portal.grupoer.pe) ni\nlas versiones 1 y 2 de la politica de datos (historia inmutable).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26c540c433f80655ff783c4ca3abff874aafe49a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/26c540c433f80655ff783c4ca3abff874aafe49a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/f02c6799c91c49d72c0a35119633c6c8dce20e36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/f02c6799c91c49d72c0a35119633c6c8dce20e36","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGYwMmM2Nzk5YzkxYzQ5ZDcyYzBhMzUxMTk2MzNjNmM4ZGNlMjBlMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/c750320b5aac2ec0db1d9ed5711291047f924351","sha":"c750320b5aac2ec0db1d9ed5711291047f924351","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/c750320b5aac2ec0db1d9ed5711291047f924351"}],"sha":"f02c6799c91c49d72c0a35119633c6c8dce20e36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/f02c6799c91c49d72c0a35119633c6c8dce20e36"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/c750320b5aac2ec0db1d9ed5711291047f924351/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:17:26Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:17:26Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"politica de datos v3: el punto 1 nombra a la razon social de la planilla del trabajador\n\nLa plantilla lleva la marca {{RESPONSABLE}}; v_declaraciones_vigentes la\nentrega resuelta por sesion (fn_politica_responsable: razon social y RUC del\nvinculo vigente o del ultimo) y portal_primer_ingreso guarda en consentimientos\nese mismo texto. El formato en papel aplica la misma regla (api/_politica.js).\nMigracion y reversion generadas por scripts/politica-generar.mjs; ensayo local\nensayar-politica 11/11; invariante nuevo en ensayar-canon (25). El texto v3\nya usa el nombre IntraTech.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78ab3aac9ccd97d8a0ca5b3d90357ece43e8699d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/78ab3aac9ccd97d8a0ca5b3d90357ece43e8699d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/c750320b5aac2ec0db1d9ed5711291047f924351","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/c750320b5aac2ec0db1d9ed5711291047f924351","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGM3NTAzMjBiNWFhYzJlYzBkYjFkOWVkNTcxMTI5MTA0N2Y5MjQzNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/24b646b4c633ac801371545861adda367cae821a","sha":"24b646b4c633ac801371545861adda367cae821a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/24b646b4c633ac801371545861adda367cae821a"}],"sha":"c750320b5aac2ec0db1d9ed5711291047f924351","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/c750320b5aac2ec0db1d9ed5711291047f924351"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/24b646b4c633ac801371545861adda367cae821a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:37:31Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:37:31Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"dominio: servicios-intranet.net pasa a ser la direccion oficial (enlaces de correos y PDFs)\n\nLa constante APP de las seis funciones de api/ apunta al dominio propio;\nintranet-general.vercel.app sigue vivo para enlaces antiguos y scripts de\nverificacion. scripts/configurar-dominio-a