evisualizar_planilla_unificada → 403 «Verifica el código»,\n  previsualizar_padron rechazada; tras verificar, la cuenta ya no es null;\n  el catálogo comprueba que las funciones de guarda propia consultan el factor.\n- Documento del segundo factor (§1, §3, §5, §6), README §7 (22 invariantes) y\n  MODELO.md (seguridad.sql ya no es re-aplicable sobre una base migrada).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a5b1452af1870830306d5f73858aff0b50607ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/1a5b1452af1870830306d5f73858aff0b50607ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/3365280bfbb42d3bbbdf94fe6ef3ba6e1c573536","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/3365280bfbb42d3bbbdf94fe6ef3ba6e1c573536","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDMzNjUyODBiZmJiNDJkM2JiYmRmOTRmZTZlZjNiYTZlMWM1NzM1MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/9d01c50dfc756d2eb28d1b1e865f8a471a4deb8a","sha":"9d01c50dfc756d2eb28d1b1e865f8a471a4deb8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/9d01c50dfc756d2eb28d1b1e865f8a471a4deb8a"}],"sha":"3365280bfbb42d3bbbdf94fe6ef3ba6e1c573536","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/3365280bfbb42d3bbbdf94fe6ef3ba6e1c573536"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/9d01c50dfc756d2eb28d1b1e865f8a471a4deb8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:02:59Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:02:59Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"backoffice(factor): la pantalla del código aparece cuando la marca vence, ante un 42501 y al encender el factor\n\n- state.jsx: temporizador hasta expiraEn que re-resuelve la sesión; un 42501\n  a un superadmin re-resuelve una vez (bandera); cualquier error de\n  mi_segundo_factor distinto de PGRST202 publica al usuario como pendiente;\n  guardar la política encendiendo el factor re-resuelve la propia sesión.\n- SegundoFactor.jsx: si tras verificar la sesión sigue pendiente, vuelve al\n  código con «No se pudo completar el ingreso. Pide un código nuevo.».\n- Politica.jsx: aviso de que la propia sesión pedirá el código al encenderlo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1906b19dda3f68350017d029bab321ac905e2d47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/1906b19dda3f68350017d029bab321ac905e2d47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/9d01c50dfc756d2eb28d1b1e865f8a471a4deb8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/9d01c50dfc756d2eb28d1b1e865f8a471a4deb8a","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDlkMDFjNTBkZmM3NTZkMmViMjhkMWIxZTg2NWY4YTQ3MWE0ZGViOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/3b25635952ec885cba33a7b50a9918f3b3506791","sha":"3b25635952ec885cba33a7b50a9918f3b3506791","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/3b25635952ec885cba33a7b50a9918f3b3506791"}],"sha":"9d01c50dfc756d2eb28d1b1e865f8a471a4deb8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/9d01c50dfc756d2eb28d1b1e865f8a471a4deb8a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/3b25635952ec885cba33a7b50a9918f3b3506791/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:00:08Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:00:08Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"api(factor): cubo de tasa propio para el segundo factor y fallo cerrado ante 200 sin JSON\n\nlimitar/contar: con accion = segundo-factor solo cuentan sus propias filas y\nno las «limitado» (tras el NAT de la oficina, los avisos de solicitudes ya no\ndejan al superadmin sin BackOffice); las demás acciones no cambian.\n_factor.js: un 200 cuyo cuerpo no es un objeto JSON bloquea.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fce76aefd6612c9215e0206607670275720fa75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/1fce76aefd6612c9215e0206607670275720fa75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/3b25635952ec885cba33a7b50a9918f3b3506791","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/3b25635952ec885cba33a7b50a9918f3b3506791","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDNiMjU2MzU5NTJlYzg4NWNiYTMzYTdiNTBhOTkxOGYzYjM1MDY3OTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/eb33812a5c50341fe5ffa04eb0a2f045294fc2e0","sha":"eb33812a5c50341fe5ffa04eb0a2f045294fc2e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/eb33812a5c50341fe5ffa04eb0a2f045294fc2e0"}],"sha":"3b25635952ec885cba33a7b50a9918f3b3506791","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/3b25635952ec885cba33a7b50a9918f3b3506791"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/eb33812a5c50341fe5ffa04eb0a2f045294fc2e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:58:33Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:58:33Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"seguridad(factor): las funciones que deciden «superadmin» por su cuenta consultan el factor\n\nSección 7 de factor.sql: fn_ver_cuenta_bancaria, fn_nivel_memorandums e\nimportar_planilla_unificada se reescriben desde su definición vigente\n(pg_get_functiondef) con sustitución exacta verificada (aborta si el texto no\naparece una sola vez). importar_padron/importar_control ya empiezan con\nfn_nivel_modulo(...) < 2 y no se tocan. La migración las respalda y la\nreversión las restaura (foto idéntica); ensayar-factor cubre pendiente y\nverificado; ensayar-canon vigila que no aparezca otra función así.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a843b7e35fcd318fdc39f766582a0a12e6a630c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/2a843b7e35fcd318fdc39f766582a0a12e6a630c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/eb33812a5c50341fe5ffa04eb0a2f045294fc2e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/eb33812a5c50341fe5ffa04eb0a2f045294fc2e0","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGViMzM4MTJhNWM1MDM0MWZlNWZmYTA0ZWIwYTJmMDQ1Mjk0ZmMyZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/e1585bac766dccc6ed6308d7a9bff49f6d912f75","sha":"e1585bac766dccc6ed6308d7a9bff49f6d912f75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/e1585bac766dccc6ed6308d7a9bff49f6d912f75"}],"sha":"eb33812a5c50341fe5ffa04eb0a2f045294fc2e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/eb33812a5c50341fe5ffa04eb0a2f045294fc2e0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/e1585bac766dccc6ed6308d7a9bff49f6d912f75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:34:55Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:34:55Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguer