 fase 4 (nada para anon, ningún otro privilegio).\n- funciones-y-permisos.mjs reconoce las funciones cerradas (cuerpo = RAISE) y\n  docs/funciones-y-permisos.md regenerado desde prod: 153 funciones, 0 sin guarda.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49a25941263b6b19447d367d6e4d66baee7b1ee0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/49a25941263b6b19447d367d6e4d66baee7b1ee0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/106d7ea81f4b03a2e5ad5d59d5205006331721f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/106d7ea81f4b03a2e5ad5d59d5205006331721f0","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDEwNmQ3ZWE4MWY0YjAzYTJlNWFkNWQ1OWQ1MjA1MDA2MzMxNzIxZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/63b72f03774d6778c9e4615284e13d3385d246ea","sha":"63b72f03774d6778c9e4615284e13d3385d246ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/63b72f03774d6778c9e4615284e13d3385d246ea"}],"sha":"106d7ea81f4b03a2e5ad5d59d5205006331721f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/106d7ea81f4b03a2e5ad5d59d5205006331721f0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/63b72f03774d6778c9e4615284e13d3385d246ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:25:33Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:25:33Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"soporte(TI): sale del Portal del Trabajador y pasa a «Mi solicitud» del BackOffice\n\nDecisión de Diego (2026-09-22): los tickets de Soporte TI los abren los\nusuarios administrativos a su propio nombre, no los trabajadores del portal.\n\n- Portal: sin pestaña, ruta ni pantalla Soporte (barra: Inicio · Boletas · Yo).\n- BD (canónico soporte.sql + migración 2026-09-22-soporte-ti-backoffice.sql):\n  portal_crear_ticket queda cerrada (siempre rechaza; firma y grants intactos\n  para los inventarios de seguridad); crear_ticket_propio (identidad por\n  fn_persona_llamador, sin módulo) y v_mis_tickets (sin nota interna);\n  EXECUTE concedido también en el espejo seguridad.sql.\n- BackOffice: «Mi solicitud» gana el formulario de Soporte TI (catálogo de\n  v_ticket_config) y el buzón «Mis tickets»; aviso por correo igual que SOP-01.\n- Pruebas: invariante nuevo en ensayar-canon (18/18) y caso en\n  verificar-soporte; vitest 204/204; builds y comprobar-paquete verdes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e583319f9aa325f66aacf17cbdc9c2ca7da83667","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/e583319f9aa325f66aacf17cbdc9c2ca7da83667"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/63b72f03774d6778c9e4615284e13d3385d246ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/63b72f03774d6778c9e4615284e13d3385d246ea","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDYzYjcyZjAzNzc0ZDY3NzhjOWU0NjE1Mjg0ZTEzZDMzODVkMjQ2ZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/ac66cf54c50ddebdc3790132e3d25bd1f040c977","sha":"ac66cf54c50ddebdc3790132e3d25bd1f040c977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/ac66cf54c50ddebdc3790132e3d25bd1f040c977"}],"sha":"63b72f03774d6778c9e4615284e13d3385d246ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/63b72f03774d6778c9e4615284e13d3385d246ea"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/ac66cf54c50ddebdc3790132e3d25bd1f040c977/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:07:14Z","em