2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/74027c16cbffb7489c881e6aed981f7052815282"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/710f1e2df759fc9283ad69c7430afce562b04ba8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T21:51:06Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T21:51:06Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"seguridad(fase 5): auditoria sin valores sensibles (5a aplicada), migracion de redaccion del historico (5b, pendiente de aprobacion) y criterio de notificacion (P16)\n\n- supabase/auditoria.sql: interno.columnas_sensibles (lista definida),\n  fn_auditar registra [sensible]/[sensible: cambiado] en vez del valor,\n  fn_redactar_historico (regla de la redaccion).\n- 5a aplicada y verificada en produccion (prueba de comportamiento revertida).\n- 5b: unica excepcion a la inmutabilidad, exige set fase5b.aprobado_por,\n  deja rastro REDACCION_HISTORICO con conteos; sin reversion por diseño.\n  Inventario actual: 377 filas (cuenta_cifrada 282, sesion_actual 47,\n  cuenta 40, clave_provisional 7, cci 5, clave_equipo 1). NO ejecutada.\n- scripts/ensayar-fase5.mjs 9/9; verificar-fase5 imprime el inventario\n  mientras 5b no se aplique.\n- docs/seguridad/criterio-notificacion-brecha.md (P16).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6009627a96fc6a73f27e551284493823c6ab4474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/6009627a96fc6a73f27e551284493823c6ab4474"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/710f1e2df759fc9283ad69c7430afce562b04ba8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/710f1e2df759fc9283ad69c7430afce562b04ba8","node_id":"C