ents","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:41:04Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:41:04Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"docs(seguridad): fase 3a aplicada en produccion y verificada\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c1c500b32324765b60161f400f09006f9ccd2d21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/c1c500b32324765b60161f400f09006f9ccd2d21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/870110422bb756385071710a844721225ba900d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/870110422bb756385071710a844721225ba900d5","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDg3MDExMDQyMmJiNzU2Mzg1MDcxNzEwYTg0NDcyMTIyNWJhOTAwZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/97fa83c2e3a872f7372ef6eb9080b464f9beadb3","sha":"97fa83c2e3a872f7372ef6eb9080b464f9beadb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/97fa83c2e3a872f7372ef6eb9080b464f9beadb3"}],"sha":"870110422bb756385071710a844721225ba900d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/870110422bb756385071710a844721225ba900d5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/97fa83c2e3a872f7372ef6eb9080b464f9beadb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:33:57Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:33:57Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"seguridad(fase 3a): esquema privado interno (10 tablas), funciones de servicio para la API y ensayo 18/18\n\nNO desplegar antes de aplicar fase3a1 en produccion (api/*.js ya llama a las\nfunciones de servicio). Orden sin ventana: fase3a1 → push → verificar →\nfase3a2 → verificar (docs/seguridad/2026-09-18-fase3a-esquema-interno.md §5).\n\n- supabase/api-servicio.sql: 6 funciones definer solo para service_role que\n  reemplazan los 17 accesos directos de api/*.js a usuarios_admin y correo_tokens.\n- scripts/fase3-generar.mjs: fase3a1 (funciones), fase3a2 (esquema interno,\n  mover 10 tablas con ACL/RLS/politicas/secuencias, search_path de todas las\n  funciones, re-calificacion dinamica de cuerpos con public.<tabla>), 2\n  reversiones y bloque @@FASE3@@ del espejo.\n- scripts/ensayar-fase3a.mjs: 18/18 sobre el entorno 2.5 (datos anonimizados).\n- scripts/verificar-fase3a.mjs: catalogo + PostgREST + API tras cada paso.\n- api/*.js (8 archivos) por funciones de servicio; tests/api adaptado (174/174).\n- pg-local: canonico api-servicio.sql; sinFase2 quita tambien fases posteriores.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9018d4106ae4e04886cc0d99ae2d7bdcad63c3d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/9018d4106ae4e04886cc0d99ae2d7bdcad63c3d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/97fa83c2e3a872f7372ef6eb9080b464f9beadb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/97fa83c2e3a872f7372ef6eb9080b464f9beadb3","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDk3ZmE4M2MyZTNhODcyZjczNzJlZjZlYjkwODBiNDY0ZjliZWFkYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/fdcd50e407d99af281cc8ee231175aaafba3cbe4","sha":"fdcd50e407d99af281cc8ee231175aaafba3cbe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/fdcd50e407d99af281cc8ee231175aaafba3cbe4"}],"sha":"97fa83c2e3a872f7372ef6eb9080b464f9beadb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/97fa83c2e3a872f7372ef6eb9080b464f9beadb3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/fdcd50e407d99af281cc8ee231175aaafba3cbe4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:53:06Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:53:06Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"seguridad(fase 2.5): entorno de pruebas con datos de produccion anonimizados en origen\n\n- scripts/entorno-pruebas.mjs: extraer (anonimiza DENTRO de la consulta en\n  produccion: DNI, nombre, celular, correo, direccion, cuentas, secretos, IP,\n  textos libres; 90 pruebas por columna en origen; columna sensible nueva sin\n  regla detiene la extraccion), verificar (revision del texto generado) y\n  probar (carga local + comprobaciones).\n- scripts/pg-local.mjs: cargarDatosAnonimizados (PG_LOCAL_DATOS=1 / datos:true)\n  reemplaza los seeds por el volcado; secuencias niveladas.\n- supabase/pruebas/datos-anonimizados.sql ignorado por git; resumen.json versionado.\n- docs/seguridad/2026-09-18-fase2_5-entorno-pruebas.md: reglas, controles,\n  regeneracion, limites.\nEnsayo fase 2 sigue 23/23.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e01ff3a0b6140285b4dd78dc75a2d75f7efd284","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/6e01ff3a0b6140285b4dd78dc75a2d75f7efd284"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/fdcd50e407d99af281cc8ee231175aaafba3cbe4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/fdcd50e407d99af281cc8ee231175aaafba3cbe4","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGZkY2Q1MGU0MDdkOTlhZjI4MWNjOGVlMjMxMTc1YWFhZmJhM2NiZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/5bb8aff7f656df5f99faddb6a11955e205353063