pi.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/7a7a79c9045201ec59f5b576635c4dc9843a3a9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:14:18Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:14:18Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"docs(seguridad): SMTP_PASS de Gmail rotada; verificar-smtp avisa cuando el pull trae [SENSITIVE]\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee31f5b87ad7582f1b7e791a188a87a1daf86920","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/ee31f5b87ad7582f1b7e791a188a87a1daf86920"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/7a7a79c9045201ec59f5b576635c4dc9843a3a9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/7a7a79c9045201ec59f5b576635c4dc9843a3a9f","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDdhN2E3OWM5MDQ1MjAxZWM1OWY1YjU3NjYzNWM0ZGM5ODQzYTNhOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/c912a25d3793f2d12a2ba2dcbc53175d3a7f6c60","sha":"c912a25d3793f2d12a2ba2dcbc53175d3a7f6c60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/c912a25d3793f2d12a2ba2dcbc53175d3a7f6c60"}],"sha":"7a7a79c9045201ec59f5b576635c4dc9843a3a9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/7a7a79c9045201ec59f5b576635c4dc9843a3a9f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/c912a25d3793f2d12a2ba2dcbc53175d3a7f6c60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:07:15Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:07:15Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(clave): el reemplazo de la clave provisional nunca se registraba (bucle en el login)\n\nCausa raiz: supabase.rpc() devuelve un PostgrestBuilder perezoso (solo dispara\nla peticion al hacerle then/await) y SIN metodo catch. La forma\n`supabase.rpc(\"marcar_clave_cambiada\", ...).catch?.(() => {})` (desde 4d9e513,\n2026-08-27) evaluaba a undefined sin ejecutar nada: requiere_cambio_clave\nquedaba en true y el login volvia a pedir reemplazar la clave ya cambiada.\n\n- src/lib/clave.js: marcarClaveCambiada() espera la RPC de verdad y devuelve\n  el error en vez de tragarlo.\n- CambioClave y RestablecerAdmin la usan y muestran el aviso si falla.\n- tests/clave.test.js: doble que imita el builder perezoso sin catch (4 casos).\n- scripts/verificar-smtp.mjs: login SMTP de Gmail con las credenciales de\n  Vercel, sin enviar correo (lo corre Diego).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0c0ca615500ffd9881447720e5d1d1f09c19f26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/c0c0ca615500ffd9881447720e5d1d1f09c19f26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/c912a25d3793f2d12a2ba2dcbc53175d3a7f6c60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/c912a25d3793f2d12a2ba2dcbc53175d3a7f6c60","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGM5MTJhMjVkMzc5M2YyZDEyYTJiYTJkY2JjNTMxNzVkM2E3ZjZjNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/85bcf19e5ab49cbfc445d268192c1ba7046c2016","sha":"85bcf19e5ab49cbfc445d268192c1ba7046c2016","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/85bcf19e5ab49cbfc445d268192c1ba7046c2016"}],"sha":"c912a25d3793f2d12a2ba2dcbc53175d3a7f6c60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/c912a25d3793f2d12a2ba2dcbc53175d3a7f6c60"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit