es se conserva (sort estable en NavGroup).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b16146c8a5f6a28b1e728a417a28c2e56081301","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/9b16146c8a5f6a28b1e728a417a28c2e56081301"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/e4c6f1b26c1f4bb54f7303e89e8f8430f9c71562","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/e4c6f1b26c1f4bb54f7303e89e8f8430f9c71562","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGU0YzZmMWIyNmMxZjRiYjU0ZjczMDNlODllOGY4NDMwZjljNzE1NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/98baf01df4c25a4a7c9ed5c8aae81e0825b93dc2","sha":"98baf01df4c25a4a7c9ed5c8aae81e0825b93dc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/98baf01df4c25a4a7c9ed5c8aae81e0825b93dc2"}],"sha":"e4c6f1b26c1f4bb54f7303e89e8f8430f9c71562","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/e4c6f1b26c1f4bb54f7303e89e8f8430f9c71562"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/98baf01df4c25a4a7c9ed5c8aae81e0825b93dc2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:29:55Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:29:55Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(login): landing propia para olvide mi clave del BackOffice\n\n/admin/olvide-clave pide el correo (pre-cargado desde el login) y envia\nel enlace nativo de restablecimiento con respuesta siempre generica;\ndel enlace sigue el flujo normal en /admin/restablecer. El boton del\nlogin ahora navega ahi en vez de disparar el correo inline.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f95bc66c64fd3c8d2279cbdd06fb4a954a461e76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/f95bc66c64fd3c8d2279cbdd06fb4a954a461e76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/98baf01df4c25a4a7c9ed5c8aae81e0825b93dc2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/98baf01df4c25a4a7c9ed5c8aae81e0825b93dc2","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDk4YmFmMDFkZjRjMjVhNGE3YzllZDVjOGFhZTgxZTA4MjViOTNkYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/59085b59e70d341b5e5713f392eec06aa5d4cc35","sha":"59085b59e70d341b5e5713f392eec06aa5d4cc35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/59085b59e70d341b5e5713f392eec06aa5d4cc35"}],"sha":"98baf01df4c25a4a7c9ed5c8aae81e0825b93dc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/98baf01df4c25a4a7c9ed5c8aae81e0825b93dc2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/59085b59e70d341b5e5713f392eec06aa5d4cc35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T20:19:10Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T20:19:10Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(login): el restablecer clave sobrevive a la politica de sesion\n\nCausa raiz reproducida en navegador: la sesion temporal del enlace de\nrecuperacion moria (sesion unica al entrar desde otro lado, o\ninactividad) con el formulario visible, y el guardado fallaba con el\nmensaje generico sin salida. Ahora la politica no aplica en\n/admin/restablecer, la pantalla detecta la sesion perdida y ofrece\npedir enlace nuevo, el error real ya no se traga, y el token admin del\nmotor propio usa la regla vigente (6 + numero + letra, no 12).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"583856ef4e82bd2244dac05bb4252e151e11ca31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/583856ef4e82bd2244dac05bb4252e151e11ca31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/59085b59e70d341b5e5713f392eec06aa5d4cc35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/59085b59e70d341b5e5713f392eec06aa5d4cc35","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDU5MDg1YjU5ZTcwZDM0MWI1ZTU3MTNmMzkyZWVjMDZhYTVkNGNjMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/4fb59658430292632f38a68cf46f1206583c1174","sha":"4fb59658430292632f38a68cf46f1206583c1174","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/4fb59658430292632f38a68cf46f1206583c1174"}],"sha":"59085b59e70d341b5e5713f392eec06aa5d4cc35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/59085b59e70d341b5e5713f392eec06aa5d4cc35"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/4fb59658430292632f38a68cf46f1206583c1174/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T15:54:49Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T15:54:49Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(cumplimiento): boletas con estandar probatorio D.Leg. 1310\n\nF1 IP/user-agent reales inyectados por el proxy en los acuses, F2\nconsentimientos INSERT-only con texto integro+hash+backfill y PDF para\nfirma fisica, F3 log de notificaciones por documento, F4 constancia\nampliada, F5 reporte de fiscalizacion CSV/PDF en RRH-11, F6 suite\nverificar-cumplimiento-boletas. Migracion 2026-08-26 aplicada en prod.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50eae3d9856a11d3e955196ee26b4b39712e67f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/50eae3d9856a11d3e955196ee26b4b39712e67f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/4fb59658430292632f38a68cf46f1206583c1174","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/4fb59658430292632f38a68cf46f1206583c1174","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDRmYjU5NjU4NDMwMjkyNjMyZjM4YTY4Y2Y0NmYxMjA2NTgzYzExNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/898cf69a445d9cdc72958a8aa0ef7e3155302800","sha":"898cf69a445d9cdc72958a8aa0ef7e3155302800","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/898cf69a445d9cdc72958a8aa0ef7e3155302800"}],"sha":"4fb59658430292632f38a68cf46f1206583c1174","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/4fb59658430292632f38a68cf46f1206583c1174"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/898cf69a445d9cdc72958a8aa0ef7e3155302800/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T20:03:14Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T20:03:14Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(botones): bloques B y C de la auditoria - todo boton dice la verdad\n\nBloque B (muertos implementados):\n- Acuses RRH-11: selector de sedes real (antes hardcodeado) y Exportar\n  constancias del lote como un solo PDF (una constancia por pagina,\n  generarConstanciaPdf + unirPdfs, import dinamico).\n- Planilla RRH-02: Exportar CSV real del maestro filtrado, gated por\n  exportarDatosPersonales/superadmin, sin columnas bancarias.\n- Legajo RRH-03: Descargar legajo genera PDF resumen real (sin datos\n  bancarios); Constancias navega a RRH-12.\n- Memorandums RRH-18: Exportar expediente completo en PDF desde el\n  registro congelado.\n- Recordar por WhatsApp deshabilitado honesto (proximamente, Motor 9).\n\nBloque C (demos vueltas verdad):\n- Acuse asistido RRH-13 REAL: la foto del cargo se sube al bucket privado\n  y el RPC v2 verifica que exista (nada de rutas fantasma), supervisor\n  real derivado del JWT (fn_persona_llamador), dispositivo del cliente,\n  declaracion versionada acuse-asistido copiada integra; v_acuses expone\n  el adjunto y RRH-12 tiene Ver cargo firmado (URL firmada). El hash\n  falso del espejo local desaparecio (el refresh trae la verdad).\n- Bucket documentos acepta imagenes de nuevo (el hardening lo dejo\n  solo-PDF y rompia el cargo firmado y los adjuntos de papeleta).\n- ADQ-02 alta de activo real (RPC crear_activo, codigo unico, auditado);\n  ADQ-03/04 condicion de entrega/devolucion conectadas al RPC; fuera el\n  teatro (fotos sin subida, casilla de cargo, fechas fijas).\n- Legajo pestana Actividad real: v_actividad_persona sobre auditoria\n  (sin exponer el jsonb sensible), cargada al abrir.\n\nMigracion 2026-08-25-botones-b-c.sql APLICADA en prod; canonicos\nschema.sql sincronizados. Suite verificar-botones-bc.mjs 16/16 en prod\n(OJO: el proxy solo convierte x-sesion, una authorization directa del\ncliente no viaja). Plan en docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-25-botones-b-c.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b763c4101f638f60e9ce13036ce3265dc4b3c8dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/b763c4101f638f60e9ce13036ce3265dc4b3c8dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/898cf69a445d9cdc72958a8aa0ef7e3155302800","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/898cf69a445d9cdc72958a8aa0ef7e3155302800","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDg5OGNmNjlhNDQ1ZDljZGM3Mjk1OGE4YWEwZWY3ZTMxNTUzMDI4MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/a3015bf0192493e669fec402d6e94c0afaff278a","sha":"a3015bf0192493e669fec402d6e94c0afaff278a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a3015bf0192493e669fec402d6e94c0afaff278a"}],"sha":"898cf69a445d9cdc72958a8aa0ef7e3155302800","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/898cf69a445d9cdc72958a8aa0ef7e3155302800"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a3015bf0192493e669fec402d6e94c0afaff278a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T19:44:24Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T19:44:24Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(botones): bloque A de la auditoria de botones (2026-08-25)\n\n- Portal: Olvide mi clave acepta CE/Pasaporte (selector de tipo de\n  documento, mismo patron del login; antes exigia 8 digitos y excluia a\n  los extranjeros). TIPOS_DOC exportado desde Ingreso.\n- Portal: Volver / Ir a ingresar / Pedir enlace nuevo navegan con handler\n  propio via useRouter (eran button dentro de a, HTML invalido que\n  funcionaba de rebote).\n- Portal: descargas por blob endurecidas para Safari/iOS (enlace en el\n  DOM, revoke diferido).\n- Comunicados: Guardar borrador (que solo descartaba lo escrito) pasa a\n  llamarse Cancelar.\n- Tardanzas RRH-20 en gris Proximamente sin ruta (demo entera; la\n  importacion real vive en Asistencia RRH-22).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dbd3cca1e26b4b681e1964577b549d6c45f4200","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/4dbd3cca1e26b4b681e1964577b549d6c45f4200"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/a3015bf0192493e669fec402d6e94c0afaff278a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/a3015bf0192493e669fec402d6e94c0afaff278a","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGEzMDE1YmYwMTkyNDkzZTY2OWZlYzQwMmQ2ZTk0YzBhZmFmZjI3OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/2f33c924a657e317963fa7bed14c236cef65e34f","sha":"2f33c924a657e317963fa7bed14c236cef65e34f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/2f33c924a657e317963fa7bed14c236cef65e34f"}],"sha":"a3015bf0192493e669fec402d6e94c0afaff278a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a3015bf0192493e669fec402d6e94c0afaff278a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/2f33c924a657e317963fa7bed14c236cef65e34f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T19:31:42Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T19:31:42Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"test(portal): suite E2E de la constancia PDF en produccion\n\nAdmin temporal + cuenta de portal real: PDF con nombre veraz, negativas\n401/403/404/400, acceso admin, limpieza total (trigger de acuses apagado\nsolo para limpiar).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db07e2759a83c3eaeaa25a8b4abed06aad7ad6bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/db07e2759a83c3eaeaa25a8b4abed06aad7ad6bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/2f33c924a657e317963fa7bed14c236cef65e34f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/2f33c924a657e317963fa7bed14c236cef65e34f","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDJmMzNjOTI0YTY1N2UzMTc5NjNmYTdiZWQxNGMyMzZjZWY2NWUzNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/48616e378a38267d575b1e19e6cb5281b1ae6221","sha":"48616e378a38267d575b1e19e6cb5281b1ae6221","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/48616e378a38267d575b1e19e6cb5281b1ae6221"}],"sha":"2f33c924a657e317963fa7bed14c236cef65e34f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/2f33c924a657e317963fa7bed14c236cef65e34f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/48616e378a38267d575b1e19e6cb5281b1ae6221/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T19:29:09Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T19:29:09Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(portal): politica de datos v2 real y siempre consultable\n\nTexto completo conforme a Ley 29733 (responsable, datos, finalidades,\nencargados y flujo transfronterizo, plazos, derechos ARCO, seguridad) que\nincorpora la autorizacion expresa de entrega electronica de boletas\n(D.Leg. 1310 art. 3.2). Declaracion politica-datos v2 versionada: v1 y sus\naceptaciones quedan intactas. Tarjeta consultable en la pestana Yo.\nLa migracion queda SIN aplicar hasta el visto del texto.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"093f3438574d34de1768c55fb9ddfd5f343dd4b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/093f3438574d34de1768c55fb9ddfd5f343dd4b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/48616e378a38267d575b1e19e6cb5281b1ae6221","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/48616e378a38267d575b1e19e6cb5281b1ae6221","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDQ4NjE2ZTM3OGEzODI2N2Q1NzViMWUxOWU2Y2I1MjgxYjFhZTYyMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/50adf4012eb125de115b5d53c613308b80527da9","sha":"50adf4012eb125de115b5d53c613308b80527da9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/50adf4012eb125de115b5d53c613308b80527da9"}],"sha":"48616e378a38267d575b1e19e6cb5281b1ae6221","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/48616e378a38267d575b1e19e6cb5281b1ae6221"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/50adf4012eb125de115b5d53c613308b80527da9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T19:29:08Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T19:29:08Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(portal): constancia de recepcion en PDF y descargas con nombre veraz\n\n- api/constancia-portal.js genera la constancia formal (pdf-lib server-side,\n  membrete de la empresa, registro inmutable del acuse, texto aceptado\n  integro, huella SHA-256, nota legal D.Leg. 1310 art. 3.2); gate igual a\n  descargar-documento: portal solo lo suyo, admin activo todo. No se\n  archiva: se regenera a demanda desde acuses.\n- El boton del portal deja de generar el .txt y descarga el PDF.\n- La boleta se descarga como blob con nombre veraz (tipo + mes + nombre +\n  documento) en vez del hash del bucket que ponia el navegador.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"174e1f9f717be99d7f079610fc7fcb981ede8323","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/174e1f9f717be99d7f079610fc7fcb981ede8323"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/50adf4012eb125de115b5d53c613308b80527da9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/50adf4012eb125de115b5d53c613308b80527da9","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDUwYWRmNDAxMmViMTI1ZGUxMTViNWQ1M2M2MTMzMDhiODA1MjdkYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/17c96388d936e037aa0f41704c79cb45e6f2d6e7","sha":"17c96388d936e037aa0f41704c79cb45e6f2d6e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/17c96388d936e037aa0f41704c79cb45e6f2d6e7"}],"sha":"50adf4012eb125de115b5d53c613308b80527da9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/50adf4012eb125de115b5d53c613308b80527da9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/17c96388d936e037aa0f41704c79cb45e6f2d6e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T19:29:06Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T19:29:06Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(rrhh): Contratos (RRH-14) en gris Proximamente\n\nEl modulo sigue siendo demo sin funcion real: item del menu deshabilitado\n(patron EPP ADQ-06), ruta retirada, aviso del Tablero y fila mock del\nLegajo eliminados para no mostrar datos falsos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d38e1fa9f7ec4bf99feaa3b2528a5d4beb01c6b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/d38e1fa9f7ec4bf99feaa3b2528a5d4beb01c6b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/17c96388d936e037aa0f41704c79cb45e6f2d6e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/17c96388d936e037aa0f41704c79cb45e6f2d6e7","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDE3Yzk2Mzg4ZDkzNmUwMzdhYTBmNDE3MDRjNzljYjQ1ZTZmMmQ2ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/8a4a0af55f324db52c16b02cf32fce9aa5ef974b","sha":"8a4a0af55f324db52c16b02cf32fce9aa5ef974b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8a4a0af55f324db52c16b02cf32fce9aa5ef974b"}],"sha":"17c96388d936e037aa0f41704c79cb45e6f2d6e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/17c96388d936e037aa0f41704c79cb45e6f2d6e7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8a4a0af55f324db52c16b02cf32fce9aa5ef974b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T18:41:41Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T18:41:41Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(scripts): la limpieza de verificar-planilla-unificada borra movimientos\n\nDesde el ciclo Movimientos la importacion deja filas en la tabla\ninsert-only movimientos; la limpieza apaga su trigger un instante\n(mismo patron que verificar-movimientos.mjs) antes de borrar personas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6fe45c24ab5856c7ef30b58f05ebd48572060e4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/6fe45c24ab5856c7ef30b58f05ebd48572060e4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/8a4a0af55f324db52c16b02cf32fce9aa5ef974b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/8a4a0af55f324db52c16b02cf32fce9aa5ef974b","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDhhNGEwYWY1NWYzMjRkYjUyYzE2YjAyY2YzMmZjZTlhYTVlZjk3NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/453a78a960b787bd3b6a69f67ab0fe92ecec14db","sha":"453a78a960b787bd3b6a69f67ab0fe92ecec14db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/453a78a960b787bd3b6a69f67ab0fe92ecec14db"}],"sha":"8a4a0af55f324db52c16b02cf32fce9aa5ef974b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8a4a0af55f324db52c16b02cf32fce9aa5ef974b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/453a78a960b787bd3b6a69f67ab0fe92ecec14db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T23:31:56Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T23:31:56Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(acuses): recordatorio por correo a trabajadores con acuses pendientes\n\nAccion nueva recordatorio-acuse en api/enviar-correo: la dispara un admin\n(x-sesion, nivel >=2 en Acuses) y avisa al trabajador que tiene documentos\nsin confirmar, con enlace al portal. Valida correo registrado y cuenta de\nportal existente con errores accionables. Boton Recordar por correo por\nfila en el modal de pendientes de RRH-06 (estado enviando/enviado/error).\nNo reenvia nada: el documento ya esta en la bandeja del portal desde la\npublicacion. vitest 117/117.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29d5d7281a3472a39dc7fb48a36df285047e2a09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/29d5d7281a3472a39dc7fb48a36df285047e2a09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/453a78a960b787bd3b6a69f67ab0fe92ecec14db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/453a78a960b787bd3b6a69f67ab0fe92ecec14db","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDQ1M2E3OGE5NjBiNzg3YmQzYjZhNjlmNjdhYjBmZTkyZWNlYzE0ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/3321eab2c3689e3f54a3ac1ffde1642b4bb28493","sha":"3321eab2c3689e3f54a3ac1ffde1642b4bb28493","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/3321eab2c3689e3f54a3ac1ffde1642b4bb28493"}],"sha":"453a78a960b787bd3b6a69f67ab0fe92ecec14db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/453a78a960b787bd3b6a69f67ab0fe92ecec14db"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/3321eab2c3689e3f54a3ac1ffde1642b4bb28493/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T23:24:04Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T23:24:04Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(rrhh): listado clickeable de pendientes por lote en Carga de boletas\n\nEn Lotes recientes de RRH-06 cada lote muestra ahora una columna\nPendientes: N sin acusar abre un modal con quienes faltan (DNI, nombre,\nsede y estado Sin confirmar / Nunca ingreso, desde v_acuses ya cargada)\ny un acceso directo al seguimiento de acuses. Pedido de Diego en su\nronda de pruebas. vitest 117/117.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de22cd7fac94af4d6f279aa1ef0b66e463ea113e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/de22cd7fac94af4d6f279aa1ef0b66e463ea113e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/3321eab2c3689e3f54a3ac1ffde1642b4bb28493","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/3321eab2c3689e3f54a3ac1ffde1642b4bb28493","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDMzMjFlYWIyYzM2ODllM2Y1NGEzYWMxZmZkZTE2NDJiNGJiMjg0OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/99d31619dd0358a01400cb2e4608f4c735b54030","sha":"99d31619dd0358a01400cb2e4608f4c735b54030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/99d31619dd0358a01400cb2e4608f4c735b54030"}],"sha":"3321eab2c3689e3f54a3ac1ffde1642b4bb28493","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/3321eab2c3689e3f54a3ac1ffde1642b4bb28493"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/99d31619dd0358a01400cb2e4608f4c735b54030/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T23:16:17Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T23:16:17Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(rrhh): el boton Descargar en PDF de la constancia de acuse ahora descarga de verdad\n\nEl boton de RRH-12 no tenia onClick desde la era demo de la pantalla: no\nhacia nada. Generador nuevo src/lib/constancia.js (pdf-lib en el navegador,\nimport dinamico; saneo WinAnsi y envoltura de lineas para el hash) con test\nTDD; la pantalla arma los campos del registro inmutable y descarga\nconstancia-<lote>-<dni>.pdf. El boton Exportar constancias del lote de\nRRH-11 sigue muerto (pendiente aparte). vitest 117/117.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7de73f20ab0c962f2ddc32ac47643809d0ee12dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/7de73f20ab0c962f2ddc32ac47643809d0ee12dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/99d31619dd0358a01400cb2e4608f4c735b54030","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/99d31619dd0358a01400cb2e4608f4c735b54030","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDk5ZDMxNjE5ZGQwMzU4YTAxNDAwY2IyZTQ2MDhmNGM3MzViNTQwMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/bece9e0c650eaa112b298826450bb445945389b7","sha":"bece9e0c650eaa112b298826450bb445945389b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/bece9e0c650eaa112b298826450bb445945389b7"}],"sha":"99d31619dd0358a01400cb2e4608f4c735b54030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/99d31619dd0358a01400cb2e4608f4c735b54030"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/bece9e0c650eaa112b298826450bb445945389b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:22:27Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:22:27Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(hardening): pase de hardening menor de boletas, importaciones y BD\n\n- lote.js: correlativo duplicado ahora es excepcion del lote (dos paginas\n  con el mismo No n), con test TDD; antes solo se detectaban saltos.\n- Ids de lote: el corto de la empresa se sanea a alfanumerico antes de\n  cortar a 3 (L. AMERICANA -> LAM, ya no L. con punto y espacio); ids\n  viejos intactos.\n- importar_planilla: nombre_por_confirmar tambien se gobierna en\n  re-importaciones (hereda la marca al adoptar un nombre mas largo, se\n  limpia cuando el archivo confirma exacto un nombre sin truncar; jamas\n  re-marca lo confirmado a mano). La unificada limpia la marca al\n  confirmar/mejorar (sus nombres no vienen truncados por ancho).\n- Migracion 2026-08-24-hardening.sql: ademas fija search_path\n  (public, extensions) en toda security definer de public y limita el\n  bucket documentos a application/pdf con tope 50 MB.\n- PENDIENTE DE APLICAR EN PROD: movimientos-planilla (actualizada) y\n  hardening, en ese orden, con scripts/aplicar-sql.mjs.\n\nvitest 114/114.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"caad7a19f354e189cc983d548fd479db5f4e1970","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/caad7a19f354e189cc983d548fd479db5f4e1970"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/bece9e0c650eaa112b298826450bb445945389b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/bece9e0c650eaa112b298826450bb445945389b7","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGJlY2U5ZTBjNjUwZWFhMTEyYjI5ODgyNjQ1MGJiNDQ1OTQ1Mzg5Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/cad4c5ac8208a05e1456fcded6924baa4008b23f","sha":"cad4c5ac8208a05e1456fcded6924baa4008b23f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/cad4c5ac8208a05e1456fcded6924baa4008b23f"}],"sha":"bece9e0c650eaa112b298826450bb445945389b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/bece9e0c650eaa112b298826450bb445945389b7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/cad4c5ac8208a05e1456fcded6924baa4008b23f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:12:39Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:12:39Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"chore(planilla): preflight de la planilla unificada real contra produccion\n\nScript previa-planilla-unificada.mjs: parsea el xlsx con el parser del\nproyecto y llama previsualizar_planilla_unificada (PV999, no escribe nada)\npara ver altas/cambios/traslados/posibles ceses antes de importar en RRH-05.\nCorrido con OFICINA_JUL_2026: 79 filas, 0 errores, 77 altas, 2 cambios de\ncuenta, 0 problemas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62282f1d72c018b1dec24f6856cbcee8b6259a56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/62282f1d72c018b1dec24f6856cbcee8b6259a56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/cad4c5ac8208a05e1456fcded6924baa4008b23f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/cad4c5ac8208a05e1456fcded6924baa4008b23f","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGNhZDRjNWFjODIwOGEwNWUxNDU2ZmNkZWQ2OTI0YmFhNDAwOG