e":"2026-08-22T02:19:14Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(asistencia): parser TDD del reporte de marcaciones del reloj\n\nMapea por posicion (encabezados ENTRADA/SALIDA repetidos), descarta\nseparadoras y dias futuros, detecta incompletos/dobles/invertidos/sin\nrefrigerio y conserva la forma sin ceros del codigo para cotejar en BD.\n9/9 contra el fixture real (41 trabajadores, 943 filas). Regla literal\nde dobles confirmada por Diego.","tree":{"sha":"23f1955fbdd84e2e69516ad52fe9cf3b910221ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/23f1955fbdd84e2e69516ad52fe9cf3b910221ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/21d35452abcccd7abff0a2745c7d66a8ea0b01e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/21d35452abcccd7abff0a2745c7d66a8ea0b01e7","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDIxZDM1NDUyYWJjY2NkN2FiZmYwYTI3NDVjN2Q2NmE4ZWEwYjAxZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/e01f594b82a5863ac980cb6e2105ec349a171792","sha":"e01f594b82a5863ac980cb6e2105ec349a171792","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/e01f594b82a5863ac980cb6e2105ec349a171792"}],"sha":"21d35452abcccd7abff0a2745c7d66a8ea0b01e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/21d35452abcccd7abff0a2745c7d66a8ea0b01e7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/e01f594b82a5863ac980cb6e2105ec349a171792/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T01:47:54Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T01:47:54Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(seguridad+asistencia): clave BackOffice min 6 (numero+letra) + groundwork modulo Asistencia\n\n#12 clave BackOffice (decision de Diego): baja de 12 a minimo 6 con al menos un\nnumero y una letra. validarClave() compartido en campos.js; aplicado en\nCambioClave y RestablecerAdmin; Politica permite bajar a 6; migracion\n2026-08-21-clave-backoffice-min6.sql (relaja check chk_clave_min_backoffice a\n>=6, default 6, valor guardado a 6) aplicada.\n\n#8 groundwork: migracion 2026-08-21-asistencia.sql aplicada (tablas marcaciones,\nasistencia_lotes, asistencia_config con umbral doble-marcacion 15 configurable)\ny modulo ''asistencia'' sumado al check perfil_permisos_modulo_check. Falta el\nparser, RPCs y pantalla (siguientes fases).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54d2dbd506dcef2226471a8e09d52cbfdb8c1c6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/54d2dbd506dcef2226471a8e09d52cbfdb8c1c6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/e01f594b82a5863ac980cb6e2105ec349a171792","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/e01f594b82a5863ac980cb6e2105ec349a171792","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGUwMWY1OTRiODJhNTg2M2FjOTgwY2I2ZTIxMDVlYzM0OWExNzE3OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/b2808fe0f70c199f658939eff0f32582a87f3b39","sha":"b2808fe0f70c199f658939eff0f32582a87f3b39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/b2808fe0f70c199f658939eff0f32582a87f3b39"}],"sha":"e01f594b82a5863ac980cb6e2105ec349a171792","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/e01f594b82a5863ac980cb6e2105ec349a171792"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/b2808fe0f70c199f658939eff0f32582a87f3b39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T01:32:10Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T01:32:10Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(portal): el boton Entrar aceptaba solo DNI de 8 digitos (bloqueaba CE/Pasaporte)\n\nEl disabled del boton usaba dni.length !== 8 hardcodeado, dejando el boton\nmuerto para carne de extranjeria (9-12) y pasaporte (6-15). Ahora usa el regex\ndel tipo de documento seleccionado, consistente con la validacion de ingresar().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"694ada13d04ddbab543a0b3d6d9083e640d9f9ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/694ada13d04ddbab543a0b3d6d9083e640d9f9ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/b2808fe0f70c199f658939eff0f32582a87f3b39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/b2808fe0f70c199f658939eff0f32582a87f3b39","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGIyODA4ZmUwZjcwYzE5OWY2NTg5MzllZmYwZjMyNTgyYTg3ZjNiMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/0026612f03ca06d523ea553b9330e47cb386ad6c","sha":"0026612f03ca06d523ea553b9330e47cb386ad6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/0026612f03ca06d523ea553b9330e47cb386ad6c"}],"sha":"b2808fe0f70c199f658939eff0f32582a87f3b39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/b2808fe0f70c199f658939eff0f32582a87f3b39"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/0026612f03ca06d523ea553b9330e47cb386ad6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T00:28:53Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T00:28:53Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(accesos): agrupar la matriz de modulos igual que el menu lateral\n\nPedido de Diego: la matriz al crear/editar categorias se divide en las mismas\nsecciones que el menu de la izquierda (Accesos y Roles, Recursos Humanos,\nSolicitudes, Gestion de TI, Soporte) + un grupo Sistema para ''configuracion'',\nque no aparece en el menu. Nueva constante GRUPOS_MODULOS en modulos.js (fuente\nunica); PerfilEditor recorre los grupos con subencabezados en vez de la lista\nplana. Los 13 modulos siguen presentes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a6fc6b1dc6c8d8a4907a30dfc0535a3c74eda2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/9a6fc6b1dc6c8d8a4907a30dfc0535a3c74eda2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/0026612f03ca06d523ea553b9330e47cb386ad6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/0026612f03ca06d523ea553b9330e47cb386ad6c","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDAwMjY2MTJmMDNjYTA2ZDUyM2VhNTUzYjkzMzBlNDdjYjM4NmFkNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/0b1776a704b3b5a75f50f094165d6bb5b2afafb0","sha":"0b1776a704b3b5a75f50f094165d6bb5b2afafb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/0b1776a704b3b5a75f50f094165d6bb5b2afafb0"}],"sha":"0026612f03ca06d523ea553b9330e47cb386ad6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/0026612f03ca06d523ea553b9330e47cb386ad6c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/0b1776a704b3b5a75f50f094165d6bb5b2afafb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T00:26:18Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T00:26:18Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(sesion): cierre por inactividad (10 min) y sesion unica en portal y BackOffice\n\nDecision de Diego: cerrar sesion tras 10 min de inactividad y permitir una sola\nsesion por cuenta (el login nuevo gana; el equipo anterior se autoexpulsa).\n\n- BD (migracion 2026-08-21-sesion-unica.sql, aplicada): columnas sesion_actual\n  en usuarios_admin y cuentas_portal; RPCs registrar/leer marcador por JWT\n  (registrar_sesion_backoffice/mi_sesion_backoffice y portal_registrar_sesion/\n  portal_mi_sesion). Sincronizado en accesos.sql y portal.sql canonicos.\n- Frontend: el login registra un marcador unico; un temporizador de 10 min sin\n  actividad y un sondeo (cada 60s + al enfocar) cierran la sesion. El motivo se\n  muestra en la pantalla de login (inactividad / ingreso desde otro equipo).\n\nEnforcement a nivel de app: al otro equipo se le expulsa en su proximo chequeo\n(~1 min), patron portable con Supabase Auth.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b33f054610df0ccd03d0229fe67589e4f29bc74e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/b33f054610df0ccd03d0229fe67589e4f29bc74e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/0b1776a704b3b5a75f50f094165d6bb5b2afafb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/0b1776a704b3b5a75f50f094165d6bb5b2afafb0","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDBiMTc3NmE3MDRiM2I1YTc1ZjUwZjA5NDE2NWQ2YmI1YjJhZmFmYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/82871d5f8ba37131b0b4ee7793de8393f2cef99e","sha":"82871d5f8ba37131b0b4ee7793de8393f2cef99e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/82871d5f8ba37131b0b4ee7793de8393f2cef99e"}],"sha":"0b1776a704b3b5a75f50f094165d6bb5b2afafb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/0b1776a704b3b5a75f50f094165d6bb5b2afafb0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/82871d5f8ba37131b0b4ee7793de8393f2cef99e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T00:10:36Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T00:10:36Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"docs: plan de importacion de planilla unificada + checklist de flujos e2e\n\n- Plan por fases (Fase 0 renombre hecha; Fases 1-7 pendientes de aprobacion)\n  para la carga del padron unificado (3 razones sociales por RUC, cuenta\n  bancaria cifrada con pgcrypto+Vault, casilla \"ver datos bancarios\").\n- Checklist de flujos e2e para la ronda de testeo de Diego (BackOffice y portal),\n  con lo verificado hoy y los pendientes (#7 sesion, #8 asistencias, #10 planilla).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f93f8804778aeac5e795f8ebff365169af22d57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/3f93f8804778aeac5e795f8ebff365169af22d57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/82871d5f8ba37131b0b4ee7793de8393f2cef99e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/82871d5f8ba37131b0b4ee7793de8393f2cef99e","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDgyODcxZDVmOGJhMzcxMzFiMGI0ZWU3NzkzZGU4MzkzZjJjZWY5OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/55a431a38d53c436c3a86393ab249938ee20e853","sha":"55a431a38d53c436c3a86393ab249938ee20e853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/55a431a38d53c436c3a86393ab249938ee20e853"}],"sha":"82871d5f8ba37131b0b4ee7793de8393f2cef99e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/82871d5f8ba37131b0b4ee7793de8393f2cef99e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/55a431a38d53c436c3a86393ab249938ee20e853/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T00:06:42Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T00:06:42Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(rrhh): renombrar el espacio \"Personal\" a \"Planilla\" (solo visible)\n\nDecision de Diego: el espacio pasa a llamarse Planilla (se usara mensualmente\ncomo base de la planilla). Se cambia solo lo visible: la etiqueta del menu y el\ntitulo de la pantalla. El id de modulo ''personal'', las rutas /rrhh/personal y\nlos codigos RRH-* quedan intactos para no tocar permisos ni guards.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0772b0c201844f2d56e1ea8e622752584c2aab92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/0772b0c201844f2d56e1ea8e622752584c2aab92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/55a431a38d53c436c3a86393ab249938ee20e853","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/55a431a38d53c436c3a86393ab249938ee20e853","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDU1YTQzMWEzOGQ1M2M0MzZjM2E4NjM5M2FiMjQ5OTM4ZWUyMGU4NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/1ddf861f8b2678050b3b68ce71ed8cc21df9fc01","sha":"1ddf861f8b2678050b3b68ce71ed8cc21df9fc01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/1ddf861f8b2678050b3b68ce71ed8cc21df9fc01"}],"sha":"55a431a38d53c436c3a86393ab249938ee20e853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/55a431a38d53c436c3a86393ab249938ee20e853"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/1ddf861f8b2678050b3b68ce71ed8cc21df9fc01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T23:57:26Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T23:57:26Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(portal): quitar la cuenta de haberes de la pestana Yo\n\nDecision de Diego: el trabajador tampoco debe ver su cuenta de haberes en el\nportal. Se elimina la tarjeta completa (banco + cuenta enmascarada) de MisDatos.\nLa vista v_portal_datos sigue devolviendo el dato, solo deja de mostrarse.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c1b0b9a3de796b94580d282d82f9118857255bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/2c1b0b9a3de796b94580d282d82f9118857255bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/1ddf861f8b2678050b3b68ce71ed8cc21df9fc01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/1ddf861f8b2678050b3b68ce71ed8cc21df9fc01","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDFkZGY4NjFmOGIyNjc4MDUwYjNiNjhjZTcxZWQ4Y2MyMWRmOWZjMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/d5e37ce9ba65b3286e9db83e9f0da9d9c23f5d78","sha":"d5e37ce9ba65b3286e9db83e9f0da9d9c23f5d78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/d5e37ce9ba65b3286e9db83e9f0da9d9c23f5d78"}],"sha":"1ddf861f8b2678050b3b68ce71ed8cc21df9fc01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/1ddf861f8b2678050b3b68ce71ed8cc21df9fc01"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/d5e37ce9ba65b3286e9db83e9f0da9d9c23f5d78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T23:56:43Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T23:56:43Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(accesos): el check de perfil_permisos.modulo faltaba soporte y solicitudes\n\nCausa raiz REAL de \"no se guarda la categoria\" (el error que surface el arreglo\nanterior): los modulos soporte y solicitudes (agregados al frontend el 19-08)\nnunca se sumaron al check perfil_permisos_modulo_check. guardar_perfil inserta\ntoda la matriz, y esos dos violaban el constraint -> el insert entero fallaba.\nLas categorias viejas se salvaron por haberse creado antes de esos modulos.\n\nAmbos tienen aprobacion, asi que tambien van al check nivel_3_solo_con_aprobacion.\nMigracion 2026-08-21-perfil-permisos-modulos.sql (idempotente) aplicada en prod;\nverificado: guardar categoria con matriz completa (soporte:2, solicitudes:3) = 200.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6acc46ab77558910f4e3e39d941fd121aeb539c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/e6acc46ab77558910f4e3e39d941fd121aeb539c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/d5e37ce9ba65b3286e9db83e9f0da9d9c23f5d78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/d5e37ce9ba65b3286e9db83e9f0da9d9c23f5d78","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGQ1ZTM3Y2U5YmE2NWIzMjg2ZTlkYjgzZTlmMGRhOWQ5YzIzZjVkNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/91dcc536078e7b58c9ebed4a2d3a003dd7982c3d","sha":"91dcc536078e7b58c9ebed4a2d3a003dd7982c3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/91dcc536078e7b58c9ebed4a2d3a003dd7982c3d"}],"sha":"d5e37ce9ba65b3286e9db83e9f0da9d9c23f5d78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/d5e37ce9ba65b3286e9db83e9f0da9d9c23f5d78"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/91dcc536078e7b58c9ebed4a2d3a003dd7982c3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T23:49:22Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T23:49:22Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(portal): quitar solicitud de cambio de cuenta de haberes\n\nDecision de Diego: normalmente no se cambia la cuenta de haberes. Se oculta del\nportal el flujo \"Solicitar cambio de cuenta\" (boton + modal). La tarjeta sigue\nmostrando banco y cuenta enmascarada, ahora con nota de que el cambio lo\ngestiona RRHH directamente. La tabla solicitudes_cambio_cuenta y el RPC quedan\nintactos en la BD (solo se oculta la UI).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"470202c535bd99e738d3d7e0eb5d23ede1ea2d1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/470202c535bd99e738d3d7e0eb5d23ede1ea2d1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/91dcc536078e7b58c9ebed4a2d3a003dd7982c3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/91dcc536078e7b58c9ebed4a2d3a003dd7982c3d","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDkxZGNjNTM2MDc4ZTdiNThjOWViZWQ0YTJkM2EwMDNkZDc5ODJjM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/42aebdee26c7ddda6027a377735b01425d035e5f","sha":"42aebdee26c7ddda6027a377735b01425d035e5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/42aebdee26c7ddda6027a377735b01425d035e5f"}],"sha":"91dcc536078e7b58c9ebed4a2d3a003dd7982c3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/91dcc536078e7b58c9ebed4a2d3a003dd7982c3d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/42aebdee26c7ddda6027a377735b01425d035e5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T23:47:57Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T23:47:57Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(portal): celular y correo obligatorios en el primer ingreso\n\nDecision de Diego: todos los trabajadores tienen celular y correo.\n- Se quita la opcion \"No tengo celular\"; el celular (9 digitos) es obligatorio.\n- El correo pasa de opcional a obligatorio (con validacion de formato).\nEl RPC portal_primer_ingreso se llama con sin_celular=false siempre.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ba1de960ee05c0ddc2f139da0112b918ae1f480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/8ba1de960ee05c0ddc2f139da0112b918ae1f480"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/42aebdee26c7ddda6027a377735b01425d035e5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/42aebdee26c7ddda6027a377735b01425d035e5f","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDQyYWViZGVlMjZjN2RkZGE2MDI3YTM3NzczNWIwMTQyNWQwMzVlNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/102a3da6467094d213394f2e09393108cdbecb73","sha":"102a3da6467094d213394f2e09393108cdbecb73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/102a3da6467094d213394f2e09393108cdbecb73"}],"sha":"42aebdee26c7ddda6027a377735b01425d035e5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/42aebdee26c7ddda6027a377735b01425d035e5f"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits?per_page=100&page=2&sha=203696ecb769f415d1f2ebde3714f72cf8900ce6&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A43%3A50.443Z"}');
