o"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T23:46:00Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(portal): quitar periodo y horario del formulario de vacaciones\n\nDecision de Diego: la solicitud de vacaciones del portal no lleva periodo ni\nhorario. Se quitan del formulario y del estado inicial; el resto (tipo de goce,\nfechas, dias gozados/trabajados) queda igual. La validacion de BD no los exige.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"27a7154bc7b47467271eabb95756b153cff210ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/27a7154bc7b47467271eabb95756b153cff210ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/102a3da6467094d213394f2e09393108cdbecb73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/102a3da6467094d213394f2e09393108cdbecb73","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDEwMmEzZGE2NDY3MDk0ZDIxMzM5NGYyZTA5MzkzMTA4Y2RiZWNiNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/41f016e6a4cd9aebc44379403c54e7887dfa5e07","sha":"41f016e6a4cd9aebc44379403c54e7887dfa5e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/41f016e6a4cd9aebc44379403c54e7887dfa5e07"}],"sha":"102a3da6467094d213394f2e09393108cdbecb73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/102a3da6467094d213394f2e09393108cdbecb73"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/41f016e6a4cd9aebc44379403c54e7887dfa5e07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T23:36:45Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T23:36:45Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(accesos): las categorias se guardan de verdad (no se tragan el 401 de sesion vencida)\n\nCausa raiz: un token de sesion vencido viaja caduco al proxy, que lo pone\ncomo Authorization; PostgREST lo rechaza con 401 aunque la apikey este. El\nhelper rpc tragaba el error a consola y el update optimista hacia que la\ncategoria apareciera y desapareciera al refrescar, sin mensaje.\n\n- rpc() detecta el 401/JWT, refresca la sesion y reintenta una vez; devuelve { error }.\n- guardarPerfil espera la confirmacion de la BD antes de dar por hecho el guardado.\n- PerfilEditor solo navega si la BD confirmo; si la sesion vencio muestra un\n  mensaje accionable y conserva lo escrito. Boton deshabilitado mientras guarda.\n\nTambien resuelve que la matriz de modulos se refleje con un refresh (la lista\nse recarga tras el guardado confirmado).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87fd55297286afaa8ee31cd40c8bbfa65f046cee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/87fd55297286afaa8ee31cd40c8bbfa65f046cee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/41f016e6a4cd9aebc44379403c54e7887dfa5e07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/41f016e6a4cd9aebc44379403c54e7887dfa5e07","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDQxZjAxNmU2YTRjZDlhZWJjNDQzNzk0MDNjNTRlNzg4N2RmYTVlMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/92dd674d747e6000e411eac4329a7709bc817cc3","sha":"92dd674d747e6000e411eac4329a7709bc817cc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/92dd674d747e6000e411eac4329a7709bc817cc3"}],"sha":"41f016e6a4cd9aebc44379403c54e7887dfa5e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/41f016e6a4cd9aebc44379403c54e7887dfa5e07"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/92