lo la lee/escribe el superadmin via RPC auditada y jamas\nsale por v_activos. Data extraida en vivo de promant.pe/correo: 18 IPs;\nel modelo solo se completa donde faltaba.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d4881facb17d79624c3bcf00bebbc79ea1e8425","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/8d4881facb17d79624c3bcf00bebbc79ea1e8425"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/209defb49de2ed79381fecfec4148269a35a921a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/209defb49de2ed79381fecfec4148269a35a921a","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDIwOWRlZmI0OWRlMmVkNzkzODFmZWNmZWM0MTQ4MjY5YTM1YTkyMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/4a7cf2fed3373088a69980262875242530bafaca","sha":"4a7cf2fed3373088a69980262875242530bafaca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/4a7cf2fed3373088a69980262875242530bafaca"}],"sha":"209defb49de2ed79381fecfec4148269a35a921a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/209defb49de2ed79381fecfec4148269a35a921a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/4a7cf2fed3373088a69980262875242530bafaca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T18:41:49Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T18:41:49Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(ti): el módulo Administración pasa a llamarse Gestión de TI\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1072c035590cc51713801f361f52f046053a6e95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/1072c035590cc51713801f361f52f046053a6e95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/4a7cf2fed3373088a69980262875242530bafaca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/4a7cf2fed3373088a69980262875242530bafaca","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDRhN2NmMmZlZDMzNzMwODhhNjk5ODAyNjI4NzUyNDI1MzBiYWZhY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/cb93a3a415414cc1a14f4633b39e1d7cef2e2f3d","sha":"cb93a3a415414cc1a14f4633b39e1d7cef2e2f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/cb93a3a415414cc1a14f4633b39e1d7cef2e2f3d"}],"sha":"4a7cf2fed3373088a69980262875242530bafaca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/4a7cf2fed3373088a69980262875242530bafaca"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/cb93a3a415414cc1a14f4633b39e1d7cef2e2f3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T05:53:38Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T05:53:38Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(correo): BackOffice con correo NATIVO de Supabase (invitacion y recuperacion)\n\nPedido de Diego: el envio para el BackOffice va por el remitente\nintegrado de Supabase Auth, SIN credenciales externas. Crear usuario ->\ninvitacion nativa (la persona crea su clave desde el enlace; sin clave\nprovisional; requiere_cambio_clave=false); Reenviar -> enlace de\nrecuperacion nativo; Olvide mi clave del login -> resetPasswordForEmail.\n/admin/restablecer atiende ambos modos: sesion en el hash (nativo,\nupdateUser + marcar_clave_cambiada) y ?token= del motor propio. Si el\nremitente integrado falla (limites del plan gratis), cae solo al camino\nclasico con clave en pantalla. site_url y uri_allow_list configurados\nvia Management API; plantillas custom no disponibles en plan gratis sin\nSMTP (los correos salen con la plantilla default de Supabase, en\ningles). El Portal sigue con el motor propio: sus cuentas son\ndirecciones tecnicas sin buzon y Supabase no puede alcanzarlas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14b98f22b74b54422e7de16036766f197cba4ba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/14b98f22b74b54422e7de16036766f197cba4ba9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/cb93a3a415414cc1a14f4633b39e1d7cef2e2f3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/cb93a3a415414cc1a14f4633b39e1d7cef2e2f3d","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGNiOTNhM2E0MTU0MTRjYzFhMTRmNDYzM2IzOWUxZDdjZWYyZTJmM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/8fd34ed54e63c1397ca8b083b238509b38ab2cbd","sha":"8fd34ed54e63c1397ca8b083b238509b38ab2cbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8fd34ed54e63c1397ca8b083b238509b38ab2cbd"}],"sha":"cb93a3a415414cc1a14f4633b39e1d7cef2e2f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/cb93a3a415414cc1a14f4633b39e1d7cef2e2f3d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8fd34ed54e63c1397ca8b083b238509b38ab2cbd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T03:53:39Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T03:53:39Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(correo): acceso admin por correo + olvide-mi-clave del BackOffice\n\nNucleo compartido api/_correo.js (Resend o SMTP; el guion bajo lo\nexcluye de las rutas). admin-usuarios envia el acceso por correo al\ncrear o reenviar la cuenta (mejor esfuerzo: sin motor, la clave sigue\nen pantalla y el modal avisa; con motor, el modal confirma el envio).\nRecuperacion del BackOffice: token recuperacion-admin (1h, un uso),\nenlace desde el login (respuesta generica, no revela cuentas), pagina\n/admin/restablecer con minimo 12 y ojitos; restablecer-clave atiende\nportal (min 6) y backoffice (min 12, limpia requiere_cambio_clave).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"483ad1376b54c198bcf9b41f9ac1174c2ac48b07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/483ad1376b54c198bcf9b41f9ac1174c2ac48b07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/8fd34ed54e63c1397ca8b083b238509b38ab2cbd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/8fd34ed54e63c1397ca8b083b238509b38ab2cbd","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDhmZDM0ZWQ1NGU2M2MxMzk3Y2E4YjA4M2IyMzg1MDliMzhhYjJjYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/8553fae7375dd0ef4e6da9c595dd5995b5b5d736","sha":"8553fae7375dd0ef4e6da9c595dd5995b5b5d736","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8553fae7375dd0ef4e6da9c595dd5995b5b5d736"}],"sha":"8fd34ed54e63c1397ca8b083b238509b38ab2cbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8fd34ed54e63c1397ca8b083b238509b38ab2cbd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8553fae7375dd0ef4e6da9c595dd5995b5b5d736/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T03:46:36Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T03:46:36Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(rrhh): cuenta y CCI separados + el correo se jala en Nuevo usuario\n\nEl numero de cuenta y el CCI son campos DISTINTOS: columna 