m/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/ccee1a0afdf03ebb3c98c79e89bc0eb205876841","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGNjZWUxYTBhZmRmMDNlYmIzYzk4Yzc5ZTg5YmMwZWIyMDU4NzY4NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/5eadafdd7a377983188f875c75c15751fdb29d39","sha":"5eadafdd7a377983188f875c75c15751fdb29d39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/5eadafdd7a377983188f875c75c15751fdb29d39"}],"sha":"ccee1a0afdf03ebb3c98c79e89bc0eb205876841","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/ccee1a0afdf03ebb3c98c79e89bc0eb205876841"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/5eadafdd7a377983188f875c75c15751fdb29d39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:18:20Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:18:20Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(correo): proveedor SMTP (Gmail) como alternativa a Resend\n\nEl webhook de correo acepta dos proveedores: Resend (RESEND_API_KEY) o\nSMTP con nodemailer (SMTP_USER + SMTP_PASS, host default smtp.gmail.com\npuerto 465) - basta una contrasena de aplicacion del Gmail existente de\nDiego, sin crear cuentas nuevas (~500 correos/dia). Sin ninguno, 503\nclaro. Contexto: Supabase solo envia plantillas de auth a la direccion\nde la CUENTA (tecnica dni@portal...), nunca al correo real declarado, y\nsus database webhooks no envian correos: no sirven para este circuito.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"248676988b22b3ffa5b2f1e87c098e3c94770749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/248676988b22b3ffa5b2f1e87c098e3c94770749"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/5eadafdd7a377983188f875c75c15751fdb29d39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/5eadafdd7a377983188f875c75c15751fdb29d39","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDVlYWRhZmRkN2EzNzc5ODMxODhmODc1Yzc1YzE1NzUxZmRiMjlkMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/216e5f7def20bfd031a3e6bb3dadefaaac20b0ee","sha":"216e5f7def20bfd031a3e6bb3dadefaaac20b0ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/216e5f7def20bfd031a3e6bb3dadefaaac20b0ee"}],"sha":"5eadafdd7a377983188f875c75c15751fdb29d39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/5eadafdd7a377983188f875c75c15751fdb29d39"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/216e5f7def20bfd031a3e6bb3dadefaaac20b0ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:08:06Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:08:06Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(correo,rrhh): motor de correo fase 1 + edicion del trabajador en el legajo\n\nMotor de correo (webhook api/enviar-correo con Resend enchufable via\nRESEND_API_KEY; sin llave responde 503 claro): credenciales (admin envia\nel acceso del portal al correo declarado, opcional al crear la cuenta),\nverificacion (enlace al propio trabajador; aterriza en\napi/correo-accion) y recuperacion publica de olvide-mi-clave (enlace de\n1 hora a portal/restablecer + api/restablecer-clave; respuesta siempre\ngenerica). BD: personas.correo + correo_verificado + correo_tokens\n(solo servidor); portal_primer_ingreso captura el correo junto al\ncelular y alta_trabajador lo registra opcional; v_personal lo refleja\n(columna Contacto, legajo, modal de cuenta portal con boton Enviar\nacceso por correo). Ademas: editar_trabajador desde el legajo\n(superadmin o nivel >=2 en Personal via fn_nivel_modulo; lo escrito\nmanda, corregir nombre limpia por-confirmar, cambio de correo re-exige\nverificacion, auditoria sin numero de cuenta en claro) con modal Editar\ndatos. Migraciones aplicadas en produccion; canonicos sincronizados.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3932d5cb2f76b4005a0050022b797f217fe1e5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/b3932d5cb2f76b4005a0050022b797f217fe1e5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/216e5f7def20bfd031a3e6bb3dadefaaac20b0ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/216e5f7def20bfd031a3e6bb3dadefaaac20b0ee","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDIxNmU1ZjdkZWYyMGJmZDAzMWEzZTZiYjNkYWRlZmFhYWMyMGIwZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/c20cfd9f2b100175a24336eaba2f9cbcb7f41285","sha":"c20cfd9f2b100175a24336eaba2f9cbcb7f41285","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/c20cfd9f2b100175a24336eaba2f9cbcb7f41285"}],"sha":"216e5f7def20bfd031a3e6bb3dadefaaac20b0ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/216e5f7def20bfd031a3e6bb3dadefaaac20b0ee"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/c20cfd9f2b100175a24336eaba2f9cbcb7f41285/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T20:38:21Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T20:38:21Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"chore: reintento de deploy (fallo de plataforma en Vercel, build de 0ms)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c1c1e9491301e75c74e6cc2d6d5d8bc06a61973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/4c1c1e9491301e75c74e6cc2d6d5d8bc06a6197