xMzNmZDc2MmU0NDNiMzZjYzNlNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/96fc6b80ce3da037c04248137371823828a6be76","sha":"96fc6b80ce3da037c04248137371823828a6be76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/96fc6b80ce3da037c04248137371823828a6be76"}],"sha":"e7ba4cb8f7c5ae05775133fd762e443b36cc3e54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/e7ba4cb8f7c5ae05775133fd762e443b36cc3e54"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/96fc6b80ce3da037c04248137371823828a6be76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T19:19:36Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T19:19:36Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(rrhh): buscador de faltas del RIT en la emision disciplinaria\n\nEl catalogo trae 50 faltas: un campo de busqueda filtra en vivo las\nopciones del select (sin acentos; por texto o por numero: abandono,\n20 c, 56.2), muestra cuantas coinciden y la falta ya elegida nunca\ndesaparece del listado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f635621755f871e1f32312e91ba6902a7261779","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/4f635621755f871e1f32312e91ba6902a7261779"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/96fc6b80ce3da037c04248137371823828a6be76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/96fc6b80ce3da037c04248137371823828a6be76","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDk2ZmM2YjgwY2UzZGEwMzdjMDQyNDgxMzczNzE4MjM4MjhhNmJlNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/45d0682552c1aaf93f17d2913845793caad21015","sha":"45d0682552c1aaf93f17d2913845793caad21015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/45d0682552c1aaf93f17d2913845793caad21015"}],"sha":"96fc6b80ce3da037c04248137371823828a6be76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/96fc6b80ce3da037c04248137371823828a6be76"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/45d0682552c1aaf93f17d2913845793caad21015/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T19:04:43Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T19:04:43Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(lineas): RS Pago y RS Uso + carga del recibo Movistar real (204 lineas)\n\nEl pago de todas las lineas sale de PROMANT pero cada una se distribuye\na la razon social que la usa: columna usa en lineas (null = por\nasignar), columnas RS Pago y RS Uso en ADQ-05 con distribucion editable\nen la propia tabla, contador de lineas sin distribuir, y el formulario\nde nueva linea registra la RS de uso (pago default PROMANT, operador\ndefault Movistar). Carga directa del recibo PS MOVISTAR CF JUN.pdf: 204\nlineas con plan y costo neto del periodo (S/ 3,279.87; costo = cargos\nmas descuentos de cada anexo, verificado a mano contra el anexo 1);\nreimportar un recibo nuevo actualiza plan y costo sin tocar la\ndistribucion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0495993ad07bd6a38ba4b3364766bd565cdb488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/e0495993ad07bd6a38ba4b3364766bd565cdb488"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/45d0682552c1aaf93f17d2913845793caad21015","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/45d0682552c1aaf93f17d2913845793caad21015","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDQ1ZDA2ODI1NTJjMWFhZjkzZjE3ZDI5MTM4NDU3OTNjYWFkMjEwMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/8cf950dd940024a291eaf2344662df402e7fbacb","sha":"8cf950dd940024a291eaf2344662df402e7fbacb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8cf950dd940024a291eaf2344662df402e7fbacb"}],"sha":"45d0682552c1aaf93f17d2913845793caad21015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/45d0682552c1aaf93f17d2913845793caad21015"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8cf950dd940024a291eaf2344662df402e7fbacb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T18:46:39Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T18:46:39Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(disciplinario): modulo parametrizado por el RIT de CLEAN (4 fases)\n\nPlan aprobado por Diego con sus 4 decisiones (plazos 3/5 habiles como\nparametro, sabado habil, suspension la imponen GG/RRHH/Administracion,\nRIT de CLEAN para todas las razones sociales). Catalogo LITERAL del RIT\n(art. 20 a-r y art. 56 1-31), 6 tipos de proceso del art. 53 + preavisos\ndel art. 31 LPCL (imputacion en dias naturales, no sancion), feriados\nPeru 2026, motor fn_sumar_dias, emitir_memorandum v2 (texto y\nantecedentes congelados art. 54, reincidencia art. 58, tope suspension 3\ndias art. 53c, nivel del emisor server-side), notificar_memorandum (el\nplazo corre desde la notificacion), vencimiento derivado y alerta de\npreaviso notarial. Pantalla RRH-18/19 parametrizada: selector de faltas\nen dos niveles con texto literal, antecedentes a la vista, registro de\namonestacion verbal sin carta. Expediente demo 0141-2026 corregido a\nart. 20 c) conc. 56.1. Verificado 10/10 en produccion; canonicos\nsincronizados (empalme con split/join: String.replace corrompe los $$).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44cadfcaf662df3331dd69b9ae232393c35741df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/44cadfcaf662df3331dd69b9ae232393c35741df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/8cf950dd940024a291eaf2344662df402e7fbacb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/8cf950dd940024a291eaf2344662df402e7fbacb","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDhjZjk1MGRkOTQwMDI0YTI5MWVhZjIzNDQ2NjJkZjQwMmU3ZmJhY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/bf87c0eb7a0b8e94b1621ec832b81c515e48c543","sha":"bf87c0eb7a0b8e94b1621ec832b81c515e48c543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/bf87c0eb7a0b8e94b1621ec832b81c515e48c543"}],"sha":"8cf950dd940024a291eaf2344662df402e7fbacb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8cf950dd940024a291eaf2344662df402e7fbacb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/bf87c0eb7a0b8e94b1621ec832b81c515e48c543/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T18:23:17Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T18:23:17Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(rrhh): orden y busqueda en la bandeja de memorandums + plan disciplinario\n\nFlechitas de orden en los encabezados Trabajador y Notificado (asc/desc/\nsin orden, vacios al final) y busqueda por nombre o DNI. Ademas el plan\npropuesto del modulo disciplinario parametrizado por RIT (spec: docs de\nDiego en Tareas 17-08), pendiente de su aprobacion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cad440532d6cc2ec682eac5bba3fb587c30854cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/cad440532d6cc2ec682eac5bba3fb587c30854cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/bf87c0eb7a0b8e94b1621ec832b81c515e48c543","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/bf87c0eb7a0b8e94b1621ec832b81c515e48c543","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGJmODdjMGViN2EwYjhlOTRiMTYyMWVjODMyYjgxYzUxNWU0OGM1NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/67bcc222355b0f9212afd796557ed069aa3febcf","sha":"67bcc222355b0f9212afd796557ed069aa3febcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/67bcc222355b0f9212afd796557ed069aa3febcf"}],"sha":"bf87c0eb7a0b8e94b1621ec832b81c515e48c543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/bf87c0eb7a0b8e94b1621ec832b81c515e48c543"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/67bcc222355b0f9212afd796557ed069aa3febcf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:55:51Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:55:51Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(limpieza,comunicados): modulos fuera, categorias fusionadas y pendientes reales\n\nLimpieza pedida por Diego: EPP y uniformes queda en gris Proximamente\n(sin ruta), Costo por sede retirado, tipos Gratificacion y Utilidades\nfuera de la carga de boletas, y Telefonia fusionada en Comunicaciones\n(migracion: filas movidas, check de categoria y de IMEI actualizados;\nUI, mock y seed sincronizados). Comunicados: Ver pendientes ahora lista\na las personas del segmento que no confirmaron lectura (la segmentacion\nse guarda estructural empresa/sede al publicar, vista\nv_comunicado_pendientes en portal.sql por depender de\ncomunicado_lecturas), la lectura se calcula viva desde las\nconfirmaciones del portal y el alcance se calcula real sobre el padron\nvigente (fuera los multiplicadores de demo).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"437293212432bf9bc9b29f1f480ea1b26f7947af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/437293212432bf9bc9b29f1f480ea1b26f7947af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/67bcc222355b0f9212afd796557ed069aa3febcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/67bcc222355b0f9212afd796557ed069aa3febcf","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDY3YmNjMjIyMzU1YjBmOTIxMmFmZDc5NjU1N2VkMDY5YWEzZmViY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/0a47f49a1196b1514f62b4dc9728c7c91f35224a","sha":"0a47f49a1196b1514f62b4dc9728c7c91f35224a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/0a47f49a1196b1514f62b4dc9728c7c91f35224a"}],"sha":"67bcc222355b0f9212afd796557ed069aa3febcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/67bcc222355b0f9212afd796557ed069aa3febcf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/0a47f49a1196b1514f62b4dc9728c7c91f35224a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:38:07Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:38:07Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(claves): ojito de mostrar clave al reemplazar la provisional\n\nEn el BackOffice (CambioClave, primer ingreso del usuario admin) y en el\napp del trabajador (PrimerIngreso del portal): los dos campos de clave\nnueva llevan el mismo ojito mostrar/ocultar que ya tenian los logins. En\nun celular de obra poder VER lo que se teclea evita bloqueos al crear la\nclave definitiva. Con esto no queda ningun campo de clave sin ojito.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf79bf8b624bb5efe840e092b3b3233556719ac9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/bf79bf8b624bb5efe840e092b3b3233556719ac9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/0a47f49a1196b1514f62b4dc9728c7c91f35224a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/0a47f49a1196b1514f62b4dc9728c7c91f35224a","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDBhNDdmNDlhMTE5NmIxNTE0ZjYyYjRkYzk3MjhjN2M5MWYzNTIyNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/2b4ee4a6c10b60d44d07cd7438610651c8fb51b6","sha":"2b4ee4a6c10b60d44d07cd7438610651c8fb51b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/2b4ee4a6c10b60d44d07cd7438610651c8fb51b6"}],"sha":"0a47f49a1196b1514f62b4dc9728c7c91f35224a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/0a47f49a1196b1514f62b4dc9728c7c91f35224a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/2b4ee4a6c10b60d44d07cd7438610651c8fb51b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:28:51Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:28:51Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(portal,rrhh,admin): clave inicial fija, contacto visible y edicion de activos\n\nTres pedidos de Diego: (1) la clave inicial del Portal es FIJA 111111\npara todos (no hay medio para repartir claves; Supabase no admite menos\nde 6 caracteres, por eso no es 1111) y el primer ingreso ya obligaba a\ncrear clave propia y declarar celular; restablecer tambien entrega\n111111 y reactiva el registro. (2) El celular declarado en el portal ya\nfluia a personas.celular; ahora Personal muestra la columna Contacto y\nun boton Ver detalle hacia el legajo (RRH-03, que ya tenia boletas y\nconfirmaciones via v_acuses). (3) Edicion de activos: RPC editar_activo\n(renombrar codigo arrastra asignaciones y lineas por FK on update\ncascade y limpia por_corregir; lo escrito manda) + modal Editar en\nADQ-01. Verificado 19/19 en produccion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4930c1da86773c7757f828d9cc937f22c877c357","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/4930c1da86773c7757f828d9cc937f22c877c357"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/2b4ee4a6c10b60d44d07cd7438610651c8fb51b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/2b4ee4a6c10b60d44d07cd7438610651c8fb51b6","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDJiNGVlNGE2YzEwYjYwZDQ0ZDA3Y2Q3NDM4NjEwNjUxYzhmYjUxYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/a64322fd9778a21f4419bd2e434712adabf16f94","sha":"a64322fd9778a21f4419bd2e434712adabf16f94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a64322fd9778a21f4419bd2e434712adabf16f94"}],"sha":"2b4ee4a6c10b60d44d07cd7438610651c8fb51b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/2b4ee4a6c10b60d44d07cd7438610651c8fb51b6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a64322fd9778a21f4419bd2e434712adabf16f94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:11:00Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:11:00Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(app,portal): recarga automatica cuando la pestana quedo detras de un deploy\n\nTras un deploy los chunks cambian de hash y una pestana abierta con la\nversion anterior falla con Failed to fetch dynamically imported module\n(el catch-all del SPA responde HTML). El listener de vite:preloadError\nrecarga la pagina una vez (guard de 30 s contra bucles) para tomar la\nversion nueva, en la app principal y en el portal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4880e50aba7b60ba1aadf99f88d24fb2b9b2d91f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/4880e50aba7b60ba1aadf99f88d24fb2b9b2d91f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/a64322fd9778a21f4419bd2e434712adabf16f94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/a64322fd9778a21f4419bd2e434712adabf16f94","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGE2NDMyMmZkOTc3OGEyMWY0NDE5YmQyZTQzNDcxMmFkYWJmMTZmOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/b8ef942ab52284535616a9e761845c03e1d08a25","sha":"b8ef942ab52284535616a9e761845c03e1d08a25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/b8ef942ab52284535616a9e761845c03e1d08a25"}],"sha":"a64322fd9778a21f4419bd2e434712adabf16f94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a64322fd9778a21f4419bd2e434712adabf16f94"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/b8ef942ab52284535616a9e761845c03e1d08a25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:03:26Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:03:26Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(campos): celular libre en personas/usuarios y datos jalados al crear usuario\n\nTres ajustes del hilo de prueba de Diego: (1) el limite de digitos ahora\nse aplica DESPUES de sanear (bug RRH-04: maxLength cortaba el texto\ncrudo y un numero pegado con espacios o +51 perdia digitos; helpers\nsoloDigitos/normalizarCelular con 8 pruebas). (2) El celular de personas\ny usuarios administrativos es LIBRE (checks de 9 digitos fuera en BD,\ncampos sin restriccion: acepta +51 y espacios tal como llegan en los\nExcels de planilla; lineas moviles conservan sus 9 digitos exactos por\nser clave). (3) Al elegir la persona en Nuevo usuario (ACC-04) se jala\nsu celular ya registrado en Personal, editable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3335fa603c89fec49ce19b9a185b152a4f1c139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/a3335fa603c89fec49ce19b9a185b152a4f1c139"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/b8ef942ab52284535616a9e761845c03e1d08a25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/b8ef942ab52284535616a9e761845c03e1d08a25","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGI4ZWY5NDJhYjUyMjg0NTM1NjE2YTllNzYxODQ1YzAzZTFkMDhhMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/11279e6c0b064643789099055287c5a0e7470ef4","sha":"11279e6c0b064643789099055287c5a0e7470ef4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/11279e6c0b064643789099055287c5a0e7470ef4"}],"sha":"b8ef942ab52284535616a9e761845c03e1d08a25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/b8ef942ab52284535616a9e761845c03e1d08a25"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/11279e6c0b064643789099055287c5a0e7470ef4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:47:48Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T16:47:48Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(rrhh): pantalla RRH-21 Sedes con codigo propio y alta manual\n\nCada sede lleva codigo de secuencia S-0001 (asignado por la BD, estilo\nU-0001): backfill de las existentes, RPC crear_sede (nombre unico por\nempresa, id slug estable, auditoria) y la importacion de personal\ntambien asigna codigo a las sedes que crea. Pantalla nueva en RRHH >\nSedes (modulo personal): tabla con codigo/cliente/supervisor/direccion/\nestado y modal de alta. v_sedes expone las columnas nuevas. Verificado\n6/6 en produccion (verificar-sedes.mjs). Habilita el flujo de alta\nmanual de personal administrativo: sede -> RRH-04 -> categoria en ACC.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3323d253173e7e6f01711aa44b337790a204f041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/3323d253173e7e6f01711aa44b337790a204f041"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/11279e6c0b064643789099055287c5a0e7470ef4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/11279e6c0b064643789099055287c5a0e7470ef4","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDExMjc5ZTZjMGIwNjQ2NDM3ODkwOTkwNTUyODdjNWEwZTc0NzBlZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/cbd86c80d4cb56f74ba34c8644259c65dcb4fb92","sha":"cbd86c80d4cb56f74ba34c8644259c65dcb4fb92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/cbd86c80d4cb56f74ba34c8644259c65dcb4fb92"}],"sha":"11279e6c0b064643789099055287c5a0e7470ef4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/11279e6c0b064643789099055287c5a0e7470ef4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/cbd86c80d4cb56f74ba34c8644259c65dcb4fb92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T15:53:47Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T15:53:47Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(accesos): eliminacion definitiva de categorias (ACC-03)\n\nRPC eliminar_perfil: jamas superadmin, jamas con usuarios asignados;\nborra todas las versiones (matriz incluida, alcance por cascade), deja\nfila de auditoria y el registro de accesos conserva el rastro (texto\ndenormalizado, sin FK). Boton Eliminar en el catalogo (solo categorias\nsin usuarios y no superadmin) con confirmacion escrita ELIMINAR, mismo\npatron que la eliminacion de usuarios. Migracion aplicada y verificada\n6/6 en produccion (verificar-eliminar-perfil.mjs, que ademas limpio el\nperfil basura prueba-e2e).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8f75086ccddfd951feff854d7ebd7b176c54fc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/c8f75086ccddfd951feff854d7ebd7b176c54fc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/cbd86c80d4cb56f74ba34c8644259c65dcb4fb92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/cbd86c80d4cb56f74ba34c8644259c65dcb4fb92","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGNiZDg2YzgwZDRjYjU2Zjc0YmEzNGM4NjQ0MjU5YzY1ZGNiNGZiOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/a859cb0050c53e0e04ae818dd34e2ca21e98b58a","sha":"a859cb0050c53e0e04ae818dd34e2ca21e98b58a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a859cb0050c53e0e04ae818dd34e2ca21e98b58a"}],"sha":"cbd86c80d4cb56f74ba34c8644259c65dcb4fb92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/cbd86c80d4cb56f74ba34c8644259c65dcb4fb92"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a859cb0050c53e0e04ae818dd34e2ca21e98b58a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:52:26Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:52:26Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(importar): codigos repetidos entran marcados repetido-falta-corregir\n\nSegunda decision de Diego 2026-08-17: el duplicado dentro del archivo ya\nno bloquea. El parser marca repetido en todas las ocurrencias y sufija\nlas repeticiones con codigo provisional determinista (-R2, -R3...); la\nBD guarda activos.por_corregir (el RPC lo escribe siempre: reimportar el\narchivo corregido limpia el estado solo); ADQ-01 muestra el badge Falta\ncorregir; la vista previa lista filas, usuarios y provisionales. Con\nesto el inventario real de PROMANT importa completo. Migracion aplicada\ny verificada 18/18 en produccion; vitest 76/76.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9aac64d8ce99acc81816d4a60ff4ca6575330c6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/9aac64d8ce99acc81816d4a60ff4ca6575330c6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/a859cb0050c53e0e04ae818dd34e2ca21e98b58a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/a859cb0050c53e0e04ae818dd34e2ca21e98b58a","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGE4NTljYjAwNTBjNTNlMGUwNGFlODE4ZGQzNGUyY2EyMWU5OGI1OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/36fc09fce895ebffb96dd08437d186cffe74b865","sha":"36fc09fce895ebffb96dd08437d186cffe74b865","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/36fc09fce895ebffb96dd08437d186cffe74b865"}],"sha":"a859cb0050c53e0e04ae818dd34e2ca21e98b58a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a859cb0050c53e0e04ae818dd34e2ca21e98b58a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/36fc09fce895ebffb96dd08437d186cffe74b865/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:32:50Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:32:50Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(importar): impresoras recodificadas por numero de serie\n\nDecision de Diego 2026-08-17: EPSON+anio no identifica un equipo, la\nserie si. Impresora con serie de forma real -> codigo = serie; el codigo\ndel archivo queda en observaciones y codigoArchivo, y la vista previa\nlista cada recodificacion. En el archivo real: 11/14 impresoras\nrecodificadas, los 4 choques EPSON resueltos; solo PROLT51 (laptops)\nsigue bloqueando. TDD: 29 pruebas del parser (criterios del doc sobre el\narchivo tal cual + comportamiento por defecto del producto).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a3c65801ecb11423d4b5d226717bf8a1ce046f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/4a3c65801ecb11423d4b5d226717bf8a1ce046f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/36fc09fce895ebffb96dd08437d186cffe74b865","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/36fc09fce895ebffb96dd08437d186cffe74b865","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDM2ZmMwOWZjZTg5NWViZmZiOTZkZDA4NDM3ZDE4NmNmZmU3NGI4NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/8991610249b1be837222d8d025b1b3626c700793","sha":"8991610249b1be837222d8d025b1b3626c700793","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8991610249b1be837222d8d025b1b3626c700793"}],"sha":"36fc09fce895ebffb96dd08437d186cffe74b865","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/36fc09fce895ebffb96dd08437d186cffe74b865"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8991610249b1be837222d8d025b1b3626c700793/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:19:37Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:19:37Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"test(activos): verificacion por el canal real y cierre del ciclo (Fase 4)\n\nSeccion --proxy en verificar-importacion-activos.mjs: el RPC clasifica\nvia /api/supa con JWT admin (mismo canal que la pantalla) y el bloqueo\npor duplicado viaja como error legible. 16/16 en produccion. Plan\nmarcado ejecutado con estado final.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f16e1e388168a1da08d6a22be22cac4cc39f941","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/1f16e1e388168a1da08d6a22be22cac4cc39f941"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/8991610249b1be837222d8d025b1b3626c700793","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/8991610249b1be837222d8d025b1b3626c700793","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDg5OTE2MTAyNDliMWJlODM3MjIyZDhkMDI1YjFiMzYyNmM3MDA3OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/fb9fe5410ef59f41b7e38270b6fa86900d4dbb99","sha":"fb9fe5410ef59f41b7e38270b6fa86900d4dbb99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/fb9fe5410ef59f41b7e38270b6fa86900d4dbb99"}],"sha":"8991610249b1be837222d8d025b1b3626c700793","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/8991610249b1be837222d8d025b1b3626c700793"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/fb9fe5410ef59f41b7e38270b6fa86900d4dbb99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:16:49Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:16:49Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(admin): pantalla ADQ-08 Importar inventario de activos (Fase 3)\n\nFlujo del doc: archivo -> confirmacion bloqueante de razon social (la\ndel archivo manda, boton con el nombre de la empresa) -> vista previa\n(altas, actualizaciones campo a campo, duplicados bloqueantes con filas\ny usuarios, filas a revisar, prefijo vs tipo, series repetidas) ->\nimportacion transaccional. resolverEmpresaArchivo con TDD: fuera de\ncatalogo y fuera de alcance devuelven el mismo rechazo sin revelar\nexistencia; retirada dentro del alcance si se dice. La columna Asignado\nmuestra el texto importado como sin-confirmar (no vincula al maestro)\ny el filtro tolera serie nula.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62a9905d001709c7ed95c8c979844923b55aaf0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/62a9905d001709c7ed95c8c979844923b55aaf0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/fb9fe5410ef59f41b7e38270b6fa86900d4dbb99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/fb9fe5410ef59f41b7e38270b6fa86900d4dbb99","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGZiOWZlNTQxMGVmNTlmNDFiN2UzODI3MGI2ZmE4NjkwMGQ0ZGJiOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/a1285e30e03bbe59085d4da698c3eed3648f7493","sha":"a1285e30e03bbe59085d4da698c3eed3648f7493","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a1285e30e03bbe59085d4da698c3eed3648f7493"}],"sha":"fb9fe5410ef59f41b7e38270b6fa86900d4dbb99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/fb9fe5410ef59f41b7e38270b6fa86900d4dbb99"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a1285e30e03bbe59085d4da698c3eed3648f7493/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:10:25Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:10:25Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(bd): importacion de inventario de activos - migracion y RPCs (Fase 2)\n\nColumnas tipo/area/asignado_sin_confirmar/usuario_anterior/observaciones;\nmarca/modelo/serie opcionales y fuera la unicidad categoria+serie (el\nFormato 7.1 real trae vacios y procesadores en la columna de serie).\nRPCs transaccionales importar_activos (identidad = codigo global; otra\nempresa = bloqueo por traslado; vacio no borra; prefijo no degrada;\njamas baja por ausencia; diff campo a campo para la vista previa) y\nprevisualizar_importacion_activos (patron PV999). Auditoria con razon\nsocial confirmada + archivo + quien. Aplicada y verificada 14/14 en\nproduccion (verificar-importacion-activos.mjs, datos ZZPRUEBA- acotados).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f427f82b06007043f49c4269e58035084a5eeb3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/f427f82b06007043f49c4269e58035084a5eeb3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/a1285e30e03bbe59085d4da698c3eed3648f7493","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/a1285e30e03bbe59085d4da698c3eed3648f7493","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGExMjg1ZTMwZTAzYmJlNTkwODVkNGRhNjk4YzNlZWQzNjQ4Zjc0OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/eda10c6129d2e7eaa2ba0825d03e911b7bc8f749","sha":"eda10c6129d2e7eaa2ba0825d03e911b7bc8f749"