aude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71c74db6ed0486a9aa1407f23c434cd0d8c178a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/71c74db6ed0486a9aa1407f23c434cd0d8c178a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/90d315016eb4be9687f6d6fff8875ae1e08776a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/90d315016eb4be9687f6d6fff8875ae1e08776a9","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDkwZDMxNTAxNmViNGJlOTY4N2Y2ZDZmZmY4ODc1YWUxZTA4Nzc2YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/86d653fdcf4612e0daa1b5fbbf174c3352eaaffe","sha":"86d653fdcf4612e0daa1b5fbbf174c3352eaaffe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/86d653fdcf4612e0daa1b5fbbf174c3352eaaffe"}],"sha":"90d315016eb4be9687f6d6fff8875ae1e08776a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/90d315016eb4be9687f6d6fff8875ae1e08776a9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/86d653fdcf4612e0daa1b5fbbf174c3352eaaffe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:41:26Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:41:26Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(portal): pantallas TRB-04 a TRB-12 completas (23KB gzip total)\n\nTareas 6-8 del plan: Inicio con pendientes por urgencia y Tu mes, Boletas\npor anio con versiones y estado de acuse, Documento con visor PDF validado\nantes de habilitar la confirmacion, Hoja de Declaracion con lectura completa\nobligatoria y constancia descargable con huella, Comunicado con visto\nautomatico y confirmacion si la exige, y Mis Datos con contacto editable,\ncuenta enmascarada con solicitud de cambio y cierre de sesion. Bucket de\nStorage documentos con PDFs de demostracion generados sin librerias.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"11987fe33de47ffd29c001aa6fc5b63eebabcba2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/11987fe33de47ffd29c001aa6fc5b63eebabcba2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/86d653fdcf4612e0daa1b5fbbf174c3352eaaffe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/86d653fdcf4612e0daa1b5fbbf174c3352eaaffe","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDg2ZDY1M2ZkY2Y0NjEyZTBkYWExYjVmYmJmMTc0YzMzNTJlYWFmZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/06837f6f7624038865f71ac7d4dcb14980b23a8e","sha":"06837f6f7624038865f71ac7d4dcb14980b23a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/06837f6f7624038865f71ac7d4dcb14980b23a8e"}],"sha":"86d653fdcf4612e0daa1b5fbbf174c3352eaaffe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/86d653fdcf4612e0daa1b5fbbf174c3352eaaffe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/06837f6f7624038865f71ac7d4dcb14980b23a8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:37:31Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:37:31Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(rrhh): cuentas del portal desde el maestro de Personal\n\nTarea 3 del plan del portal: accion Portal por trabajador con modal para\ncrear la cuenta o restablecer la clave (numerica de 8 digitos, mostrada una\nsola vez para entrega presencial) via la serverless portal-cuentas. El\nboton demo de reenviar clave desaparece.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ef71c510e1d6e12506016f9cfbd85215195a08d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/ef71c510e1d6e12506016f9cfbd85215195a08d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/06837f6f7624038865f71ac7d4dcb14980b23a8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/06837f6f7624038865f71ac7d4dcb14980b23a8e","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDA2ODM3ZjZmNzYyNDAzODg2NWY3MWFjN2Q0ZGNiMTQ5ODBiMjNhOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/2054ae3ed69f72904729472d3ec5ef364a683051","sha":"2054ae3ed69f72904729472d3ec5ef364a683051","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/2054ae3ed69f72904729472d3ec5ef364a683051"}],"sha":"06837f6f7624038865f71ac7d4dcb14980b23a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/06837f6f7624038865f71ac7d4dcb14980b23a8e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/2054ae3ed69f72904729472d3ec5ef364a683051/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:35:33Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:35:33Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(portal): scaffold Preact del portal (18KB gzip) + ingreso y primer ingreso\n\nTareas 4-5 del plan: app Vite mas Preact en la carpeta portal (14.25KB JS y\n3.8KB CSS gzip, presupuesto 60KB), cliente Supabase artesanal con refresh y\ncanal x-sesion, mini-router propio, marco con barra inferior, ingreso por\nDNI (mensaje unico, bloqueo, registro en ACC-06 superficie portal), pantalla\nestatica de clave olvidada (hasta el motor de mensajeria) y primer ingreso\nno salteable (clave nueva, celular o sin celular, aceptacion versionada de\nla politica de datos Ley 29733). Proyecto Vercel intranet-portal con dominio\nreal intranet-portal-two punto vercel punto app, framework vite, root en la\ncarpeta portal y repo conectado via API; proteccion de deployments\ndesactivada. El dominio principal enruta la ruta portal al proyecto hijo con\nun rewrite plano, la misma tecnica probada del proxy de Supabase.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c6fade17ea73988af2cbfb24dada30c2f751c03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/4c6fade17ea73988af2cbfb24dada30c2f751c03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/2054ae3ed69f72904729472d3ec5ef364a683051","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/2054ae3ed69f72904729472d3ec5ef364a683051","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDIwNTRhZTNlZDY5ZjcyOTA0NzI5NDcyZDNlYzVlZjM2NGE2ODMwNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/29bb1fdb1fa04026433bad728f250bd0ebe9be84","sha":"29bb1fdb1fa04026433bad728f250bd0ebe9be84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/29bb1fdb1fa04026433bad728f250bd0ebe9be84"}],"sha":"2054ae3ed69f72904729472d3ec5ef364a683051","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/2054ae3ed69f72904729472d3ec5ef364a683051"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/29bb1fdb1fa04026433bad728f250bd0ebe9be84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:21:30Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:21:30Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(portal): serverless de cuentas del trabajador y GoTrue con minimo 6\n\nTarea 2 del plan: api/portal-cuentas.js (crear, restablecer, crear-lote de\nhasta 50) con cuentas tecnicas dni@portal.grupoer.pe y claves provisionales\nnumericas de 8 digitos; autorizacion por JWT del BackOffice con nivel >= 2\nen el modulo personal, y los propios trabajadores no pueden administrar.\npassword_min_length de GoTrue bajado a 6 (aplicado; el BackOffice sigue\nexigiendo 12 en sus pantallas).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"961024e766a8487644e4f710ec67fa21e484725f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/961024e766a8487644e4f710ec67fa21e484725f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/29bb1fdb1fa04026433bad728f250bd0ebe9be84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/29bb1fdb1fa04026433bad728f250bd0ebe9be84","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDI5YmIxZmRiMWZhMDQwMjY0MzNiYWQ3MjhmMjUwYmQwZWJlOWJlODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/ed381e7685cbe6e7e8d2f30b49a0d1f622f1afc1","sha":"ed381e7685cbe6e7e8d2f30b49a0d1f622f1afc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/ed381e7685cbe6e7e8d2f30b49a0d1f622f1afc1"}],"sha":"29bb1fdb1fa04026433bad728f250bd0ebe9be84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/29bb1fdb1fa04026433bad728f250bd0ebe9be84"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/ed381e7685cbe6e7e8d2f30b49a0d1f622f1afc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:20:18Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T20:20:18Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(portal): esquema SQL del Portal del Trabajador V1\n\nTarea 1 del plan: cuentas_portal, declaraciones versionadas (seed v1 de\nrecepcion, lectura y politica de datos Ley 29733), comunicado_lecturas,\nsolicitudes_cambio_cuenta, archivo_url en documentos, RPCs portal_* (el dni\nSIEMPRE derivado del JWT; pre-login solo bloqueo y registro) y vistas\nv_portal_* con scoping real por sesion (vacias sin JWT del portal, probado).\nAplicado a la BD viva; idempotente para resets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8bf7943705c7b5e8df0b4bf038a744683e4e0bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/e8bf7943705c7b5e8df0b4bf038a744683e4e0bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/ed381e7685cbe6e7e8d2f30b49a0d1f622f1afc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/ed381e7685cbe6e7e8d2f30b49a0d1f622f1afc1","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGVkMzgxZTc2ODVjYmU2ZTdlOGQyZjMwYjQ5YTBkMWY2MjJmMWFmYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/90111ebb69b1904e17d523931cf0612dc98f6f9c","sha":"90111ebb69b1904e17d523931cf0612dc98f6f9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/90111ebb69b1904e17d523931cf0612dc98f6f9c"}],"sha":"ed381e7685cbe6e7e8d2f30b49a0d1f622f1afc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/ed381e7685cbe6e7e8d2f30b49a0d1f622f1afc1"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits?per_page=100&page=3&sha=203696ecb769f415d1f2ebde3714f72cf8900ce6&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A43%3A50.443Z"}');
