ed","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/d8c9e22a9079a27a9d0ad82aeefd25a4cc24672f","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGQ4YzllMjJhOTA3OWEyN2E5ZDBhZDgyYWVlZmQyNWE0Y2MyNDY3MmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/55ff52f65f4757a08c130496e21254e7ea6610a6","sha":"55ff52f65f4757a08c130496e21254e7ea6610a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/55ff52f65f4757a08c130496e21254e7ea6610a6"}],"sha":"d8c9e22a9079a27a9d0ad82aeefd25a4cc24672f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/d8c9e22a9079a27a9d0ad82aeefd25a4cc24672f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/55ff52f65f4757a08c130496e21254e7ea6610a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T16:59:08Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T16:59:08Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(accesos): service key propia del proyecto para la funcion de cuentas\n\nLa SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY que dejo la integracion del marketplace en\nVercel no corresponde a este proyecto (el JWT del llamador no validaba).\nscripts/configurar-service-key.mjs obtiene la clave real via Management API\ny la guarda como SUPA_SERVICE_KEY; la funcion la prefiere. Incluye el script\nverificar-categorias.mjs (E2E de BD: 9 pruebas, todas pasaron).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"561d57661dfd635a8cb0afaaa7557e6b65878a1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/561d57661dfd635a8cb0afaaa7557e6b65878a1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/55ff52f65f4757a08c130496e21254e7ea6610a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/55ff52f65f4757a08c130496e21254e7ea6610a6","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDU1ZmY1MmY2NWY0NzU3YTA4YzEzMDQ5NmUyMTI1NGU3ZWE2NjEwYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/254781d9f1079b4ed08bd4673625f6e6a198d05f","sha":"254781d9f1079b4ed08bd4673625f6e6a198d05f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/254781d9f1079b4ed08bd4673625f6e6a198d05f"}],"sha":"55ff52f65f4757a08c130496e21254e7ea6610a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/55ff52f65f4757a08c130496e21254e7ea6610a6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/254781d9f1079b4ed08bd4673625f6e6a198d05f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T16:55:36Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T16:55:36Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(accesos): UI de Categorias, usuarios con codigo y eliminacion, y enforcement al ingresar\n\nTareas 3-6 del plan: state carga v_mi_acceso y expone user.acceso; el editor\nACC-04 (ahora Categorias) define razones sociales versionadas con diff e\nhistorial; ACC-01/02 hereda accesos en solo lectura, muestra codigo U-000N y\nfecha de registro, crea la cuenta de ingreso real al guardar (serverless) y\nsuma Eliminar definitivamente con confirmacion escrita; Restablecer clave\ncambia la clave real de la cuenta. Enforcement: menu lateral y selector de\nempresa filtrados por la categoria, guard RequiereModulo en cada ruta y\naterrizaje en la primera pantalla permitida.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"104e2a160d31ffa74904cf020dc8acd3355de544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/104e2a160d31ffa74904cf020dc8acd3355de544"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/254781d9f1079b4ed08bd4673625f6e6a198d05f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/254781d9f1079b4ed08bd4673625f6e6a198d05f","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDI1NDc4MWQ5ZjEwNzliNGVkMDhiZDQ2NzM2MjVmNmU2YTE5OGQwNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/a7af20c44a35a77b6a6f21e60d1b785250c34287","sha":"a7af20c44a35a77b6a6f21e60d1b785250c34287","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a7af20c44a35a77b6a6f21e60d1b785250c34287"}],"sha":"254781d9f1079b4ed08bd4673625f6e6a198d05f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/254781d9f1079b4ed08bd4673625f6e6a198d05f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a7af20c44a35a77b6a6f21e60d1b785250c34287/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T16:47:46Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T16:47:46Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(accesos): esquema v2 de Categorias aplicado + funcion serverless de cuentas\n\nTareas 1-2 del plan: perfil_empresas versionada, codigo U-000N con secuencia,\nFK de registro_accesos con set null y trigger que permite SOLO la\ndesvinculacion, guardar_perfil con alcance, crear/actualizar sin alcance por\nusuario, eliminar_usuario_admin, puede() contra la categoria, vistas v2 con\nv_mi_acceso, y archivado de categorias dejando Superadministrador y Gerente\nde Administracion. Migracion aplicada y verificada en produccion; accesos.sql\ncanonico sincronizado. api/admin-usuarios.js crea y elimina cuentas GoTrue\ncon la service key, gated por el JWT del llamador y su nivel en accesos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5702983a