42e4cf17505ccda05887ce80e3ca498f82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/9b52d642e4cf17505ccda05887ce80e3ca498f82"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/4d026b230e5aa7e52f45d11b1672c349cebb9eae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:43:59Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:43:59Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(diseno): fundamentos v2 - Poppins/Montserrat, grises suaves, radio maestro 10px\n\nTarea 1 del plan docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-13-rediseno-estilo-jedu.md:\nfuentes del template Login100, tokens de grises mas suaves, token\n--radius-caja (10px) reemplazando los rounded de 4/6px en todo src, y\ntransiciones base + keyframe de aparicion para modales y notas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c53f93f13d5b0a1d8f5698228c27ed8129c34dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/9c53f93f13d5b0a1d8f5698228c27ed8129c34dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/4d026b230e5aa7e52f45d11b1672c349cebb9eae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/4d026b230e5aa7e52f45d11b1672c349cebb9eae","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDRkMDI2YjIzMGU1YWE3ZTUyZjQ1ZDExYjE2NzJjMzQ5Y2ViYjllYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/15c087307112e244193bc5ae95cde40cbf9b6358","sha":"15c087307112e244193bc5ae95cde40cbf9b6358","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/15c087307112e244193bc5ae95cde40cbf9b6358"}],"sha":"4d026b230e5aa7e52f45d11b1672c349cebb9eae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/4d026b230e5aa7e52f45d11b1672c349cebb9eae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/15c087307112e244193bc5ae95cde40cbf9b6358/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:35:50Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:35:50Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(login): reactivar el login real (MODO_DEMO=false) y blindar el espejo eco\n\nEl login quedo reparado y confirmado por Diego en su navegador (recuadro\nverde, ingreso registrado en ACC-06). El espejo eco ahora refleja solo una\nlista blanca de cabeceras: las que inyecta Vercel (oidc-token, firmas)\njamas deben volver al cliente.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29c274a4b4f563525320b0a86663d29138e3ac63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/29c274a4b4f563525320b0a86663d29138e3ac63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/15c087307112e244193bc5ae95cde40cbf9b6358","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/15c087307112e244193bc5ae95cde40cbf9b6358","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDE1YzA4NzMwNzExMmUyNDQxOTNiYzVhZTk1Y2RlNDBjYmY5YjYzNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/d340c0e4af6e04bdbec85924f23337fdaba5f6eb","sha":"d340c0e4af6e04bdbec85924f23337fdaba5f6eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/d340c0e4af6e04bdbec85924f23337fdaba5f6eb"}],"sha":"15c087307112e244193bc5ae95cde40cbf9b6358","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/15c087307112e244193bc5ae95cde40cbf9b6358"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/d340c0e4af6e04bdbec85924f23337fdaba5f6eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:25:39Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:25:39Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(login): CAUSA RAIZ - sanear el BOM invisible de las env vars de Vercel\n\nLos logs del proxy revelaron un TypeError ByteString por el caracter 65279\n(U+FEFF) en un servidor sin antivirus, y el bundle de produccion contiene\nliteralmente uFEFF antes de la clave publishable: la env var\nVITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY se guardo en Vercel con un BOM al inicio (tipico de\nPowerShell 5.1, que escribe UTF-8 con BOM). Ese unico caracter invisible\nexplica TODOS los sintomas de la saga del login: Headers.set y fetch\nreventando con non ISO-8859-1, el XHR sin poder poner la cabecera (llegaba\nausente al espejo eco) y la clave viajando como porcentaje EF BB BF por URL\n(401 Invalid API key). Nunca hubo interceptor.\n\nSe sanea todo valor que venga de env (cliente y proxy) y se corrige la\nnarrativa en los comentarios; el canal blindado v8 se conserva como defensa\ny por el mismo-origen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"89c76370773eae3b2d4757f9271e65b8070102f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/89c76370773eae3b2d4757f9271e65b8070102f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/d340c0e4af6e04bdbec85924f23337fdaba5f6eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/d340c0e4af6e04bdbec85924f23337fdaba5f6eb","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGQzNDBjMGU0YWY2ZTA0YmRiZWM4NTkyNGYyMzMzN2ZkYWJhNWY2ZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/a5296e5dabc5df7518ad089b621c6db0974525a7","sha":"a5296e5dabc5df7518ad089b621c6db0974525a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a5296e5dabc5df7518ad089b621c6db0974525a7"}],"sha":"d340c0e4af6e04bdbec85924f23337fdaba5f6eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/d340c0e4af6e04bdbec85924f23337fdaba5f6eb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a5296e5dabc5df7518ad089b621c6db0974525a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:16:39Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:16:39Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(proxy): funcion fija api-supa con rewrite explicito de ruta por query\n\nLas funciones con segmentos dinamicos pierden contra el rewrite catch-all\ndel SPA (las peticiones volvian como index.html o 405). La funcion pasa a\nser un archivo fijo y un rewrite previo al catch-all le entrega la ruta\ncomo parametro de query.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cce8aa79cb12c6e6860aa9cb289a567bffc7a0d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/cce8aa79cb12c6e6860aa9cb289a567bffc7a0d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/a5296e5dabc5df7518ad089b621c6db0974525a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/a5296e5dabc5df7518ad089b621c6db0974525a7","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGE1Mjk2ZTVkYWJjNWRmNzUxOGFkMDg5YjYyMWM2ZGIwOTc0NTI1YTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/658f1eb3657252ca2d01b50dc5d26d3ec41f245e","sha":"658f1eb3657252ca2d01b50dc5d26d3ec41f245e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/658f1eb3657252ca2d01b50dc5d26d3ec41f245e"}],"sha":"a5296e5dabc5df7518ad089b621c6db0974525a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/a5296e5dabc5df7518ad089b621c6db0974525a7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/658f1eb3657252ca2d01b50dc5d26d3ec41f245e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:14:44Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:14:44Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(login): canal blindado v8, el navegador ya no envia ninguna credencial\n\nEl eco desde el navegador afectado probo que el DLP del antivirus se come\nlas cabeceras apikey y authorization, scrubbea la apikey dentro de la URL\n(401 Invalid API key con clave correcta) y su parche de fetch y Headers\nrevienta solo al tocar claves tipo credencial (x-prueba llego intacta).\n\nNuevo canal: el proxy api-supa inyecta la apikey del lado del servidor y\nconvierte la cabecera camuflada x-sesion en Authorization real; el cliente\napunta a ese proxy, retira toda credencial de cabeceras y URL, y blinda\nHeaders.prototype en caliente tragando los fallos del parche (la cabecera\nque no se pudo poner ya no hace falta). El eco ahora tambien reporta si la\napikey sobrevive dentro de la URL.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"105e7a9084c3ac25101bd2b363434fa27021534f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/105e7a9084c3ac25101bd2b363434fa27021534f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/658f1eb3657252ca2d01b50dc5d26d3ec41f245e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/658f1eb3657252ca2d01b50dc5d26d3ec41f245e","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDY1OGYxZWIzNjU3MjUyY2EyZDAxYjUwZGM1ZDI2ZDNlYzQxZjI0NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/31e5cab3418083e1e94a9c0acd33cd387b784e68","sha":"31e5cab3418083e1e94a9c0acd33cd387b784e68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/31e5cab3418083e1e94a9c0acd33cd387b784e68"}],"sha":"658f1eb3657252ca2d01b50dc5d26d3ec41f245e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/658f1eb3657252ca2d01b50dc5d26d3ec41f245e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/31e5cab3418083e1e94a9c0acd33cd387b784e68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:00:46Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:00:46Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(login): reparar Headers parcheadas, credenciales solo por URL y espejo eco\n\nDiagnostico real capturado en el navegador afectado: (1) auth 401 Invalid\nAPI key pese a clave correcta, porque el gateway prefiere la cabecera apikey\n(corrupta en transito) sobre el parametro de URL; (2) las RPC ni salen:\nel interceptor parchea la clase Headers del realm principal y set() revienta\ncon non ISO-8859-1 dentro de supabase-js, antes de nuestro fetch.\n\nArreglos: se restauran los metodos nativos de Headers desde el realm de un\niframe limpio; la apikey y el Authorization anonimo ya no viajan como\ncabecera en ningun canal, solo por URL (verificado con curl contra auth y\nrest); y el nuevo endpoint eco devuelve las cabeceras tal como llegan al\nservidor para ver que altera el interceptor. Ademas: ojito para mostrar u\nocultar la clave en el formulario.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"415ad4449dc9d7ca15d5692ae4a2d5de062dba60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/415ad4449dc9d7ca15d5692ae4a2d5de062dba60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/31e5cab3418083e1e94a9c0acd33cd387b784e68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/31e5cab3418083e1e94a9c0acd33cd387b784e68","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDMxZTVjYWIzNDE4MDgzZTFlOTRhOWMwYWNkMzNjZDM4N2I3ODRlNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/53d11d9b08b18317b24d3fc3b8f17457cf01c097","sha":"53d11d9b08b18317b24d3fc3b8f17457cf01c097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/53d11d9b08b18317b24d3fc3b8f17457cf01c097"}],"sha":"31e5cab3418083e1e94a9c0acd33cd387b784e68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/31e5cab3418083e1e94a9c0acd33cd387b784e68"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/53d11d9b08b18317b24d3fc3b8f17457cf01c097/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T13:42:03Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T13:42:03Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(shell): Accesos y Roles primero en el menu lateral\n\nOrden pedido por Diego: Accesos (superadmin), luego RRHH, luego\nAdministracion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1affcb86de39a82af41bb382a6e90d8a0c846581","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/1affcb86de39a82af41bb382a6e90d8a0c846581"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/53d11d9b08b18317b24d3fc3b8f17457cf01c097","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/53d11d9b08b18317b24d3fc3b8f17457cf01c097","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDUzZDExZDliMDhiMTgzMTdiMjRkM2ZjM2I4ZjE3NDU3Y2YwMWMwOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/64f11260b5b413b6d5ba15b8f50904f033f2cccf","sha":"64f11260b5b413b6d5ba15b8f50904f033f2cccf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/64f11260b5b413b6d5ba15b8f50904f033f2cccf"}],"sha":"53d11d9b08b18317b24d3fc3b8f17457cf01c097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/53d11d9b08b18317b24d3fc3b8f17457cf01c097"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/64f11260b5b413b6d5ba15b8f50904f033f2cccf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T13:31:38Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T13:31:38Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(login): apikey siempre por URL y detalle tecnico de errores en modo prueba\n\nEvidencia: credenciales validas por curl, pero el intento desde el navegador\nno dejo fila en ACC-06, o sea las RPC tambien fallan. Hipotesis: el\ninterceptor elimina la cabecera apikey y el 401 del gateway se confundia con\ncredenciales incorrectas. Ahora la clave viaja tambien como parametro de URL\nen todos los canales, y con ?probar=1 cada fallo muestra el status real de\nauth, registro y bloqueo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93e35eb6322107db51fca9f73009f001a2d87c6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/93e35eb6322107db51fca9f73009f001a2d87c6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/64f11260b5b413b6d5ba15b8f50904f033f2cccf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/64f11260b5b413b6d5ba15b8f50904f033f2cccf","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDY0ZjExMjYwYjViNDEzYjZkNWJhMTViOGY1MDkwNGYwMzNmMmNjY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/c4535849cf7a16f88d940899e3703f5e8533de1e","sha":"c4535849cf7a16f88d940899e3703f5e8533de1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/c4535849cf7a16f88d940899e3703f5e8533de1e"}],"sha":"64f11260b5b413b6d5ba15b8f50904f033f2cccf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/64f11260b5b413b6d5ba15b8f50904f033f2cccf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/c4535849cf7a16f88d940899e3703f5e8533de1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T13:22:21Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T13:22:21Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(login): puerta ?probar=1 para diagnosticar el login real con MODO DEMO activo\n\nCon demo activo /admin/login redirigia a / y era imposible capturar el\ndiagnostico v7. Ademas, en demo un login exitoso no redirige (listener\napagado), asi que ahora muestra confirmacion visible.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b7269afa88d9f1fabc6e8f50c1070f7ffefc9797","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/b7269afa88d9f1fabc6e8f50c1070f7ffefc9797"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/c4535849cf7a16f88d940899e3703f5e8533de1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/c4535849cf7a16f88d940899e3703f5e8533de1e","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGM0NTM1ODQ5Y2Y3YTE2Zjg4ZDk0MDg5OWUzNzAzZjVlODUzM2RlMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/9fe50593d9fd5649a7c17530d0fc9f8a63739f6d","sha":"9fe50593d9fd5649a7c17530d0fc9f8a63739f6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/9fe50593d9fd5649a7c17530d0fc9f8a63739f6d"}],"sha":"c4535849cf7a16f88d940899e3703f5e8533de1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/c4535849cf7a16f88d940899e3703f5e8533de1e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/9fe50593d9fd5649a7c17530d0fc9f8a63739f6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T22:02:37Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T22:02:37Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"feat(app): MODO DEMO temporal sin login mientras se resuelve el interceptor del navegador\n\nToda la maquinaria de autenticacion queda intacta; reactivar poniendo\nMODO_DEMO = false en src/state.jsx.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c4729bea5a7148fdcd53a36c32806ff5745c6ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/6c4729bea5a7148fdcd53a36c32806ff5745c6ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/9fe50593d9fd5649a7c17530d0fc9f8a63739f6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/9fe50593d9fd5649a7c17530d0fc9f8a63739f6d","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDlmZTUwNTkzZDlmZDU2NDlhN2MxNzUzMGQwZmM5ZjhhNjM3MzlmNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/365f4000b575c0aaa4a9f201110afeff9f009c07","sha":"365f4000b575c0aaa4a9f201110afeff9f009c07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/365f4000b575c0aaa4a9f201110afeff9f009c07"}],"sha":"9fe50593d9fd5649a7c17530d0fc9f8a63739f6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/9fe50593d9fd5649a7c17530d0fc9f8a63739f6d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/365f4000b575c0aaa4a9f201110afeff9f009c07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T21:57:00Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T21:57:00Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(login): conmutacion a XHR por mensaje de error cross-realm y apikey por URL\n\nEl instanceof TypeError fallaba con errores de otro realm (interceptor en\ncontent script/iframe), asi que la autorreparacion nunca se activaba. La\nclave API viaja tambien como parametro de URL para sobrevivir a interceptores\nque eliminan cabeceras.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9cd917ff766670b850c4036abf699680aef6b5c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/9cd917ff766670b850c4036abf699680aef6b5c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/365f4000b575c0aaa4a9f201110afeff9f009c07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/365f4000b575c0aaa4a9f201110afeff9f009c07","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKDM2NWY0MDAwYjU3NWMwYWFhNGE5ZjIwMTExMGFmZWZmOWYwMDljMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/dd10e0faa7d8a77f1e6b160f51afd45a53989520","sha":"dd10e0faa7d8a77f1e6b160f51afd45a53989520","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/dd10e0faa7d8a77f1e6b160f51afd45a53989520"}],"sha":"365f4000b575c0aaa4a9f201110afeff9f009c07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/365f4000b575c0aaa4a9f201110afeff9f009c07"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/dd10e0faa7d8a77f1e6b160f51afd45a53989520/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T21:51:59Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T21:51:59Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(login): autorreparacion del canal de red (fetch -> XHR) y diagnostico de transportes\n\nSi un interceptor corrompe las cabeceras de fetch (incluso dentro de iframes),\nel cliente conmuta automaticamente a XMLHttpRequest. El mensaje de error del\nlogin ahora reporta la version y el estado de los tres canales.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc15b4a90368222322dc32edb68835ab89c7b6d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/trees/dc15b4a90368222322dc32edb68835ab89c7b6d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/git/commits/dd10e0faa7d8a77f1e6b160f51afd45a53989520","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/dd10e0faa7d8a77f1e6b160f51afd45a53989520","node_id":"C_kwDOTwCywtoAKGRkMTBlMGZhYTdkOGE3N2YxZTZiMTYwZjUxYWZkNDVhNTM5ODk1MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commit/fbc22123bfcf9bcfc7a6401dc7e44da62d6478e4","sha":"fbc22123bfcf9bcfc7a6401dc7e44da62d6478e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/fbc22123bfcf9bcfc7a6401dc7e44da62d6478e4"}],"sha":"dd10e0faa7d8a77f1e6b160f51afd45a53989520","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/dd10e0faa7d8a77f1e6b160f51afd45a53989520"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosalguerotang/Intranet/commits/fbc22123bfcf9bcfc7a6401dc7e44da62d6478e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T21:47:42Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T21:47:42Z","email":"diego.salguero@redpontis.com","name":"Diego Salguero"},"message":"fix(login): fetch nativo via iframe para evadir parches de antivirus que corrompen cabeceras\n\nUn