,"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:50:53Z","email":"5564400+willysvarela@users.noreply.github.com","name":"willysvarela"},"message":"Initial commit: SSR Micro Frontend Shell with dual-era Module Federation\n\nAn Rsbuild/Rspack + Hono SSR host that orchestrates Module Federation\nremotes across eras and rendering models:\n\n- Section A — legacy Webpack 5 (MFv1) remote, client-only\n- Section B — modern Rsbuild (MFv2) remote, client-only\n- Section C — real external MFv1 footer remote (client-only)\n- Section D — true SSR+CSR federated remote (server-rendered and hydrated)\n\nHighlights:\n- Per-environment MF wiring (moduleFederationConfigFor) resolves the SSR\n  remote from /client vs /server manifests for web vs node builds.\n- React externalized on both node/SSR builds so host react-dom/server and\n  the federated remote share a single React instance (fixes duplicate-React\n  crash in the dev vm sandbox).\n- Graceful degradation: any offline remote renders a fallback, never crashes.\n- One-command dev runner (scripts/dev-all.mjs) for all remotes + shell.\n- Mock remotes under packages/ (legacy-mfe, modern-mfe, ssr-mfe).\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c630236fce2bae2ba74f484c986ed9ebb5ef16c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willysvarela/shell-microfrontend-experiment/git/trees/0c630236fce2bae2ba74f484c986ed9ebb5ef16c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willysvarela/shell-microfrontend-experiment/git/commits/2850317c1c904c2224885d05dcae826d0c64cce3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5564400?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willysvarela/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willysvarela/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willysvarela/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.