","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/684355dc21c1c2de9d0c7eeaf78fc86d67970188/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T02:18:00Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T02:18:00Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"message":"say what is true now that a reply can actually leave the building\n\nAdding the handoff made three things stale. The production list still described the send button as\nthe missing piece when it now exists, the automations section still said nothing is sent when a\nstaff member can now send from the dashboard, and the note component was called SimulatedNote while\nbeing used for a note about something that is not simulated at all.\n\nThe distinction worth keeping precise: no automation sends anything, and that has not changed. The\none place a real message can leave is a person pressing send in their own mail app.","tree":{"sha":"6e9a61719fa368ee59097b04cd08ef7cb4fe17b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/trees/6e9a61719fa368ee59097b04cd08ef7cb4fe17b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/co