red_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/130d659731c9b1c8adadb3ea55c39311e2378db2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T07:21:17Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T07:21:17Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"message":"acknowledge the guest the way they asked to be reached\n\nThe form collects a preferred contact method and then nothing downstream used it, so a guest who\nasked to be texted was recorded as getting an email. The brief asks for a confirmation email or\ntext; this is the text half.\n\nRenamed the step from confirmation_email, since it is no longer only email.","tree":{"sha":"d9aa0ae29829168a75421ae5f8ae9207fbd6f133","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/trees/d9aa0ae29829168a75421ae5f8ae9207fbd6f133"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/commits/130d659731c9b1c8adadb3ea55c39311e2378db2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/130d659731c9b1c8adadb3ea55c39311e2378db2","node_id":"C_kwDOTwfxutoAKDEzMGQ2NTk3MzFjOWIxYzhhZGFkYjNlYTU1YzM5MzExZTIzNzhkYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/d37c1d7dd81209bb79ec1afd308259791768df5d","sha":"d37c1d7dd81209bb79ec1afd308259791768df5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/d37c1d7dd81209bb79ec1afd308259791768df5d"}],"sha":"130d659731c9b1c8adadb3ea55c39311e2378db2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/130d659731c9b1c8adadb3ea55c39311e2378db2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/d37c1d7dd81209bb79ec1afd308259791768df5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:59:12Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:59:12Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"message":"keep the draft and the recorded times in step, and let staff filter for what needs them\n\nRunning the three required scenarios turned up a draft that offered a guest three appointment\ntimes while only two were recorded against the lead. The third was a real time it had been shown,\nso nothing was invented, but the front desk would have been looking at a shorter list than the\nguest was sent, which is how a spa double books itself.\n\nThe same run showed the complaint arriving as general priority, which is right, since it is not a\nbooking lead at all. That means no priority filter will ever surface it, so there is now a filter\nfor the thing the front desk actually looks for.","tree":{"sha":"3be07ff2eb45350652c109fa57b1f258e0d48228","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/trees/3be07ff2eb45350652c109fa57b1f258e0d48228"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/commits/d37c1d7dd81209bb79ec1afd308259791768df5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://a