":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/d714a85a841108214c5521ab4ac763918ba6fb18","node_id":"C_kwDOTwfxutoAKGQ3MTRhODVhODQxMTA4MjE0YzU1MjFhYjRhYzc2MzkxOGJhNmZiMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/6864ce63cf066d6cfbc4967329ae16cb730e8d31","sha":"6864ce63cf066d6cfbc4967329ae16cb730e8d31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/6864ce63cf066d6cfbc4967329ae16cb730e8d31"}],"sha":"d714a85a841108214c5521ab4ac763918ba6fb18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/d714a85a841108214c5521ab4ac763918ba6fb18"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/6864ce63cf066d6cfbc4967329ae16cb730e8d31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:27:27Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:27:27Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"message":"staff dashboard: lead list, filters, detail with the automation log, status changes\n\nThe list left joins the reading rather than requiring it, because an enquiry that arrived a\nmoment ago has not been read yet and still has to appear. It says \"being read\" instead of showing\na blank row, which would look like a lost lead.\n\nFilters and search are links and a plain form, so the state lives in the URL and a filtered view\ncan be sent to someone. The draft is editable before it goes anywhere, and every screen that could\nbe mistaken for proof that something was sent says plainly that nothing was.\n\nThe admin gate is a shared token in a cookie. It is not real authentication, it cannot tell you\nwho changed a lead, and the README says so. It refuses everyone when ADMIN_TOKEN is unset, since\nthe alternative is staff screens open to anyone who finds the URL.","tree":{"sha":"85323cc24589392f362773498fb482f49f1c3fae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/trees/85323cc24589392f362773498fb482f49f1c3fae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/commits/6864ce63cf066d6cfbc4967329ae16cb730e8d31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/6864ce63cf066d6cfbc4967329ae16cb730e8d31","node_id":"C_kwDOTwfxutoAKDY4NjRjZTYzY2YwNjZkNmNmYmM0OTY3MzI5YWUxNmNiNzMwZThkMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/7d5bab0311615d548ee199ad8a3fe65643cd0af4","sha":"7d5bab0311615d548ee199ad8a3fe65643cd0af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/7d5bab0311615d548ee199ad8a3fe65643cd0af4"}],"sha":"6864ce63cf066d6cfbc4967329ae16cb730e8d31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/6864ce63cf066d6cfbc4967329ae16cb730e8d31"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/7d5bab0311615d548ee199ad8a3fe65643cd0af4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:17:33Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:17:33Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"message":"offer real appointment times, from a stand-in calendar the assistant cannot argue with\n\nThe brief asks for a booking concierge and invites simulated availability, but until now every\nenquiry ended at \"the front desk will confirm a time\", which is triage rather than booking.\n\nTimes are generated deterministically so a demonstration looks the same twice, and the offered\nones become the only values the schema will accept, so a time the spa cannot honour is refused\nrather than caught afterwards. Slots are offered before anyone has chosen a treatment, so the\nlength is rounded up to the longest candidate and a slot that fits a half day therefore fits a\nfacial. The guard still checks the fit, drops anything that was never offered, and withholds times\naltogether from a guest who is writing in to complain.","tree":{"sha":"076fb362a93883f7999dedf73cf822833a7f1991","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/trees/076fb362a93883f7999dedf73cf822833a7f1991"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/commits/7d5bab0311615d548ee199ad8a3fe65643cd0af4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/7d5bab0311615d548ee199ad8a3fe65643cd0af4","node_id":"C_kwDOTwfxutoAKDdkNWJhYjAzMTE2MTVkNTQ4ZWUxOTlhZDhhM2ZlNjU2NDNjZDBhZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/c371b778774d683c6bd89ce584e5555746ce02b6","sha":"c371b778774d683c6bd89ce584e5555746ce02b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/c371b778774d683c6bd89ce584e5555746ce02b6"}],"sha":"7d5bab0311615d548ee199ad8a3fe65643cd0af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/7d5bab0311615d548ee199ad8a3fe65643cd0af4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/c371b778774d683c6bd89ce584e5555746ce02b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:05:34Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:05:34Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"message":"four automation steps, each recording pass, fail or skip against the lead\n\nA step that decides not to act writes a skipped row with its reason instead of writing nothing,\nso \"the automation never ran\" and \"it ran and decided this guest should not be emailed\" are\ndistinguishable when someone comes to check. The classification is recorded the same way, which\nis how a failed reading becomes visible rather than just quiet.\n\nEvery step is simulated and the text it writes says so, since the brief rules out touching\nMajesty''s real systems. A complaint suppresses the automatic acknowledgement so a manager makes\nfirst contact.","tree":{"sha":"d5a3c6f62d6182c8a78e901db0230cbeafce47c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/trees/d5a3c6f62d6182c8a78e901db0230cbeafce47c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/commits/c371b778774d683c6bd89ce584e5555746ce02b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/c371b778774d683c6bd89ce584e5555746ce02b6","node_id":"C_kwDOTwfxutoAKGMzNzFiNzc4Nzc0ZDY4M2M2YmQ4OWNlNTg0ZTU1NTU3NDZjZTAyYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/c92b7cccd4a298202e3ad37e3888600c2b43e8ec","sha":"c92b7cccd4a298202e3ad37e3888600c2b43e8ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/c92b7cccd4a298202e3ad37e3888600c2b43e8ec"}],"sha":"c371b778774d683c6bd89ce584e5555746ce02b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/c371b778774d683c6bd89ce584e5555746ce02b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/c92b7cccd4a298202e3ad37e3888600c2b43e8ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:00:04Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T21:00:04Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"message":"submit endpoint: persist first, then classify, so an API outage can''t lose a lead\n\nThe enquiry is written to the database and acknowledged before anything calls out to a third\nparty. Reading it takes the model a few seconds, which happens after the response has already\ngone back, so nobody sits watching a spinner while we do it. Verified with a deliberately broken\nkey: the guest still gets their confirmation and the enquiry lands flagged for a person, with a\nholding reply someone can send as it stands.\n\nAlso turn off the assistant rule files Next writes into the project root on every dev\nstart, and pin the build root to this directory instead of the nearest lockfile above it.","tree":{"sha":"7f0404f1d186c0ac7716febabf4615e319ab8cdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/trees/7f0404f1d186c0ac7716febabf4615e319ab8cdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/commits/c92b7cccd4a298202e3ad37e3888600c2b43e8ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/c92b7cccd4a298202e3ad37e3888600c2b43e8ec","node_id":"C_kwDOTwfxutoAKGM5MmI3Y2NjZDRhMjk4MjAyZTNhZDM3ZTM4ODg2MDBjMmI0M2U4ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/2db6ce92e51722e0d6fb947562199dac89aefcc6","sha":"2db6ce92e51722e0d6fb947562199dac89aefcc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/2db6ce92e51722e0d6fb947562199dac89aefcc6"}],"sha":"c92b7cccd4a298202e3ad37e3888600c2b43e8ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/c92b7cccd4a298202e3ad37e3888600c2b43e8ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/2db6ce92e51722e0d6fb947562199dac89aefcc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:50:16Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:50:16Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"message":"classify enquiries against the catalog, with the guard deciding what gets flagged\n\nThe model fills a schema constrained to the catalog ids, so it cannot name a treatment the spa\ndoes not offer. Prices and availability stay out of the prompt because there is no source for\neither.\n\nAn earlier version of the prompt told it to flag anything it could not fully answer, which meant\nevery booking got flagged, since no booking can be confirmed without the calendar. Flagging is now\nabout risk, not about who confirms the time.\n\nAlso match how guests actually describe a bad reaction. Nobody writes \"adverse reaction\", they\nwrite that their skin is red and irritated.","tree":{"sha":"9063beeff918174c3756c294e52a79816bd59986","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/trees/9063beeff918174c3756c294e52a79816bd59986"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/commits/2db6ce92e51722e0d6fb947562199dac89aefcc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/2db6ce92e51722e0d6fb947562199dac89aefcc6","node_id":"C_kwDOTwfxutoAKDJkYjZjZTkyZTUxNzIyZTBkNmZiOTQ3NTYyMTk5ZGFjODlhZWZjYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/07dc38790ef8e5d91b3bc14ffae4fecf5b219ad7","sha":"07dc38790ef8e5d91b3bc14ffae4fecf5b219ad7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/07dc38790ef8e5d91b3bc14ffae4fecf5b219ad7"}],"sha":"2db6ce92e51722e0d6fb947562199dac89aefcc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/2db6ce92e51722e0d6fb947562199dac89aefcc6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/07dc38790ef8e5d91b3bc14ffae4fecf5b219ad7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:33:59Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:33:59Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"message":"use the standard pg driver so local and hosted postgres are the same code\n\nWas on the Neon HTTP client, which only talks to Neon. Standard pg means\ndevelopment runs against a local Postgres and production against a managed\none with nothing changing but the connection string. SSL is off for\nlocalhost and on everywhere else.\n\ndrizzle.config now loads .env.local itself, so db:push does not need the\nconnection string echoed on the command line.","tree":{"sha":"8e81bd6c9c0a4daa9c7178c2f4a518113edc64d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/trees/8e81bd6c9c0a4daa9c7178c2f4a518113edc64d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/commits/07dc38790ef8e5d91b3bc14ffae4fecf5b219ad7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url"