03220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/7a7dc0957b51c811c096ba84cb6eb62d71f42f7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:27:28Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:27:28Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"message":"inquiry form, all ten fields, mobile first\n\nForest palette rather than the warm cream and brass that every spa site\nreaches for. Labels sit above inputs and there are no placeholder-as-label\ntricks, so the form still reads once a field is filled.\n\nValidation schema is shared between the form and the route handler so the\ntwo cannot drift. On a failed submit the first bad field is scrolled into\nview instead of leaving the guest to hunt for it.","tree":{"sha":"66ef116e136fda9d0d62c9e32f97bdcb80918cbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/trees/66ef116e136fda9d0d62c9e32f97bdcb80918cbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/commits/7a7dc0957b51c811c096ba84cb6eb62d71f42f7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/7a7dc0957b51c811c096ba84cb6eb62d71f42f7b","node_id":"C_kwDOTwfxutoAKDdhN2RjMDk1N2I1MWM4MTFjMDk2YmE4NGNiNmViNjJkNzFmNDJmN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commit/793b82672f3663bfc39d6366ded813f3caadf51e","sha":"793b82672f3663bfc39d6366ded813f3caadf51e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/793b82672f3663bfc39d6366ded813f3caadf51e"}],"sha":"7a7dc0957b51c811c096ba84cb6eb62d71f42f7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/7a7dc0957b51c811c096ba84cb6eb62d71f42f7b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267403220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cordovarossmarco-rai","id":267403220,"login":"cordovarossmarco-rai","node_id":"U_kgDOD_A_1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cordovarossmarco-rai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/commits/793b82672f3663bfc39d6366ded813f3caadf51e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:22:49Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:22:49Z","email":"cordovarossmarco@gmail.com","name":"cordovarossmarco-rai"},"message":"pin service recommendations to a catalog and let triage escalate over the model\n\nThe brief is explicit that the assistant must not invent services, prices,\npolicies or availability. So the catalog is the only place service facts\nexist, prices and availability are deliberately not in it, and anything the\nmodel names that is not on the list gets dropped rather than passed on.\n\nEscalation runs before the model and is one way. Triage can force a lead to\na person, but nothing can un-escalate one, so a complaint never depends on\nthe model classifying it correctly.","tree":{"sha":"d86b4afa02e676c83e509ce4269b1077b85d19e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/trees/d86b4afa02e676c83e509ce4269b1077b85d19e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cordovarossmarco-rai/majesty-concierge/git/commits/793b82672f3663bfc39d6366ded813f3caa