's part 2 in the deferred register.","tree":{"sha":"1a6a67b6d89b5043b9ac5631b4113ee9573c832d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/1a6a67b6d89b5043b9ac5631b4113ee9573c832d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/6a7a5309f91337298447196e0f824afa1c8043ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/6a7a5309f91337298447196e0f824afa1c8043ca","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDZhN2E1MzA5ZjkxMzM3Mjk4NDQ3MTk2ZTBmODI0YWZhMWM4MDQzY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/bb3e9d66157705c82e8b1aa269504e1a321eb98c","sha":"bb3e9d66157705c82e8b1aa269504e1a321eb98c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/bb3e9d66157705c82e8b1aa269504e1a321eb98c"}],"sha":"6a7a5309f91337298447196e0f824afa1c8043ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/6a7a5309f91337298447196e0f824afa1c8043ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/bb3e9d66157705c82e8b1aa269504e1a321eb98c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T00:40:15Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T00:40:15Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Deploy Plexus to Railway (production)\n\nSix services: managed Postgres, NATS JetStream (Docker image + volume), a\nRailway Bucket for object storage, orchestrator (NestJS), worker + a new\nrenderserver Dockerfile (Go), and web (Next.js). Resolves D-16/D-41/D-42 in\nthe deferred register; adds D-54 for the deploy''s deliberately minimal auth/\nCORS posture.\n\nAlong the way, fixed three pre-existing bugs the deploy exposed for the\nfirst time: orchestrator''s start:prod pointed at the wrong dist path,\napps/web''s quick-actions and batch pages called useSearchParams() without a\nSuspense boundary (blocking next build), and the S3-compatible upload/\nstorage clients needed a path-style vs virtual-host toggle (MINIO_PATH_STYLE)\nsince Railway''s Bucket only supports virtual-host addressing.","tree":{"sha":"60e5e796f696c53f3180b0b6310af90c7b97802a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/60e5e796f696c53f3180b0b6310af90c7b97802a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/bb3e9d66157705c82e8b1aa269504e1a321eb98c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/bb3e9d66157705c82e8b1aa269504e1a321eb98c","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKGJiM2U5ZDY2MTU3NzA1YzgyZThiMWFhMjY5NTA0ZTFhMzIxZWI5OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/53fa5a7b1b5258b132b1d24658d7efa6b73926f9","sha":"53fa5a7b1b5258b132b1d24658d7efa6b73926f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/53fa5a7b1b5258b132b1d24658d7efa6b73926f9"}],"sha":"bb3e9d66157705c82e8b1aa269504e1a321eb98c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/bb3e9d66157705c82e8b1aa269504e1a321eb98c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/53fa5a7b1b5258b132b1d24658d7efa6b73926f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T23:55:26Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T23:55:26Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Fix single-threaded VP9 encode in video.transcode/video.compress\n\nlibvpx-vp9 was never given -row-mt/-tile-columns/-threads, so it ran\neffectively single-threaded regardless of host core count. Measured\n5m12s-5m52s for a 24s ~4K screen recording; fixed settings cut that to\n3m45s with zero quality/size cost (row-mt+tile-columns are threading-only\nlevers). See docs/tasks/TASK-vp9-encode-threading.md for the benchmark\nand the rejected -cpu-used alternative (real quality/size trade, deferred\nas D-53).","tree":{"sha":"189505c6c02bf8eee485a5ed21f2ffd31af610dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/189505c6c02bf8eee485a5ed21f2ffd31af610dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/53fa5a7b1b5258b132b1d24658d7efa6b73926f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/53fa5a7b1b5258b132b1d24658d7efa6b73926f9","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDUzZmE1YTdiMWI1MjU4YjEzMmIxZDI0NjU4ZDdlZmE2YjczOTI2Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/6570da5b0b900c1aab731afea6d3c7366b4687e4","sha":"6570da5b0b900c1aab731afea6d3c7366b4687e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/6570da5b0b900c1aab731afea6d3c7366b4687e4"}],"sha":"53fa5a7b1b5258b132b1d24658d7efa6b73926f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/53fa5a7b1b5258b132b1d24658d7efa6b73926f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/6570da5b0b900c1aab731afea6d3c7366b4687e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T23:19:11Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T23:19:11Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Make navigation action-first: catalog before file, Jobs everywhere\n\nHome now offers Photo/Video/Audio kind cards that lead to that kind''s\naction catalog on /quick-actions before any file is required, instead of\nasking for a file first (or, for photos, jumping straight into the full\neditor with no lighter-weight convert/compress option visible at all).\nImages gain Convert/Compress presets alongside Edit, reusing the already-\nworking image.convert/image.compress processors. A shared AppHeader adds\nthe Jobs link to /editor, /quick-actions/[jobId], and /batch/[pipelineId],\nwhich previously had no way back to the jobs list at all.\n\nSee docs/tasks/TASK-action-first-navigation.md.","tree":{"sha":"ebbed980839fc9595d0542dd48d6be7ee803521c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/ebbed980839fc9595d0542dd48d6be7ee803521c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/6570da5b0b900c1aab731afea6d3c7366b4687e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/6570da5b0b900c1aab731afea6d3c7366b4687e4","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDY1NzBkYTViMGI5MDBjMWFhYjczMWFmZWE2ZDNjNzM2NmI0Njg3ZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/3572b65325db09720cd20756ec70ab8e4cd97926","sha":"3572b65325db09720cd20756ec70ab8e4cd97926","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/3572b65325db09720cd20756ec70ab8e4cd97926"}],"sha":"6570da5b0b900c1aab731afea6d3c7366b4687e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/6570da5b0b900c1aab731afea6d3c7366b4687e4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/3572b65325db09720cd20756ec70ab8e4cd97926/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T23:00:21Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T23:00:36Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Add client-side jobs list page for quick-actions\n\nAdd a client-side, per-browser jobs list so a user running multiple\nquick actions can find a job they''ve navigated away from. No auth\nexists yet, so a server-side global list would either leak jobs\nacross browsers or require inventing a session concept just to gate\na list view -- localStorage-backed tracking is the right shape for\nwhere the system is today. Batch-flow jobs aren''t fed into the same\nlist yet (logged as D-50); that flow already has its own multi-job\nprogress view.","tree":{"sha":"dc18d12b584f2f4e1eedb67f698177aaa54f5f63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/dc18d12b584f2f4e1eedb67f698177aaa54f5f63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/3572b65325db09720cd20756ec70ab8e4cd97926","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/3572b65325db09720cd20756ec70ab8e4cd97926","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDM1NzJiNjUzMjVkYjA5NzIwY2QyMDc1NmVjNzBhYjhlNGNkOTc5MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/acdffacf037be523836fc1b5582b4b41a19e0e87","sha":"acdffacf037be523836fc1b5582b4b41a19e0e87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/acdffacf037be523836fc1b5582b4b41a19e0e87"}],"sha":"3572b65325db09720cd20756ec70ab8e4cd97926","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/3572b65325db09720cd20756ec70ab8e4cd97926"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/acdffacf037be523836fc1b5582b4b41a19e0e87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T22:59:41Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T22:59:41Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Heartbeat long-running steps to stop duplicate concurrent processing\n\nThe worker-dispatch consumer''s AckWait defaulted to JetStream''s 30s\nserver default, and Handle() never called msg.InProgress(). Any step\nwhose ffmpeg/libvips work legitimately exceeded 30s got redelivered\nmid-flight, spawning a duplicate concurrent encode of the same step\nthat competed with the original for CPU -- the real cause of a\nreported 7-minute transcode. Handle() now heartbeats via InProgress()\nevery 10s for the duration of runStep(), and the consumer''s AckWait is\nraised to 2 minutes as defense-in-depth; MaxDeliver stays unlimited so\na genuinely dead worker''s job still gets picked up elsewhere.","tree":{"sha":"d1a0cf32a64cc6a7d006dfce9c387483b8b397ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/d1a0cf32a64cc6a7d006dfce9c387483b8b397ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/acdffacf037be523836fc1b5582b4b41a19e0e87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/acdffacf037be523836fc1b5582b4b41a19e0e87","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKGFjZGZmYWNmMDM3YmU1MjM4MzZmYzFiNTU4MmI0YjQxYTE5ZTBlODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/dadaa76f5bb46e6e1505cddb6448aabc722d45ef","sha":"dadaa76f5bb46e6e1505cddb6448aabc722d45ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/dadaa76f5bb46e6e1505cddb6448aabc722d45ef"}],"sha":"acdffacf037be523836fc1b5582b4b41a19e0e87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/acdffacf037be523836fc1b5582b4b41a19e0e87"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/dadaa76f5bb46e6e1505cddb6448aabc722d45ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T22:59:07Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T22:59:07Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Include outputRef on step-completion SSE events\n\nThe step-scope progress event dropped outputRef even though\nhandleStepResult already had it from the transition result, so the\nfrontend never saw it until a page reload re-fetched a fresh snapshot.\nDownload links stayed unavailable right after a job completed over the\nlive stream.","tree":{"sha":"c8fb48190a418bfc082a519886884d388518e616","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/c8fb48190a418bfc082a519886884d38