followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/164921e5c0e781c09597b00f17b2d6b9ffe30d7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T22:45:39Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T22:45:39Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Translate ffmpeg''s no-audio-stream error into a clear message\n\naudio.extract/audio.convert force -map 0:a:0 to select the first audio\nstream; when the input has no audio at all, ffmpeg rejects the map\nbefore opening the input and returns \"Stream map '''' matches no\nstreams\" — accurate but opaque to anything downstream of runFFmpeg.\n\nDetect that specific stderr and translate it into \"input has no audio\nstream to extract/convert\", still wrapping the raw ffmpeg error for\ndebugging. Adds a committed video-only fixture (tiny-noaudio.mp4) and\nfixes an existing test that claimed to cover this case but actually\nonly exercised a nonexistent-file input.","tree":{"sha":"00e1fc82f10ae9d83dc8e1d59e19d5545d6b8120","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/00e1fc82f10ae9d83dc8e1d59e19d5545d6b8120"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/164921e5c0e781c09597b00f17b2d6b9ffe30d7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/164921e5c0e781c09597b00f17b2d6b9ffe30d7d","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDE2NDkyMWU1YzBlNzgxYzA5NTk3YjAwZjE3YjJkNmI5ZmZlMzBkN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/737b5f37662759557ebe6d2df4556269ece8263c","sha":"737b5f37662759557ebe6d2df4556269ece8263c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/737b5f37662759557ebe6d2df4556269ece8263c"}],"sha":"164921e5c0e781c09597b00f17b2d6b9ffe30d7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/164921e5c0e781c09597b00f17b2d6b9ffe30d7d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/737b5f37662759557ebe6d2df4556269ece8263c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T22:36:15Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T22:36:15Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Add httpyac userflow test suite for orchestrator''s HTTP API\n\nDeclarative, git-committed companion to the Jest/testcontainer suite: one\n.http file per userflow (pipeline lifecycle, upload presign, single-job SSE\nflow, batch flow, DAG fan-out, fan-in rejection, editor export), run via\n`pnpm --filter orchestrator test:http`. Chosen over Bruno/Postman/Newman\nbecause httpyac has documented native SSE support, which nearly every real\nuserflow here ends on.\n\nVerified live against a running dev stack (orchestrator + Go worker + MinIO,\nplus a manually started renderserver for the export flow): all 7 files pass,\n0 failures. That pass caught and fixed several real, undocumented-until-tested\nhttpyac behaviors — see the \"Verification\" and design-note sections of\ndocs/tasks/TASK-orchestrator-http-userflow-tests.md for specifics (assertion\nquoting/operator rules, SSE reconnect flakiness worked around via @disabled +\n@sleep, a gitignored .env that would never have been committed).","tree":{"sha":"ba62cbba5ebbb80f083fbf0851a33db14ddbcf34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/ba62cbba5ebbb80f083fbf0851a33db14ddbcf34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/737b5f37662759557ebe6d2df4556269ece8263c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/737b5f37662759557ebe6d2df4556269ece8263c","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDczN2I1ZjM3NjYyNzU5NTU3ZWJlNmQyZGY0NTU2MjY5ZWNlODI2M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/3a4f040971ae1445c1eeb1a9d58bd8d28b97461b","sha":"3a4f040971ae1445c1eeb1a9d58bd8d28b97461b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/3a4f040971ae1445c1eeb1a9d58bd8d28b97461b"}],"sha":"737b5f37662759557ebe6d2df4556269ece8263c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/737b5f37662759557ebe6d2df4556269ece8263c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/3a4f040971ae1445c1eeb1a9d58bd8d28b97461b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T22:05:18Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T22:05:18Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Fix job_steps.depends_on migration failing on existing rows\n\nADD COLUMN ... NOT NULL with no default can''t backfill rows that\npredate the DAG feature, so the orchestrator crashed on every boot.\nGive dependsOn a default of [] (schema-correct: empty means \"ready\nimmediately\", same as the two pre-DAG rows) and regenerate migration\n0002 via drizzle-kit rather than hand-patching the emitted SQL.","tree":{"sha":"2d3b4555f35287f927d62167f2c6bf806f7158cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/2d3b4555f35287f927d62167f2c6bf806f7158cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/3a4f040971ae1445c1eeb1a9d58bd8d28b97461b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/3a4f040971ae1445c1eeb1a9d58bd8d28b97461b","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDNhNGYwNDA5NzFhZTE0NDVjMWVlYjFhOWQ1OGJkOGQyOGI5NzQ2MWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/60f2d2a026e7c9150c7e6422338dea403d1a03e7","sha":"60f2d2a026e7c9150c7e6422338dea403d1a03e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/60f2d2a026e7c9150c7e6422338dea403d1a03e7"}],"sha":"3a4f040971ae1445c1eeb1a9d58bd8d28b97461b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/3a4f040971ae1445c1eeb1a9d58bd8d28b97461b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/60f2d2a026e7c9150c7e6422338dea403d1a03e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T21:56:16Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T21:56:16Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Add home page + video/audio quick-actions screen\n\nGives the app a real front door (drop-zone + shortcut cards, replacing\nthe bare redirect from D-45) and a presets-only path for the four\nvideo/audio processors that were previously only reachable via raw API\ncalls. Extends packages/recipe with video/audio schemas so the\norchestrator''s DTO validates their params for real instead of falling\nback to a plain-object check.\n\nAlso fixes isTerminalJobStatus (apps/web/src/lib/editor/batch-progress.ts)\nto treat PARTIAL as terminal, matching the orchestrator''s own job-status\nmachine -- previously the batch-progress poll loop and the quick-actions\nSSE hook never stopped for a job that settles PARTIAL.","tree":{"sha":"a1da850454e238e64a355f5b02f613ec9e2dd591","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/a1da850454e238e64a355f5b02f613ec9e2dd591"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/60f2d2a026e7c9150c7e6422338dea403d1a03e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/60f2d2a026e7c9150c7e6422338dea403d1a03e7","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDYwZjJkMmEwMjZlN2M5MTUwYzdlNjQyMjMzOGRlYTQwM2QxYTAzZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/5b6d667080952f7eba7eca40abf1e050edf5d09e","sha":"5b6d667080952f7eba7eca40abf1e050edf5d09e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/5b6d667080952f7eba7eca40abf1e050edf5d09e"}],"sha":"60f2d2a026e7c9150c7e6422338dea403d1a03e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/60f2d2a026e7c9150c7e6422338dea403d1a03e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/5b6d667080952f7eba7eca40abf1e050edf5d09e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T19:13:44Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T19:13:44Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Implement branching/parallel DAG pipelines (resolves last open Phase 3 item)\n\nReplaces the linear-only pipeline validator with real DAG resolution\n(dag.validator.ts): fan-out (multiple steps depending on one parent) and\nmultiple independent roots are now legal, while fan-in stays unsupported\nsince no built-in processor accepts more than one input yet (D-47).\n\nJobDispatchService now dispatches every ready step in parallel per call\ninstead of one step at a time, using a conditional UPDATE to avoid\ndouble-dispatch races between concurrent sibling-branch completions. A\nfailed step cascades SKIPPED to its dependents while independent branches\nkeep running; the job settles PARTIAL (first real use of that\nalready-seeded status) when the outcome is mixed, matching prior FAILED/\nCOMPLETE behavior exactly for single-chain pipelines.\n\nAlso fixes a live bug found while tracing the dispatch path: a real\nmulti-step editor recipe (which never sets dependsOn, by design) was\nrejected by the old validator''s MULTIPLE_ROOTS check, breaking Apply to\nBatch for any non-trivial edit. The new whole-pipeline implicit-chain mode\ntreats a fully dependsOn-less definition as a strict linear chain, fixing\nthis with no changes to packages/recipe or the editor''s translation-free\nposting of recipe.steps.\n\nSee docs/tasks/TASK-branching-parallel-dags.md for the full design.","tree":{"sha":"5cef3c74d67358c05bbd832f0d3f47e20a66e1ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/5cef3c74d67358c05bbd832f0d3f47e20a66e1ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/5b6d667080952f7eba7eca40abf1e050edf5d09e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/5b6d667080952f7eba7eca40abf1e050edf5d09e","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDViNmQ2NjcwODA5NTJmN2ViYTdlY2E0MGFiZjFlMDUwZWRmNWQwOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/be88bdac0687169bde47db8664a07f98c8127e63","sha":"be88bdac0687169bde47db8664a07f98c8127e63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/be88bdac0687169bde47db8664a07f98c8127e63"}],"sha":"5b6d667080952f7eba7eca40abf1e050edf5d09e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/5b6d667080952f7eba7eca40abf1e050edf5d09e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/be88bdac0687169bde47db8664a07f98c8127e63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T18:48:47Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T18:48:47Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Implement realtime job progress via SSE (GET /jobs/:id/events)\n\nCloses the last open Phase 3 P0 item (docs/plexus-media-pipeline-spec.md''s\nphasing note): job/step status transitions now publish to a new\nPLEXUS_JOB_EVENTS NATS stream, and apps/web gains a useJobProgress hook to\nconsume it. Revises TASK-realtime-progress-sse.md''s original plan after\nconfirming two real NATS JetStream constraints before implementing (not\nassumed, per CLAUDE.md §2.0): a Workqueue-retention stream only allows\ndisjoint consumer filter subjects (so two SSE connections watching the same\njob would collide on PLEXUS_JOBS_STREAM), and a subject can only belong to\none stream (so events can''t just ride PLEXUS_JOBS_STREAM''s existing\nplexus.jobs.> wildcard either). Progress events instead get their own\nLimits-retention stream on a disjoint plexus.events.jobs.> prefix, with a\nfresh ephemeral consumer per SSE connection.\n\nNot wired into any page yet (apps/web/src/app/batch/[pipelineId] still\npolls) -- tracked as D-46, a deliberate follow-up per the task doc''s own\nscoping.","tree":{"sha":"993e75d0ca1147fd1683d205f3bca1a4a1be63a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/993e75d0ca1147fd1683d205f3bca1a4a1be63a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/be88bdac0687169bde47db8664a07f98c8127e63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/othe