i.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/14af31bc229ca95b9b9fbc671d011173c262dfdb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T16:36:23Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T16:36:23Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Plan Phase 3: object storage, shared recipe package, SSE, apply-to-batch\n\nFour task docs sequencing the \"Real DAGs + realtime + Apply to Batch\"\nphase: object storage/presigned upload (resolves D-3 with a MinIO\ndecision), extracting the recipe schema into packages/recipe so the\norchestrator can actually accept editor recipes (resolves D-1/D-17,\nand fixes a confirmed bug — the orchestrator''s BUILTIN_PROCESSORS list\nis missing every composite/crop processor id), SSE job progress, and\nthe batch-dispatch fusion point itself.","tree":{"sha":"2413913ed5ecaf5594fc9b60340a9f3f2e125ba1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/2413913ed5ecaf5594fc9b60340a9f3f2e125ba1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/14af31bc229ca95b9b9fbc671d011173c262dfdb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"http