pos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/2a19ee15c4eb530bf526b42a1ff6ac031dfb67aa","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDJhMTllZTE1YzRlYjUzMGJmNTI2YjQyYTFmZjZhYzAzMWRmYjY3YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/ab884b0698f46707de8ec088a22220c3a0cb19b4","sha":"ab884b0698f46707de8ec088a22220c3a0cb19b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/ab884b0698f46707de8ec088a22220c3a0cb19b4"}],"sha":"2a19ee15c4eb530bf526b42a1ff6ac031dfb67aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/2a19ee15c4eb530bf526b42a1ff6ac031dfb67aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/ab884b0698f46707de8ec088a22220c3a0cb19b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T16:22:01Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T16:22:01Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Fix preview status badge overlapping bright photo content\n\nA real screenshot from the user showed the WEBGPU badge landing on the\nphoto''s own overexposed sky, illegible there. It was overlapping ~4px\ninto the canvas; moved into the frame''s own padding gutter (always a\npredictable dark background) instead of over the image.\n\nThe same screenshot confirmed the rest of the design plan (bipolar\ncenter-fill, touched/untouched readout coloring, segmented control,\ncrop tool) renders and behaves as designed -- see D-40 in\ndocs/90-deferred-register.md.","tree":{"sha":"da580017c17947a13738046f8fcce97aed20383d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/da580017c17947a13738046f8fcce97aed20383d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/ab884b0698f46707de8ec088a22220c3a0cb19b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/ab884b0698f46707de8ec088a22220c3a0cb19b4","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKGFiODg0YjA2OThmNDY3MDdkZThlYzA4OGEyMjIyMGMzYTBjYjE5YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/e758b65b2913ea9ac55902787d4f57fa962c2a7d","sha":"e758b65b2913ea9ac55902787d4f57fa962c2a7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/e758b65b2913ea9ac55902787d4f57fa962c2a7d"}],"sha":"ab884b0698f46707de8ec088a22220c3a0cb19b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/ab884b0698f46707de8ec088a22220c3a0cb19b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/e758b65b2913ea9ac55902787d4f57fa962c2a7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T16:19:04Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T16:19:04Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Redesign editor UI: darkroom safelight palette on shadcn/ui\n\nPhase 2''s editor was functionally complete but visually still the\ncreate-next-app scaffold. Replaces it with a design built for the\nsubject: dark chrome for the real reason pro photo tools use it (not\nbiasing color/exposure judgment), a safelight amber-red accent instead\nof a generic dark-mode neon, and center-zero \"instrument sliders\" that\nmatch composite params'' actual -N..N domain instead of a generic\nleft-to-right fill.\n\nAdopted shadcn/ui (Radix-backed Slider/Switch/ToggleGroup/Input/Label)\nfor keyboard/a11y semantics instead of hand-rolling native-input\nstyling; Slider is customized for single-thumb + bipolar center fill.\nTokens ended up global (shadcn''s own :root/.dark convention) rather\nthan scoped to the editor, so preview-demo and the still-unlinked\ndefault `/` route pick up the same palette as a side effect.\n\nAlso parks docs/tasks/TASK-presigned-upload.md, the Phase 3 backend\nplan (MinIO + presigned uploads) that''s blocked on Docker locally --\nnot executed this round, kept as the documented next step.\n\nSee docs/tasks/TASK-editor-visual-design.md and new D-39 in\ndocs/90-deferred-register.md (a real browser/visual pass is still\nowed -- Chrome automation wasn''t available in this session).","tree":{"sha":"6d80140e754e54b965f7873af65a3a521397139e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/6d80140e754e54b965f7873af65a3a521397139e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/e758b65b2913ea9ac55902787d4f57fa962c2a7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/e758b65b2913ea9ac55902787d4f57fa962c2a7d","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKGU3NThiNjViMjkxM2VhOWFjNTU5MDI3ODdkNGY1N2ZhOTYyYzJhN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/e85c1c0542782186d147f6f4ab81ca8f4e7bd7a7","sha":"e85c1c0542782186d147f6f4ab81ca8f4e7bd7a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/e85c1c0542782186d147f6f4ab81ca8f4e7bd7a7"}],"sha":"e758b65b2913ea9ac55902787d4f57fa962c2a7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/e758b65b2913ea9ac55902787d4f57fa962c2a7d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/e85c1c0542782186d147f6f4ab81ca8f4e7bd7a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:32:39Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:32:39Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Resolve editor export: synchronous single-image render path (D-37)\n\nCloses the last unimplemented Phase 2 P0 bullet (\"editor export produces\nthe same recipe format Plexus pipelines consume\"). Deliberately bypasses\nthe orchestrator''s async DB/NATS job-dispatch machinery, reserved for\nPhase 3''s \"Apply to Batch\" -- this is synchronous, single-image, and\npersists nothing.\n\n- workers/internal/render.RunRecipe chains processors.Lookup calls in\n  recipe order, reusing the same processors every existing job step\n  already runs.\n- workers/cmd/renderserver: new Go HTTP binary, POST /render (multipart\n  file + recipe JSON), separate from cmd/worker''s NATS consumer so a slow\n  render and a blocked dispatch loop stay independent failure modes.\n- apps/orchestrator''s new ExportModule proxies POST /export to the render\n  server, keeping the orchestrator as the sole API surface apps/web talks\n  to (where auth will eventually gate this, D-4).\n- apps/web/editor gained an Export button; the originally-uploaded File is\n  now retained (previously discarded right after decode) so export sends\n  untouched original bytes, not a canvas re-encode.\n\nSee docs/tasks/TASK-editor-export.md and D-37/D-38 in\ndocs/90-deferred-register.md for what this left open (auth, object\nstorage, Docker/CI wiring for the new binary, a still-owed manual browser\npass).","tree":{"sha":"e1599b5a471e11beebfc2248bed8ef8f043a6ed7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/e1599b5a471e11beebfc2248bed8ef8f043a6ed7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/e85c1c0542782186d147f6f4ab81ca8f4e7bd7a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/e85c1c0542782186d147f6f4ab81ca8f4e7bd7a7","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKGU4NWMxYzA1NDI3ODIxODZkMTQ3ZjZmNGFiODFjYThmNGU3YmQ3YTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/1cecd630e438f260a48c1c5103b41848a58ce0f1","sha":"1cecd630e438f260a48c1c5103b41848a58ce0f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/1cecd630e438f260a48c1c5103b41848a58ce0f1"}],"sha":"e85c1c0542782186d147f6f4ab81ca8f4e7bd7a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/e85c1c0542782186d147f6f4ab81ca8f4e7bd7a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/1cecd630e438f260a48c1c5103b41848a58ce0f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:07:35Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:07:35Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Resolve D-33: crop live-preview parity + editor UI\n\nGeneralizes the live-preview renderers'' geometry handling from\nresize-only (findLastResizeStep, \"last one wins\") to a new\ncomputeGeometryChain that walks recipe.steps in true order and\ncomposes image.crop with image.resize -- the two don''t commute\n(crop''s fractions are relative to whatever image is input to that\nstep), so resize''s old position-agnostic shortcut couldn''t be\nnaively extended to a second geometry processor. No new shaders:\ncrop reuses the existing final-blit UV-rect mechanism on both\nWebGPU/WebGL2 backends.\n\nEditor gets a CropControl drag-to-select tool, decoupled from the\nlive WebGPU/WebGL canvas (which shows the composed geometry, a\nshifting coordinate frame) -- it draws the untouched source bitmap\ninstead, so drags are always in original-source-fraction space.\nRecipe emits image.crop before image.resize.\n\nAlso resolves D-33 in the deferred register, adds D-35/D-36 for\nthe UI''s deferred refinements and why crop needs no new drift\ngolden fixture, and closes the spec''s Open Questions crop\nparagraph.","tree":{"sha":"dd4ee4b80cc4be8e093fd7755106d28fb4fb2ad6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/dd4ee4b80cc4be8e093fd7755106d28fb4fb2ad6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/1cecd630e438f260a48c1c5103b41848a58ce0f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/1cecd630e438f260a48c1c5103b41848a58ce0f1","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDFjZWNkNjMwZTQzOGYyNjBhNDhjMWM1MTAzYjQxODQ4YTU4Y2UwZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/c333aab8fc49c0ba3f26a5bb1e3f27c220ed90df","sha":"c333aab8fc49c0ba3f26a5bb1e3f27c220ed90df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/c333aab8fc49c0ba3f26a5bb1e3f27c220ed90df"}],"sha":"1cecd630e438f260a48c1c5103b41848a58ce0f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/1cecd630e438f260a48c1c5103b41848a58ce0f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/c333aab8fc49c0ba3f26a5bb1e3f27c220ed90df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:53:37Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:53:37Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Fix P0 regression: Saturation slider blanked the WebGPU live preview\n\nADJUST_COLOR_WGSL used \"target\" as a variable name -- a WGSL reserved\nword -- which failed createShaderModule and cascaded to an invalid\nrender pipeline, invalid bind group, and a silently no-op queue.submit\nthe moment a recipe included an image.adjustColor step (i.e. the first\ntouch of the Saturation or Cast slider). No JS exception surfaced since\nWebGPU''s failure here is async/silent, so the canvas just stayed on its\nlast clear (black).\n\nRoot cause confirmed directly from the browser''s DevTools console.\nRenamed target -> greyTarget in the WGSL shader (the actual fix) and,\nfor cross-shader consistency, in the GLSL equivalent and the CPU\nreference (color-math.ts''s applyCast) as well.\n\nNew docs/90-deferred-register.md entry (D-34): no automated test\ncompiles/executes the actual WGSL/GLSL shader source, which is why this\nshipped silently across two prior tasks -- this incident is the first\nconfirmed occurrence of a risk D-30 had already flagged as unverified.","tree":{"sha":"c3abf2ab835a47eb726fb150ecbe125d4f909993","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/c3abf2ab835a47eb726fb150ecbe125d4f909993"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/c333aab8fc49c0ba3f26a5bb1e3f27c220ed90df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/c333aab8fc49c0ba3f26a5bb1e3f27c220ed90df","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKGMzMzNhYWI4ZmM0OWMwYmEzZjI2YTViYjFlM2YyN2MyMjBlZDkwZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/aa258fd9f5dc2a4a1f326084369c2128b714b197","sha":"aa258fd9f5dc2a4a1f326084369c2128b714b197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/aa258fd9f5dc2a4a1f326084369c2128b714b197"}],"sha":"c333aab8fc49c0ba3f26a5bb1e3f27c220ed90df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/c333aab8fc49c0ba3f26a5bb1e3f27c220ed90df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/aa258fd9f5dc2a4a1f326084369c2128b714b197/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:41:15Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:41:15Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Resolve D-22 crop gap: implement image.crop Go-side + schema\n\nNew image.crop processor (workers/internal/processors/crop.go) via govips''s\nexisting ExtractArea, taking normalized 0.0..1.0 x/y/width/height rather than\nabsolute pixels so the same recipe step is correct at both live-preview\nresolution and full-resolution export. No fork extension needed (ExtractArea\nis already public, unlike Tonelut/Gaussnoise). Schema mirrors it\n(apps/web/src/lib/recipe/schema.ts''s cropParamsSchema, with a refine\nenforcing x+width<=1.0 and y+height<=1.0).\n\nLive-preview shader and editor UI intentionally deferred to a follow-up task\n-- see new D-33 in docs/90-deferred-register.md. Docs updated: deferred\nregister (D-22 crop clause resolved, new D-33) and spec''s Open Questions.","tree":{"sha":"419159483dc0702d2a94ca6de9d1da06a5323c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/419159483dc0702d2a94ca6de9d1da06a5323c86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/aa258fd9f5dc2a4a1f326084369c2128b714b197","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/aa258fd9f5dc2a4a1f326084369c2128b714b197","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKGFhMjU4ZmQ5ZjVkYzJhNGExZjMyNjA4NDM2OWMyMTI4YjcxNGIxOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/f44ff01ad76d30e131bcec69fdf6f286d8f5dc60","sha":"f44ff01ad76d30e131bcec69fdf6f286d8f5dc60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/f44ff01ad76d30e131bcec69fdf6f286d8f5dc60"}],"sha":"aa258fd9f5dc2a4a1f326084369c2128b714b197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/aa258fd9f5dc2a4a1f326084369c2128b714b197"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/f44ff01ad76d30e131bcec69fdf6f286d8f5dc60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T08:08:39Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T08:08:39Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Resolve D-31: live-preview shader + editor UI parity for image.blackAndWhite.grain\n\nAdds a sin-hash -> Box-Muller pseudo-random noise pass to both\nwebgpu-renderer.ts and webgl2-renderer.ts so grain (implemented Go-side in\nD-28) now renders live in the editor, plus a direct Grain slider in\nBlackAndWhiteControl.tsx. Deliberately not an attempt to reproduce libvips''\nown vips_gaussnoise PRNG -- only the statistical shape (zero mean, sigma\nscaling with grain) is matched, validated with a new statistical test in\ncolor-math.test.ts rather than drift.test.ts''s per-pixel golden-fixture\nmethodology (D-32: two independent noise realizations of the same sigma\ndisagree by ~40x the existing BW_BOUNDS margin, so per-pixel comparison\nwould be meaningless here). Manually verified live in a real browser via a\nheadless-Chromium Playwright driver against both the WebGPU and WebGL2\nfallback backends -- zero console errors, grain visibly textures a flat\ngradient as the slider moves from 0 to 1 on both paths.","tree":{"sha":"f02fd33df7773db6cc4235036d7db98f1318d28b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/f02fd33df7773db6cc4235036d7db98f1318d28b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/f44ff01ad76d30e131bcec69fdf6f286d8f5dc60","verification":{"paylo