":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/50c07eaff74622c665851bd294a1345de748bc87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T07:34:14Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T07:34:14Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Resolve D-30: live-preview and editor UI parity for image.adjustColor.castStrength\n\nAdds a GPU box-downsample-pyramid mean reduction to both webgpu-renderer.ts\nand webgl2-renderer.ts so the grey-world white-balance correction landed\nGo-side in D-27 now renders live in the editor, plus a direct Cast slider\nin ColorControl.tsx. Drift measured against real govips output (effectively\nbit-exact on the CPU reference path); no bound widening needed.","tree":{"sha":"38c061fb54a2bd7c29db0fa9929d51d2d34e490e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/38c061fb54a2bd7c29db0fa9929d51d2d34e490e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/50c07eaff74622c665851bd294a1345de748bc87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/50c07eaff74622c665851bd294a1345de748bc87","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDUwYzA3ZWFmZjc0NjIyYzY2NTg1MWJkMjk0YTEzNDVkZTc0OGJjODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/73cc689e125c42470b15f5b8b369d0df0de942e6","sha":"73cc689e125c42470b15f5b8b369d0df0de942e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/73cc689e125c42470b15f5b8b369d0df0de942e6"}],"sha":"50c07eaff74622c665851bd294a1345de748bc87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/50c07eaff74622c665851bd294a1345de748bc87"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/73cc689e125c42470b15f5b8b369d0df0de942e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T07:14:56Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T07:14:56Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Resolve D-27: implement image.adjustColor.castStrength grey-world white balance\n\nAdds castStrength (0.0..1.0, optional/default 0.0) to adjustColorParamsSchema\nand implements it in the Go AdjustColor processor as a grey-world correction:\nper-band R/G/B means via ExtractBandToImage+Average, scaled toward their mean\nvia Linear, blended by castStrength. Verified against real govips v2.18.0 /\nlibvips 8.18.5 that Stats()+GetPoint on the stats image relies on undocumented\nzero-padding (used ExtractBandToImage+Average instead) and that vips_linear\nrequires a coefficient vector of length 1 or exactly Bands() (alpha gets an\nidentity coefficient). Preview shader and editor UI intentionally deferred,\ntracked as new D-30 (same two-phase split V-7/D-25 used for highlights/shadows).","tree":{"sha":"d660c3aed0794e179e05bc6b0b73294d3b1cb778","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/d660c3aed0794e179e05bc6b0b73294d3b1cb778"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/73cc689e125c42470b15f5b8b369d0df0de942e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/73cc689e125c42470b15f5b8b369d0df0de942e6","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDczY2M2ODllMTI1YzQyNDcwYjE1ZjViOGIzNjlkMGRmMGRlOTQyZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/82a73c1bb75a302b49f0179aa0e9e99dca684d3f","sha":"82a73c1bb75a302b49f0179aa0e9e99dca684d3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/82a73c1bb75a302b49f0179aa0e9e99dca684d3f"}],"sha":"73cc689e125c42470b15f5b8b369d0df0de942e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/73cc689e125c42470b15f5b8b369d0df0de942e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/82a73c1bb75a302b49f0179aa0e9e99dca684d3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T06:58:40Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T06:58:40Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Resolve V-8: research Vibrance/Cast/Grain govips primitives\n\nRan the exhaustive govips API search V-8 called for, against the full\nv2.18.0 module-cache source rather than the fork''s partial copy. Found the\nthree params aren''t the same kind of gap: Cast is fully unblocked today\n(grey-world white balance via Stats/Linear, no fork needed, D-27). Grain\nneeds a small govips-fork extension for a public Gaussnoise wrapper -- same\nprecedent D-24 already established for Tonelut (D-28). Vibrance''s exact\ncurve has no primary-source-correct answer (Adobe/Apple''s are unpublished),\nso it stays a deliberate visual judgment call folded into D-22''s real-photo\ntuning pass rather than an invented formula (D-29).\n\nNo processor/schema/shader implementation in this pass -- findings only,\nplus updating stale V-8 comments across schema.ts, adjust_color.go,\nblack_and_white.go, and ColorControl.tsx to point at the new D-27/D-28/D-29\nentries instead.","tree":{"sha":"6836ff87a7f2f8a698ad7b588acfbfb9d1acbeb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/6836ff87a7f2f8a698ad7b588acfbfb9d1acbeb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/82a73c1bb75a302b49f0179aa0e9e99dca684d3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/82a73c1bb75a302b49f0179aa0e9e99dca684d3f","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDgyYTczYzFiYjc1YTMwMmI0OWYwMTc5YWEwZTllOTlkY2E2ODRkM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/8096e04346524fa40567f189c36809e52c5c485f","sha":"8096e04346524fa40567f189c36809e52c5c485f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/8096e04346524fa40567f189c36809e52c5c485f"}],"sha":"82a73c1bb75a302b49f0179aa0e9e99dca684d3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/82a73c1bb75a302b49f0179aa0e9e99dca684d3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/8096e04346524fa40567f189c36809e52c5c485f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T06:50:17Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T06:50:17Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Resolve D-25: live-preview and editor UI parity for adjustLight highlights/shadows\n\nPorts libvips'' tonelut curve (confirmed from libvips/create/tonelut.c) into\nthe WebGPU/WebGL2 preview shaders as two smoothstep() calls, extends\ncolor-math.ts''s applyAdjustLight with the same Lab-space math, generalizes\nboth renderers'' uniform-passing helpers to carry more than 4 floats, and\nadds manual Highlights/Shadows sliders to LightControl.tsx. Also fixes a\nreal bug in editor/page.tsx''s deriveRecipe, which only emitted an\nimage.adjustLight step when the original four params were nonzero.\n\nDrift measured against two new isolated gendriftgolden points\n(light-shadows-strong, light-highlights-strong) rather than assumed; both\nland well inside the existing LIGHT_BOUNDS.","tree":{"sha":"4c306ad1bd1924ce1691956627218be8de1d586e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/4c306ad1bd1924ce1691956627218be8de1d586e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/8096e04346524fa40567f189c36809e52c5c485f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/8096e04346524fa40567f189c36809e52c5c485f","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDgwOTZlMDQzNDY1MjRmYTQwNTY3ZjE4OWMzNjgwOWU1MmM1YzQ4NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/016c6bd10c5fe0585ea978e0e239de7280794821","sha":"016c6bd10c5fe0585ea978e0e239de7280794821","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/016c6bd10c5fe0585ea978e0e239de7280794821"}],"sha":"8096e04346524fa40567f189c36809e52c5c485f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/8096e04346524fa40567f189c36809e52c5c485f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/016c6bd10c5fe0585ea978e0e239de7280794821/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T06:34:29Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T06:34:29Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Resolve V-7: implement image.adjustLight highlights/shadows via a local govips tonelut fork\n\ngovips has no exported Tonelut wrapper and never will without a fork -\nImageRef''s internals are unexported, so libvips'' own recommended\ntonelut->maplut shadows/highlights pipeline can''t be reached from outside\nthe vips package. Added a minimal local fork (workers/internal/govips-fork,\nwired in via a go.mod replace) exporting just Tonelut, verified against\nlibvips'' own upstream source for tonelut''s parameter semantics and LABS\nband-0 encoding.\n\nTesting caught a real bug the design didn''t anticipate: applying the LUT to\nthe whole 3-band LABS image via maplut''s band option corrupts the untouched\na/b bands, because libvips relabels the entire output image''s BandFmt to\nthe LUT''s format regardless of which band was mapped. Fixed via\nExtractBandToImage -> Maplut -> BandJoin -> CopyChangingInterpretation\ninstead.","tree":{"sha":"88d3f410bd8e9448c881ed2f631b5cf14c5497d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/88d3f410bd8e9448c881ed2f631b5cf14c5497d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/016c6bd10c5fe0585ea978e0e239de7280794821","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/016c6bd10c5fe0585ea978e0e239de7280794821","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDAxNmM2YmQxMGM1ZmUwNTg1ZWE5NzhlMGUyMzlkZTcyODA3OTQ4MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/b5efcc7d3d65d2145b2b6136df80584dba423b64","sha":"b5efcc7d3d65d2145b2b6136df80584dba423b64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/b5efcc7d3d65d2145b2b6136df80584dba423b64"}],"sha":"016c6bd10c5fe0585ea978e0e239de7280794821","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/016c6bd10c5fe0585ea978e0e239de7280794821"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/b5efcc7d3d65d2145b2b6136df80584dba423b64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T05:56:02Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T05:56:02Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Measure image.resize preview/export drift and resolve V-6\n\nConfirmed against libvips'' own source (resample/{thumbnail,resize}.c) that\ngovips''s Thumbnail() resamples with Lanczos3 while the live preview''s GPU\ntexture sampler is hardware bilinear -- a real algorithmic mismatch, not a\nrounding gap. Extended the recipe-fidelity drift harness with a resize\ngolden group (3 fit/scale points) and a test-local bilinear-resample\nreference mirroring the renderers'' actual blit-pass math. Measured drift is\nan order of magnitude worse than the composite controls (worst case mae=7.92,\nmax=99.25/255, meanDeltaE=3.70) -- accepted as debt (new D-23) rather than\nbuilt around, since a multi-tap Lanczos shader isn''t justified before this\nmeasurement existed.","tree":{"sha":"cf808c80054dcf8f4c931dfd8e0e8d6c0d3ea199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/cf808c80054dcf8f4c931dfd8e0e8d6c0d3ea199"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/b5efcc7d3d65d2145b2b6136df80584dba423b64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/b5efcc7d3d65d2145b2b6136df80584dba423b64","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKGI1ZWZjYzdkM2Q2NWQyMTQ1YjJiNjEzNmRmODA1ODRkYmE0MjNiNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/c6010d236d7d25631137363ebcd7c96066e4107f","sha":"c6010d236d7d25631137363ebcd7c96066e4107f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/c6010d236d7d25631137363ebcd7c96066e4107f"}],"sha":"b5efcc7d3d65d2145b2b6136df80584dba423b64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/b5efcc7d3d65d2145b2b6136df80584dba423b64"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/c6010d236d7d25631137363ebcd7c96066e4107f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T05:36:02Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T05:36:02Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Guard atan2(0,0) in the Color composite preview (Phase 2)\n\natan2(0,0) is well-defined in JS but undefined in WGSL/GLSL, causing\nNaN -> black-pixel corruption on achromatic (sky/highlight) regions\nwhen Saturation is applied. Guard the hue computation behind a\nchroma > CHROMA_EPSILON check in all three implementations.","tree":{"sha":"0ae465f8f1816a5e4365939377cf30b742cd89cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/0ae465f8f1816a5e4365939377cf30b742cd89cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/c6010d236d7d25631137363ebcd7c96066e4107f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/c6010d236d7d25631137363ebcd7c96066e4107f","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKGM2MDEwZDIzNmQ3ZDI1NjMxMTM3MzYzZWJjZDdjOTYwNjZlNDEwN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/ea238ce41eec0dac19f213cf488d638d4d157cf8","sha":"ea238ce41eec0dac19f213cf488d638d4d157cf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/comm