ocessor ids with a P0 param subset mapped to concrete govips calls;\nflags the Highlights/Shadows govips gap (V-7) and Vibrance/Cast/Grain\n(V-8) as genuinely unresearched rather than guessed at. Schema and Go\nimplementation are follow-on work (D-19), not done here.","tree":{"sha":"6e6f91e8a78d2fc7b9973db25c214a102704119e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/6e6f91e8a78d2fc7b9973db25c214a102704119e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/3be3a0cd51e82497b600910675776f83180eb979","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/3be3a0cd51e82497b600910675776f83180eb979","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDNiZTNhMGNkNTFlODI0OTdiNjAwOTEwNjc1Nzc2ZjgzMTgwZWI5Nzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/83bb6499b24d48f7518f5a95e68050d2c7062116","sha":"83bb6499b24d48f7518f5a95e68050d2c7062116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/83bb6499b24d48f7518f5a95e68050d2c7062116"}],"sha":"3be3a0cd51e82497b600910675776f83180eb979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/3be3a0cd51e82497b600910675776f83180eb979"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/83bb6499b24d48f7518f5a95e68050d2c7062116/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T03:29:06Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T03:29:06Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Add WebGPU/WebGL2 dual-path live preview renderer (Phase 2)\n\nShared PreviewRenderer interface with a WebGPU (WGSL) and a WebGL2 (GLSL\nES 3.00) backend, runtime capability detection (requestAdapter probing,\nnot UA sniffing), and pure fit-geometry math shared by both backends for\nimage.resize''s inside/cover modes. image.convert/image.compress render\nas a visual passthrough -- no shader simulates lossy-encoding artifacts.\nA minimal preview-demo route proves both backends render correctly and\nroute as expected; verified against a real headless Chromium run.","tree":{"sha":"f52eec4fc04b42329a1efdfb3c6359c49cb97bcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/f52eec4fc04b42329a1efdfb3c6359c49cb97bcb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/83bb6499b24d48f7518f5a95e68050d2c7062116","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/83bb6499b24d48f7518f5a95e68050d2c7062116","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDgzYmI2NDk5YjI0ZDQ4Zjc1MThmNWE5NWU2ODA1MGQyYzcwNjIxMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/1de83d224aa8fdbe8f097992a80560a9ab904a9d","sha":"1de83d224aa8fdbe8f097992a80560a9ab904a9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/1de83d224aa8fdbe8f097992a80560a9ab904a9d"}],"sha":"83bb6499b24d48f7518f5a95e68050d2c7062116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/83bb6499b24d48f7518f5a95e68050d2c7062116"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/1de83d224aa8fdbe8f097992a80560a9ab904a9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T03:05:10Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T03:05:10Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Add Edit Recipe schema for the editor (Phase 2)\n\nZod-based Recipe/RecipeStep type in apps/web, structurally mirroring the\norchestrator''s pipeline step shape (StepDto/PipelineStepDefinition) for the\nthree Phase 1 image processors, with typed per-processor params for the\nupcoming preview renderer and composite-slider work. Kept inside apps/web\nrather than packages/ until Phase 3 gives the orchestrator a reason to\nconsume it too (D-1, new D-17). Also sets up Vitest per Next.js''s current\ntesting docs, apps/web''s first test runner.","tree":{"sha":"e3d1cd3cd2d0c11a44a8b6d5340b0a6196a93004","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/e3d1cd3cd2d0c11a44a8b6d5340b0a6196a93004"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/1de83d224aa8fdbe8f097992a80560a9ab904a9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/1de83d224aa8fdbe8f097992a80560a9ab904a9d","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDFkZTgzZDIyNGFhOGZkYmU4ZjA5Nzk5MmE4MDU2MGE5YWI5MDRhOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/5d8496eb1682ba30951f118a4de2842da1e8a427","sha":"5d8496eb1682ba30951f118a4de2842da1e8a427","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/5d8496eb1682ba30951f118a4de2842da1e8a427"}],"sha":"1de83d224aa8fdbe8f097992a80560a9ab904a9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/1de83d224aa8fdbe8f097992a80560a9ab904a9d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/5d8496eb1682ba30951f118a4de2842da1e8a427/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T02:49:14Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T02:49:14Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Scaffold apps/web with Next.js 16.3 (Phase 2 start)\n\nRe-verifies the spec''s WebGPU support claim against current MDN/caniuse/\ngpuweb sources: Firefox lacks default support on most platforms today,\nso the Canvas2D/WebGL2 fallback is promoted to a first-class parallel\npreview implementation rather than a rare-case stub. Resolves V-1,\nupdates the spec''s Open Questions, and closes the apps/web portion of\nD-1 in the deferred register.\n\napps/web is scaffolded via the official Next.js CLI (TypeScript, App\nRouter, Tailwind, ESLint, src/ dir) with no editor/WebGPU code yet,\nmatching the incremental-slice pattern used for Phase 1.","tree":{"sha":"c085268d0a3d721fdbfaa076094107a109331218","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/c085268d0a3d721fdbfaa076094107a109331218"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/5d8496eb1682ba30951f118a4de2842da1e8a427","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/5d8496eb1682ba30951f118a4de2842da1e8a427","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDVkODQ5NmViMTY4MmJhMzA5NTFmMTE4YTRkZTI4NDJkYTFlOGE0Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/8c8dc1fef2125fb4417f7eac1fd71f03920a3d99","sha":"8c8dc1fef2125fb4417f7eac1fd71f03920a3d99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/8c8dc1fef2125fb4417f7eac1fd71f03920a3d99"}],"sha":"5d8496eb1682ba30951f118a4de2842da1e8a427","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/5d8496eb1682ba30951f118a4de2842da1e8a427"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/8c8dc1fef2125fb4417f7eac1fd71f03920a3d99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T02:33:20Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T02:33:20Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Add CI workflow and worker Dockerfile (Phase 1, slice 5)\n\nCloses D-12: nothing previously installed libvips/ffmpeg outside local\ndev, so neither test suite nor a build image was ever exercised in a\nclean environment. Adds .github/workflows/ci.yml (orchestrator: pnpm\nlint/build/test; workers: apt libvips-dev/ffmpeg/pkg-config then go\nvet/golangci-lint/test) and workers/Dockerfile (golang:1.26.5-bookworm\nbuilder, debian:bookworm-slim runtime, non-root user). New D-16 tracks\nthat the image isn''t pushed/deployed anywhere yet; new V-4 tracks that\nthe built image''s runtime behavior wasn''t manually smoke-tested inside\na container, since the local Docker daemon went down mid-verification.","tree":{"sha":"fb66d566474962de56c37b9594cd113bc8053349","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/fb66d566474962de56c37b9594cd113bc8053349"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/8c8dc1fef2125fb4417f7eac1fd71f03920a3d99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/8c8dc1fef2125fb4417f7eac1fd71f03920a3d99","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDhjOGRjMWZlZjIxMjVmYjQ0MTdmN2VhYzFmZDcxZjAzOTIwYTNkOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/0d61fd28c93df4bacc5d17634ea3a628f0ba1976","sha":"0d61fd28c93df4bacc5d17634ea3a628f0ba1976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/0d61fd28c93df4bacc5d17634ea3a628f0ba1976"}],"sha":"8c8dc1fef2125fb4417f7eac1fd71f03920a3d99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/8c8dc1fef2125fb4417f7eac1fd71f03920a3d99"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/0d61fd28c93df4bacc5d17634ea3a628f0ba1976/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T01:51:38Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T01:51:38Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Add ffmpeg-backed video/audio processors to the Go worker (Phase 1, slice 4)\n\nvideo.transcode, video.compress, audio.extract, audio.convert now shell out\nto ffmpeg via os/exec (no cgo binding, unlike govips), closing D-14. Fixed\ncodec pairs per container/format only (mp4/h264/aac, webm/vp9/opus,\nmp3/aac/opus/wav) rather than ffmpeg''s full encoder surface, matching slice\n3''s fixed-image-formats precedent. Orchestrator''s BUILTIN_PROCESSORS\nextended to accept the four new ids.","tree":{"sha":"acde147460afb07fe9609f00c030c40f128f819a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/acde147460afb07fe9609f00c030c40f128f819a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/0d61fd28c93df4bacc5d17634ea3a628f0ba1976","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/0d61fd28c93df4bacc5d17634ea3a628f0ba1976","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDBkNjFmZDI4YzkzZGY0YmFjYzVkMTc2MzRlYTNhNjI4ZjBiYTE5NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/15aff94477a0359cf271099235af08e84b101024","sha":"15aff94477a0359cf271099235af08e84b101024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/15aff94477a0359cf271099235af08e84b101024"}],"sha":"0d61fd28c93df4bacc5d17634ea3a628f0ba1976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/0d61fd28c93df4bacc5d17634ea3a628f0ba1976"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/15aff94477a0359cf271099235af08e84b101024/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T01:28:59Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T01:28:59Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Wire real image processors into the Go worker (Phase 1, slice 3)\n\nReplace the always-succeeds dispatch stub with real image.resize,\nimage.convert, and image.compress processors backed by govips/libvips.\nUnknown processor ids and processor validation/execution errors now\nproduce a genuine StepResultFailed, exercising the orchestrator''s\nFAILED job-state path for the first time. inputRef/outputRef are\nlocal filesystem paths under WORKER_STORAGE_DIR as a stand-in for\nobject storage (D-11), scoped and rationale recorded in\ndocs/tasks/TASK-builtin-processors.md and docs/90-deferred-register.md\n(D-11..D-14).","tree":{"sha":"b97ddb3fb4ec839d5451ce8a38f0d28ccc00ef66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/b97ddb3fb4ec839d5451ce8a38f0d28ccc00ef66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/15aff94477a0359cf271099235af08e84b101024","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/15aff94477a0359cf271099235af08e84b101024","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDE1YWZmOTQ0NzdhMDM1OWNmMjcxMDk5MjM1YWYwOGU4NGIxMDEwMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/a78362466d609ced898f1d8649acad70b81c00c2","sha":"a78362466d609ced898f1d8649acad70b81c00c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/a78362466d609ced898f1d8649acad70b81c00c2"}],"sha":"15aff94477a0359cf271099235af08e84b101024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/15aff94477a0359cf271099235af08e84b101024"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/a78362466d609ced898f1d8649acad70b81c00c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T00:18:55Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T00:18:55Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Add NATS JetStream job dispatch loop (Phase 1, slice 2)\n\nWires the orchestrator-worker dispatch/result loop end-to-end over real\nNATS JetStream: JobsService.create() now dispatches the first step\nimmediately, a stub Go worker consumes and echoes a completion result,\nand JobResultConsumerService advances the job state machine on receipt\n- including safe redelivery handling, proven by an integration test\nthat forces a real crash-then-redeliver cycle. Real ffmpeg/libvips\nprocessing is deferred to the next task; this one only proves the\ntransport and message contract.","tree":{"sha":"bfbe9f598fed33b8078c93ec171d8a247e682e08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/bfbe9f598fed33b8078c93ec171d8a247e682e08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/a78362466d609ced898f1d8649acad70b81c00c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/a78362466d609ced898f1d8649acad70b81c00c2","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKGE3ODM2MjQ2NmQ2MDljZWQ4OThmMWQ4NjQ5YWNhZDcwYjgxYzAwYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/0852cbcba498ef048f2f2157e7f63c366ee6f033","sha":"0852cbcba498ef048f2f2157e7f63c366ee6f033","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/0852cbcba498ef048f2f2157e7f63c366ee6f033"}],"sha":"a78362466d609ced898f1d8649acad70b81c00c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/a78362466d609ced898f1d8649acad70b81c00c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/0852cbcba498ef048f2f2157e7f63c366ee6f033/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T23:33:53Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T23:33:53Z","email":"benitopedro21@outlook.com","name":"Benito Pedro"},"message":"Add orchestrator job state machine (Phase 1, slice 1)\n\nAdds the Postgres persistence layer (Drizzle ORM, chosen over Prisma for\nPostGIS headroom) and NestJS pipelines/jobs modules: linear-DAG validation,\njob/step state machines with explicit legal-transition tables, and\ntestcontainers-backed integration tests against real Postgres. No NATS\ndispatch or Go worker execution yet — that''s the next slice.\n\nAlso codifies commit conventions in CLAUDE.md §4.1 per user request: commit\nautomatically once a task doc''s work is verified, never with a\nCo-Authored-By trailer.","tree":{"sha":"a2f4a29826770cff355f1ac76ac9f6bd49401a5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/trees/a2f4a29826770cff355f1ac76ac9f6bd49401a5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/git/commits/0852cbcba498ef048f2f2157e7f63c366ee6f033","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74267887?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13","id":74267887,"login":"BenitoPedro13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjY3ODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenitoPedro13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/0852cbcba498ef048f2f2157e7f63c366ee6f033","node_id":"C_kwDOTwiGm9oAKDA4NTJjYmNiYTQ5OGVmMDQ4ZjJmMjE1N2U3ZjYzYzM2NmVlNmYwMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commit/02ff602a305083e72664af4a5908daf018b2b459","sha":"02ff602a305083e72664af4a5908daf018b2b459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/02ff602a305083e72664af4a5908daf018b2b459"}],"sha":"0852cbcba498ef048f2f2157e7f63c366ee6f033","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenitoPedro13/plexus/commits/0852cbcba498ef048f2f2157e7f63c366ee6f033"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://ava